(1910072, 262214, 43463, '<td valign="top">I like the candid capture here of the musician in action playing the saxophone. The colors are very good too - the predominent reds and the black hues really pop off the page. My only critique is that you could have easily cropped this more so the sole focus is the musician playing the saxaphone - the person on the right hand side is a distraction and adds nothing to the overall image.</td>', 'I like the candid capture here of the musician in action playing the saxophone. The colors are very good too - the predominent reds and the black hues really pop off the page. My only critique is that you could have easily cropped this more so the sole focus is the musician playing the saxaphone - the person on the right hand side is a distraction and adds nothing to the overall image.', '2005-12-01 00:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
