(1910515, 263760, 29269, '<td valign="top">Hmm, this one has been already analyzed in the forums. And not in a pretty way. For some reason, not only it is no longer anonymous, but you''ve received comments on the improvement already from other members, including Joey''s advice on applying grunge dodging &amp; burning....<br/>Still, I''ll vote as if I haven''t seen this one before as no rules were broken: too dark for my taste. Nice touch on the eyes. Slightly (or apperas to be) blown white stripes in the headband - cast into pinkish shade. Nose could have been burned a bit to reduce the glare.</td>', 'Hmm, this one has been already analyzed in the forums. And not in a pretty way. For some reason, not only it is no longer anonymous, but you''ve received comments on the improvement already from other members, including Joey''s advice on applying grunge dodging & burning....Still, I''ll vote as if I haven''t seen this one before as no rules were broken: too dark for my taste. Nice touch on the eyes. Slightly (or apperas to be) blown white stripes in the headband - cast into pinkish shade. Nose could have been burned a bit to reduce the glare.', '2005-12-01 01:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
