(1910905, 263806, 35545, '<td valign="top">This picture has a lot going for it, maybe too much.  I feel as if I am looking at two pictures -- the bird in calm water at the bottom and the bird with power plant at the top.  Actually, I think you could have cropped it above the second bird.  That power plant doesn''t add a lot to the picture, and you still have the rainbow.</td>', 'This picture has a lot going for it, maybe too much.  I feel as if I am looking at two pictures -- the bird in calm water at the bottom and the bird with power plant at the top.  Actually, I think you could have cropped it above the second bird.  That power plant doesn''t add a lot to the picture, and you still have the rainbow.', '2005-12-01 03:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
