(1911003, 263227, 22781, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of "Samara" by Kiwiness.<br/>However for me the hard light on the armdoesn''t work.</td>', 'This reminds me of "Samara" by Kiwiness.However for me the hard light on the armdoesn''t work.', '2005-12-01 03:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911005, 261418, 22781, '<td valign="top">A nice portrait of a nice lady.<br/>A bit on the soft side, but hey, I like soft ;)<br/>To bad her beautifull dark hair blends in with the background, a hairlight and/or rimlight to give it a more 3d effect and seperate her from the background would have worked here I guess...</td>', 'A nice portrait of a nice lady.A bit on the soft side, but hey, I like soft ;)To bad her beautifull dark hair blends in with the background, a hairlight and/or rimlight to give it a more 3d effect and seperate her from the background would have worked here I guess...', '2005-12-01 03:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911008, 260730, 35786, '<td valign="top">the colors here are goegeous! I thought that it might be neatimage but being from arizona I should guess that snow really is that smooth looking. maybe a bit over sharpened but you can only see it in the foreground twigs. seeing that this is advanced editing I would have gone back with my history brush over those areas haloed with the effect... still an awesome image. 9 for now</td>', 'the colors here are goegeous! I thought that it might be neatimage but being from arizona I should guess that snow really is that smooth looking. maybe a bit over sharpened but you can only see it in the foreground twigs. seeing that this is advanced editing I would have gone back with my history brush over those areas haloed with the effect... still an awesome image. 9 for now', '2005-12-01 03:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911010, 253317, 22781, '<td valign="top">Now THIS is a portrait I like. I am not guessing anymore, but if I would have to guess I would say a young photographer from Iceland....</td>', 'Now THIS is a portrait I like. I am not guessing anymore, but if I would have to guess I would say a young photographer from Iceland....', '2005-12-01 03:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911012, 264027, 35786, '<td valign="top">I might have out a little blur on this to rid the pixelation but what a lovely image! 8</td>', 'I might have out a little blur on this to rid the pixelation but what a lovely image! 8', '2005-12-01 03:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911013, 260489, 46510, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.  Very strong mood. The subjects legs make an interesting lead-in, and the tilt adds interest for me.  Nicely done. 9.</td>', 'This is a great shot.  Very strong mood. The subjects legs make an interesting lead-in, and the tilt adds interest for me.  Nicely done. 9.', '2005-12-01 03:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
