(1911032, 263048, 46510, '<td valign="top">This image has all the elements that make black and white beautiful for me.   Very nicely done.</td>', 'This image has all the elements that make black and white beautiful for me.   Very nicely done.', '2005-12-01 03:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911035, 257902, 21714, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done. Love the focus, detail and colours. A bit uncomfortable with where it''s cutting off at the top, still love the result.</td>', 'Beautifully done. Love the focus, detail and colours. A bit uncomfortable with where it''s cutting off at the top, still love the result.', '2005-12-01 03:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911037, 264097, 21714, '<td valign="top">Nice work. Love the perspective and lighting. Well done.</td>', 'Nice work. Love the perspective and lighting. Well done.', '2005-12-01 03:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911039, 260010, 7531, '<td valign="top">Love this, URBAN shots like this really do bring us in to the moern era of photography, well done =</td>', 'Love this, URBAN shots like this really do bring us in to the moern era of photography, well done =', '2005-12-01 03:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911041, 264174, 21714, '<td valign="top">Very good observation and study. There''s a lot to admire about this image. Nice.</td>', 'Very good observation and study. There''s a lot to admire about this image. Nice.', '2005-12-01 03:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911043, 260700, 7531, '<td valign="top">As seascapes go, it''s ok, but you have obviously cropped the image from the shape. It''s a little too underexposed on the right hand side also. Good effort</td>', 'As seascapes go, it''s ok, but you have obviously cropped the image from the shape. It''s a little too underexposed on the right hand side also. Good effort', '2005-12-01 03:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911047, 264173, 21714, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!</td>', 'Wonderful!', '2005-12-01 03:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911048, 263012, 7531, '<td valign="top">Would have been better with slightly less of a soft vingette</td>', 'Would have been better with slightly less of a soft vingette', '2005-12-01 03:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911049, 263751, 17507, '<td valign="top">This could only be Arches. Such a stunningly beautiful place, and I imagine November is a much more sensible time to visit than when I did in July! <br/> <br/>Since the landscape is rather stark, the inclusion of the moon is an important compositional element--and since this is so, the moon would be in a compositionally much better place if it were closer to the other elements of your image (the red rock fins). If you had taken this picture maybe half an hour before, the moon would be in a much better spot. Perhaps then the sun would have been too high for there to be the light you were looking for - so maybe this was just a tough shot with the moon in the phase that it was. <br/> <br/>I want to like this photo, because it''s of a beautiful place, but the placement of the moon makes it hard. My eye keeps getting pulled straight to the top of the frame, far from anything else in the image, to the point that I can barely even concentrate on the rocks.  Even though it would make the photo bottom-heavy, you might have been better off cropping out the moon.</td>', 'This could only be Arches. Such a stunningly beautiful place, and I imagine November is a much more sensible time to visit than when I did in July!  Since the landscape is rather stark, the inclusion of the moon is an important compositional element--and since this is so, the moon would be in a compositionally much better place if it were closer to the other elements of your image (the red rock fins). If you had taken this picture maybe half an hour before, the moon would be in a much better spot. Perhaps then the sun would have been too high for there to be the light you were looking for - so maybe this was just a tough shot with the moon in the phase that it was.  I want to like this photo, because it''s of a beautiful place, but the placement of the moon makes it hard. My eye keeps getting pulled straight to the top of the frame, far from anything else in the image, to the point that I can barely even concentrate on the rocks.  Even though it would make the photo bottom-heavy, you might have been better off cropping out the moon.', '2005-12-01 03:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911051, 264081, 7531, '<td valign="top">THis is too tightly cropped for my liking. More face and less of the lowerhand into the lens, might even be better in B&amp;W</td>', 'THis is too tightly cropped for my liking. More face and less of the lowerhand into the lens, might even be better in B&W', '2005-12-01 03:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911052, 263806, 7531, '<td valign="top">Neat, although I suspect underexposed in the camera?</td>', 'Neat, although I suspect underexposed in the camera?', '2005-12-01 03:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911053, 263505, 6349, '<td valign="top">This is as beautiful and classic as landscape photography comes.  A beautiful professional quality shot that could sell in any giftshop or be displayed on any nature calendar.  I''m thinking November.  :) 10</td>', 'This is as beautiful and classic as landscape photography comes.  A beautiful professional quality shot that could sell in any giftshop or be displayed on any nature calendar.  I''m thinking November.  :) 10', '2005-12-01 03:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911061, 263856, 7531, '<td valign="top">The trees are nice as are the reflections, although the colours in the background are a little too dry, perhaps a little more red might be appropriate.</td>', 'The trees are nice as are the reflections, although the colours in the background are a little too dry, perhaps a little more red might be appropriate.', '2005-12-01 04:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911064, 263833, 21714, '<td valign="top">Would love to get a shot like this. You have made it look so good.</td>', 'Would love to get a shot like this. You have made it look so good.', '2005-12-01 04:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911070, 263654, 10268, '<td valign="top">Little bit too dark, in my opinion.  Not knowing anything about where and how this was taken, it seems to me like you need a much better composition.</td>', 'Little bit too dark, in my opinion.  Not knowing anything about where and how this was taken, it seems to me like you need a much better composition.', '2005-12-01 04:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911071, 264145, 17507, '<td valign="top">wow, what an amazing amount of detail. it must have been tough to get this under 150KB.  (I see that at 147.99 you''re just under the wire!) Your colors and clarity are excellent, but the composition is weak. I find there''s really nowhere for my eye to settle when I look at this picture; there''s no visual anchor. These trees are beautiful and your reasons for pressing the shutter button are clear, but in order for a photo to have a strong impact it must have a focal point. - 6</td>', 'wow, what an amazing amount of detail. it must have been tough to get this under 150KB.  (I see that at 147.99 you''re just under the wire!) Your colors and clarity are excellent, but the composition is weak. I find there''s really nowhere for my eye to settle when I look at this picture; there''s no visual anchor. These trees are beautiful and your reasons for pressing the shutter button are clear, but in order for a photo to have a strong impact it must have a focal point. - 6', '2005-12-01 04:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
