(1911305, 263970, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very nice.  Criticism; I''m sure the size doesn''t do this justice, but (and especially at this size) more detail/contrast with the trees and steeple(?) would have made this better in my opinion.  Like the centered composition and think that cropped tighter top or bottom would also likely yield two good shots with slightly different ''feels'' too.  Just like to see it ''pop'' more, as subtle as the scene/theme is.</td>', '7 - Very nice.  Criticism; I''m sure the size doesn''t do this justice, but (and especially at this size) more detail/contrast with the trees and steeple(?) would have made this better in my opinion.  Like the centered composition and think that cropped tighter top or bottom would also likely yield two good shots with slightly different ''feels'' too.  Just like to see it ''pop'' more, as subtle as the scene/theme is.', '2005-12-01 06:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
