(1911337, 263569, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice effect.  Criticism; apologies if wrong, but seems needs a nudge rotation up on the left, ''field'' doesn''t seem level, but could be a slope, makes no difference to my score.  Depending what you had to work with, if there were more birds ''up the top'' of the frame I think possibly a bit more height here could have helped this, but not sure as I like the ''wide'' framing, just difficult to appreciate fully at this size.</td>', '7 - Nice effect.  Criticism; apologies if wrong, but seems needs a nudge rotation up on the left, ''field'' doesn''t seem level, but could be a slope, makes no difference to my score.  Depending what you had to work with, if there were more birds ''up the top'' of the frame I think possibly a bit more height here could have helped this, but not sure as I like the ''wide'' framing, just difficult to appreciate fully at this size.', '2005-12-01 06:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911339, 263048, 28299, '<td valign="top">stark beauty - very lovely - 9</td>', 'stark beauty - very lovely - 9', '2005-12-01 06:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
