(1911384, 256368, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good capture, good colors.  Criticism; can''t tell if this is ''as is'' or should be rotated, given their positions, could be either.  Knowing the size of these fish, and how difficult aquarium shots are, seems you have done well.  The colors are strong but do seem a bit ''dark'', from what I know of these fish, but apologies if they are naturally this dark.  Difficult, but also even more sharpness on the fish, as is on the coral just behind them, would have made this even better in my opinion.  Not sure on the frame, especially the orange inner.</td>', '6 - Good capture, good colors.  Criticism; can''t tell if this is ''as is'' or should be rotated, given their positions, could be either.  Knowing the size of these fish, and how difficult aquarium shots are, seems you have done well.  The colors are strong but do seem a bit ''dark'', from what I know of these fish, but apologies if they are naturally this dark.  Difficult, but also even more sharpness on the fish, as is on the coral just behind them, would have made this even better in my opinion.  Not sure on the frame, especially the orange inner.', '2005-12-01 07:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
