(1911407, 262186, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very good.   Criticism; just to contradict what I said in another shot, I think in this one, a slightly sharper focus on the feathers/body could have made this even better in my opinion, although, this is good as is, and gives a different view/perspective of the flamingo, concentrating on it''s head/face etc more.  Just be two different ''feel'' shots, obviously, had the focus been on the feathers.  Either way, even more detail/texture/etc (camera/lens dependent) would also make it even better in my opinion.  Very good though. edit: wording &amp; sorry you did not find my comment helpful<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-08 18:07:20.</i></td>', '8 - Very good.   Criticism; just to contradict what I said in another shot, I think in this one, a slightly sharper focus on the feathers/body could have made this even better in my opinion, although, this is good as is, and gives a different view/perspective of the flamingo, concentrating on it''s head/face etc more.  Just be two different ''feel'' shots, obviously, had the focus been on the feathers.  Either way, even more detail/texture/etc (camera/lens dependent) would also make it even better in my opinion.  Very good though. edit: wording & sorry you did not find my comment helpful', '2005-12-01 07:12:27.000000', '2005-12-08 18:07:20.000000', 1),
