(1911441, 253214, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Like the detail/texture.  Good colors and contrast control.  Criticism; ''if only'' that eye were open more, good like this, but if it were open more or looking ''at'', may have made this even better in my opinion.  The detail is good, but especially on the ''brow'' perhaps the lighting is just a fraction harsh, difficult to tell.  Like the detail in the whiskers.  I think the extra 10 pixels would have helped this, if you had the quality, or else just a ''wider'' crop perhaps.  Has the potential to be a good ''cat abstract'', if that makes any sense, in my opinion.</td>', '6 - Like the detail/texture.  Good colors and contrast control.  Criticism; ''if only'' that eye were open more, good like this, but if it were open more or looking ''at'', may have made this even better in my opinion.  The detail is good, but especially on the ''brow'' perhaps the lighting is just a fraction harsh, difficult to tell.  Like the detail in the whiskers.  I think the extra 10 pixels would have helped this, if you had the quality, or else just a ''wider'' crop perhaps.  Has the potential to be a good ''cat abstract'', if that makes any sense, in my opinion.', '2005-12-01 07:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
