(1911578, 264113, 15711, '<td valign="top">The idea of this is cute.  I think it''s way over saturated.  That usually works with skies, but with the human element, his skin tones are too red and brash.  This might be more effective with less harsh colors and panning back to give more negative space around the subject.</td>', 'The idea of this is cute.  I think it''s way over saturated.  That usually works with skies, but with the human element, his skin tones are too red and brash.  This might be more effective with less harsh colors and panning back to give more negative space around the subject.', '2005-12-01 08:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
