(1911602, 262763, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great post editing.  I like the dim greenish tint to the ground. The sky color adds a touch of pow with the looming black clouds.  Very nice. 9</td>', 'Great post editing.  I like the dim greenish tint to the ground. The sky color adds a touch of pow with the looming black clouds.  Very nice. 9', '2005-12-01 08:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911610, 262431, 40819, '<td valign="top">I love NYC so with that said, this image isn''t spatacular, it''s ok and I am sure getting a helocopter ride early morning was exciting too, but this picture looks more like a tourist image rather then a photographer''s image.<br/>The Jersey shore is blurry and the Hudson as well. It would have been nice to see the shadows of the skyline brought out more. Maybe a change in WB or in exposure would have made this come out sharper and brighter as well. Excellent idea just needs a little tweeking.</td>', 'I love NYC so with that said, this image isn''t spatacular, it''s ok and I am sure getting a helocopter ride early morning was exciting too, but this picture looks more like a tourist image rather then a photographer''s image.The Jersey shore is blurry and the Hudson as well. It would have been nice to see the shadows of the skyline brought out more. Maybe a change in WB or in exposure would have made this come out sharper and brighter as well. Excellent idea just needs a little tweeking.', '2005-12-01 08:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911611, 263963, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the movement and high contrast of this one.  Having the single figure with the fishing rod really makes the shot. The shadow of the rocks might be a tad too much, but the overall composition and impact is still there.</td>', 'I like the movement and high contrast of this one.  Having the single figure with the fishing rod really makes the shot. The shadow of the rocks might be a tad too much, but the overall composition and impact is still there.', '2005-12-01 08:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911613, 263599, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is great.  I wish the gyser weren''t quite so centered, but still it has wonderful impact and the colors are rich and vivid. The two people help give it some balance.  8</td>', 'This is great.  I wish the gyser weren''t quite so centered, but still it has wonderful impact and the colors are rich and vivid. The two people help give it some balance.  8', '2005-12-01 08:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
