(1911834, 263054, 42456, '<td valign="top">The curves in the edge of the pine trees and the gentle slope give the eyes a gracefull line to follow and also balances the image. I like the gradient and soft hues in the colors. I''m not a very emotive person so it''s difficult at best for me to judge that...</td>', 'The curves in the edge of the pine trees and the gentle slope give the eyes a gracefull line to follow and also balances the image. I like the gradient and soft hues in the colors. I''m not a very emotive person so it''s difficult at best for me to judge that...', '2005-12-01 09:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
