(1912026, 255744, 27514, '<td valign="top">very intersting shot. I like it a lot. the light on the right side is too close and blowing out the side of her head. the perspective and facial reactions are great though. I am so glad you went for this shot. the free study was starting to get boring to look at. 9</td>', 'very intersting shot. I like it a lot. the light on the right side is too close and blowing out the side of her head. the perspective and facial reactions are great though. I am so glad you went for this shot. the free study was starting to get boring to look at. 9', '2005-12-01 10:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
