(1913060, 256912, 34192, '<td valign="top">Very striking image.  The gold with the blue works very well.  Composition good.  Very surreal looking. 9-good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Very striking image.  The gold with the blue works very well.  Composition good.  Very surreal looking. 9-good luck in the challenge!', '2005-12-01 14:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
