(1913089, 263629, 29474, '<td valign="top">The right eye and the glasses are a bit distracting. If only you could have been slightly more to the right. Otherwise it is a great capture.</td>', 'The right eye and the glasses are a bit distracting. If only you could have been slightly more to the right. Otherwise it is a great capture.', '2005-12-01 14:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
