(1913131, 263228, 12578, '<td valign="top">Great colours, I did one the same colour cast myself a few weeks back, Would have been nice to actually have a foacl point or a lead in line i.e. some rocks scattered or in a line to lead the eye to the horizon or the orb of the sun just showing perhaps.</td>', 'Great colours, I did one the same colour cast myself a few weeks back, Would have been nice to actually have a foacl point or a lead in line i.e. some rocks scattered or in a line to lead the eye to the horizon or the orb of the sun just showing perhaps.', '2005-12-01 14:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913134, 263812, 32848, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice composition, flowing, leading the eye from front to back, but in a roundabout way.  Interesting sky too.</td>', 'This is a very nice composition, flowing, leading the eye from front to back, but in a roundabout way.  Interesting sky too.', '2005-12-01 14:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913139, 253214, 43380, '<td valign="top">The detail in this shot is great.  I''m sure that the cat is lying down but I''m still drawn to tilting my head to make it out a little better.  Perhaps turning it 90 degrees would make it easier to look at.  However, I still think that it is a strong shot.  The eye color and detail in the whiskers and fur make it a desirable photograph.</td>', 'The detail in this shot is great.  I''m sure that the cat is lying down but I''m still drawn to tilting my head to make it out a little better.  Perhaps turning it 90 degrees would make it easier to look at.  However, I still think that it is a strong shot.  The eye color and detail in the whiskers and fur make it a desirable photograph.', '2005-12-01 14:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
