(1913429, 260078, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very nice.  Criticism; colors are nice but look like they have been ''tweaked'' a fraction too much (apologies if wrong).  Good capture of what appears to be a type of cavern/cave, at least that is what it looks like from this angle.  Like to see more detail in the texture of the very fore wall/rock, but that might be difficult to still be able to retain the focus where you have it as is, so who knows.  This at wall size, the frame might suit, but in my opinion, at this size, it detracts, especially being so thick.</td>', '7 - Very nice.  Criticism; colors are nice but look like they have been ''tweaked'' a fraction too much (apologies if wrong).  Good capture of what appears to be a type of cavern/cave, at least that is what it looks like from this angle.  Like to see more detail in the texture of the very fore wall/rock, but that might be difficult to still be able to retain the focus where you have it as is, so who knows.  This at wall size, the frame might suit, but in my opinion, at this size, it detracts, especially being so thick.', '2005-12-01 16:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
