(1913557, 263514, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good capture and colors.  Criticism; better without the people in my opinion.  If possible, a slightly sharper, ground up, angle/perspective, while still retaining the top of the ''explosion'', may have made this even better, not sure.  I do like this angle, but think either a tighter crop on the left (if this is all you had to work with), or else centering the ''geyser'' better, and possibly some more foreground for added ''context'' (again depending what you had originally), may also have made this even better. edit:spelling<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-08 18:17:02.</i></td>', '7 - Good capture and colors.  Criticism; better without the people in my opinion.  If possible, a slightly sharper, ground up, angle/perspective, while still retaining the top of the ''explosion'', may have made this even better, not sure.  I do like this angle, but think either a tighter crop on the left (if this is all you had to work with), or else centering the ''geyser'' better, and possibly some more foreground for added ''context'' (again depending what you had originally), may also have made this even better. edit:spelling', '2005-12-01 17:02:37.000000', '2005-12-08 18:17:02.000000', 1),
