(1913568, 263930, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good.  Criticism; like the composition but, with this background (including the subtle grain in it), the detail in the ''coon''''s head/snout is diminished in my opinion, so (depending what you had to work with), perhaps a tighter crop on the right, and inclusion of more body on the left, or else just a tighter overall crop (quality dependent) may have made this better.  I imagine trying to ''tweak'' the colors/contrast would have been very difficult given the colors of the ''coon''.  Sharper on the eyes, especially given your title, of course would be better but this is an ''opportune'' type shot and, greater detail is of course camera/lens dependent.</td>', '7 - Good.  Criticism; like the composition but, with this background (including the subtle grain in it), the detail in the ''coon''''s head/snout is diminished in my opinion, so (depending what you had to work with), perhaps a tighter crop on the right, and inclusion of more body on the left, or else just a tighter overall crop (quality dependent) may have made this better.  I imagine trying to ''tweak'' the colors/contrast would have been very difficult given the colors of the ''coon''.  Sharper on the eyes, especially given your title, of course would be better but this is an ''opportune'' type shot and, greater detail is of course camera/lens dependent.', '2005-12-01 17:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913569, 263889, 42792, '<td valign="top">Like the glistening effect.</td>', 'Like the glistening effect.', '2005-12-01 17:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913570, 256912, 2022, '<td valign="top">Awesome ! (10)</td>', 'Awesome ! (10)', '2005-12-01 17:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913573, 261231, 42792, '<td valign="top">Lovely light and colour.</td>', 'Lovely light and colour.', '2005-12-01 17:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913574, 260082, 18080, '<td valign="top">WOW!!!!<br/>Only marked 37% so far but this stands out way above the rest.<br/>I love this shot so much.<br/>It is perfect on so many levels.<br/>Well done.<br/>Good luck.<br/>10<br/> <br/>Kev</td>', 'WOW!!!!Only marked 37% so far but this stands out way above the rest.I love this shot so much.It is perfect on so many levels.Well done.Good luck.10 Kev', '2005-12-01 17:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913575, 261653, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good sharpness.  Criticism; seems reflection/lighting issues on the head and assuming this is an exhibition/tank set-up, not sure how you could have avoided this - perhaps trying to adjust it in pp after, who knows.  I like the sharpness on the eye, if that could follow through to the tip of the ''nose''/mouth, make this even better in my opinion.  Quality dependent, a tighter and different crop too.  Also seems to be a purple ''tinge'' here and there, but that may again be a result of the artificial lighting. edit:typo<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-08 17:25:34.</i></td>', '6 - Good sharpness.  Criticism; seems reflection/lighting issues on the head and assuming this is an exhibition/tank set-up, not sure how you could have avoided this - perhaps trying to adjust it in pp after, who knows.  I like the sharpness on the eye, if that could follow through to the tip of the ''nose''/mouth, make this even better in my opinion.  Quality dependent, a tighter and different crop too.  Also seems to be a purple ''tinge'' here and there, but that may again be a result of the artificial lighting. edit:typo', '2005-12-01 17:11:42.000000', '2005-12-08 17:25:34.000000', 1),
(1913578, 263974, 47377, '<td valign="top">I find de vertical pine tree rather distracting...</td>', 'I find de vertical pine tree rather distracting...', '2005-12-01 17:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913580, 263938, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Good perspective.  Criticism; depending of course what you had to work with, the feet (especially front four) all showing/not ''cut'', and trying to get the head in just a little more focus (wouldn''t even have to be sharp to make this still a good shot in my opinion) would have made this better.  Given ''advanced editing'', those 2 or 3 ''spots'' upper right and middle bottom, could/should have been cloned out.  Difficult with contrast issues (and maybe cropping out more of the dark ''end body'', who knows), but the green a little more vivid too, would also have made this even better in my opinion. edit:typos<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-08 17:15:37.</i></td>', '5 - Good perspective.  Criticism; depending of course what you had to work with, the feet (especially front four) all showing/not ''cut'', and trying to get the head in just a little more focus (wouldn''t even have to be sharp to make this still a good shot in my opinion) would have made this better.  Given ''advanced editing'', those 2 or 3 ''spots'' upper right and middle bottom, could/should have been cloned out.  Difficult with contrast issues (and maybe cropping out more of the dark ''end body'', who knows), but the green a little more vivid too, would also have made this even better in my opinion. edit:typos', '2005-12-01 17:15:59.000000', '2005-12-08 17:15:37.000000', 1),
(1913581, 255132, 2022, '<td valign="top">Nice macro study, I like the colors and composition, but....the border...just overpowers it...(7)</td>', 'Nice macro study, I like the colors and composition, but....the border...just overpowers it...(7)', '2005-12-01 17:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913582, 263943, 40718, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture, as I look at it though, the halo effect is a minus, not a plus.  Have to knock one point for that.  Still a 7.</td>', 'Excellent picture, as I look at it though, the halo effect is a minus, not a plus.  Have to knock one point for that.  Still a 7.', '2005-12-01 17:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913585, 264090, 43380, '<td valign="top">I am totally in love with this photo!  Lighting, colors, shallow DOF and details are all fantastic.  That''s it, I have no suggestions on how it could be improved.</td>', 'I am totally in love with this photo!  Lighting, colors, shallow DOF and details are all fantastic.  That''s it, I have no suggestions on how it could be improved.', '2005-12-01 17:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913593, 258762, 40718, '<td valign="top">I wish I had a little more context to know what I''m looking at. 6</td>', 'I wish I had a little more context to know what I''m looking at. 6', '2005-12-01 17:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913594, 264076, 42792, '<td valign="top">No particular explanation.  Just like this a lot!  The idea and execution stands out.  Glad to find a different flavour that''s daring and different from the usual.</td>', 'No particular explanation.  Just like this a lot!  The idea and execution stands out.  Glad to find a different flavour that''s daring and different from the usual.', '2005-12-01 17:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913597, 262857, 2022, '<td valign="top">Awesome, great shot (10)</td>', 'Awesome, great shot (10)', '2005-12-01 17:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913602, 262055, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good idea, well done if it is original.  Criticism; difficult, but in my opinion if she were either; a - her body/shoulders straight and the head then tilted or, b - the body/shoulders tilted more and the head ''brought back around'' to be ''straight'' (if that makes sense) may have given this an even greater impact/effect.  The hair, while fairly well ''placed'', just slightly ''rotated'' to the right to get it more ''symmetricial'' - but that would come by default with a change in head/body position.   To really nit-pick, maybe the earrings/tongue ring(?) gone, for added ''neutrality'', may also have given this a more simple and dramatic shot.  The hair looks good, just think that in a shot like this, those minor other details would just enhance it even more - ''in my opinion''.  I also want to suggest b/w or some type of toning, but I do like the skin color ''contrasting'' against the black, and also the nice black sheen in the hair, which you''d likely lose with any adjustment.</td>', '7 - Good idea, well done if it is original.  Criticism; difficult, but in my opinion if she were either; a - her body/shoulders straight and the head then tilted or, b - the body/shoulders tilted more and the head ''brought back around'' to be ''straight'' (if that makes sense) may have given this an even greater impact/effect.  The hair, while fairly well ''placed'', just slightly ''rotated'' to the right to get it more ''symmetricial'' - but that would come by default with a change in head/body position.   To really nit-pick, maybe the earrings/tongue ring(?) gone, for added ''neutrality'', may also have given this a more simple and dramatic shot.  The hair looks good, just think that in a shot like this, those minor other details would just enhance it even more - ''in my opinion''.  I also want to suggest b/w or some type of toning, but I do like the skin color ''contrasting'' against the black, and also the nice black sheen in the hair, which you''d likely lose with any adjustment.', '2005-12-01 17:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913603, 255744, 42792, '<td valign="top">Quirky and fun!  Nice to see something different and well done.</td>', 'Quirky and fun!  Nice to see something different and well done.', '2005-12-01 17:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913611, 263938, 44980, '<td valign="top">Would have been fantastic if it''s head was in focus. I know how difficult is to shoot insects so I appreciate your effort. Good colors and angle.</td>', 'Would have been fantastic if it''s head was in focus. I know how difficult is to shoot insects so I appreciate your effort. Good colors and angle.', '2005-12-01 17:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913612, 260848, 7786, '<td valign="top">Looks over saturated</td>', 'Looks over saturated', '2005-12-01 17:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913614, 260078, 34194, '<td valign="top">Amazing</td>', 'Amazing', '2005-12-01 17:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913617, 264041, 44980, '<td valign="top">The sharpened edges ruined your picture imho.</td>', 'The sharpened edges ruined your picture imho.', '2005-12-01 17:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913620, 263760, 42792, '<td valign="top">Find this most interesting!  Fitting for the challenge.</td>', 'Find this most interesting!  Fitting for the challenge.', '2005-12-01 17:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913621, 263879, 17033, '<td valign="top">Great shot but wonder if you missed a trick by not making the buildings and the mountain backdrop the ''subject'' of the photograph, as the sea and boat don''t really add to the overall mood.</td>', 'Great shot but wonder if you missed a trick by not making the buildings and the mountain backdrop the ''subject'' of the photograph, as the sea and boat don''t really add to the overall mood.', '2005-12-01 17:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913625, 263505, 17033, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure, colour and tones</td>', 'Nice exposure, colour and tones', '2005-12-01 17:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913627, 253018, 44980, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait. The first that I''ve liked in this challenge. Well lit face yet sun almost behind the subject. Excellent. Good luck!</td>', 'Lovely portrait. The first that I''ve liked in this challenge. Well lit face yet sun almost behind the subject. Excellent. Good luck!', '2005-12-01 17:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913629, 262258, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good catch.  Criticism; I have to assume you didn''t have that full reflection to work with or else you would have included it - that''s the way it goes with opportunity shots.  Of course ''if only'' that fore wing were in better focus, but that is also camera/lens dependent.  Like the colors, and while it seems a bit dark at this size, I am sure that larger yields a lot more detail and ''contrast''/effect.  Even without that full reflection, perhaps just a bit more ''space'' above the bird (again depending what you had), may have made this better in my opinion.</td>', '6 - Good catch.  Criticism; I have to assume you didn''t have that full reflection to work with or else you would have included it - that''s the way it goes with opportunity shots.  Of course ''if only'' that fore wing were in better focus, but that is also camera/lens dependent.  Like the colors, and while it seems a bit dark at this size, I am sure that larger yields a lot more detail and ''contrast''/effect.  Even without that full reflection, perhaps just a bit more ''space'' above the bird (again depending what you had), may have made this better in my opinion.', '2005-12-01 17:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913631, 264005, 42792, '<td valign="top">A most original composition.  Great eye!  Just appears a little busy.  My suggestion would be to crop the upper blue "haze" out and just re-compose with the 2 "hearts".</td>', 'A most original composition.  Great eye!  Just appears a little busy.  My suggestion would be to crop the upper blue "haze" out and just re-compose with the 2 "hearts".', '2005-12-01 17:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913632, 263281, 17033, '<td valign="top">Trying to work out why this didn''t really click with me.....perhaps it is the distance between you and the subject...not close enough for the man''s features to tell a story or not far enough away to portray his isolation. Admirable intentions, though.</td>', 'Trying to work out why this didn''t really click with me.....perhaps it is the distance between you and the subject...not close enough for the man''s features to tell a story or not far enough away to portray his isolation. Admirable intentions, though.', '2005-12-01 17:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913634, 263034, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Beautiful.  Criticism; not much, maybe some even sharper detail on the snow/ice/texture right at the very fore of the shot, but likely difficult to retain the focus in the other areas, so who knows.  Tempted to say I''d like to see less movement in the water, to see more detail, but this effect is very nice as is so who knows.  Not sure on the frame, especially the black, perhaps brown (or whatever color is in those rocks) would have enhanced it/complemented it better, not sure.</td>', '8 - Beautiful.  Criticism; not much, maybe some even sharper detail on the snow/ice/texture right at the very fore of the shot, but likely difficult to retain the focus in the other areas, so who knows.  Tempted to say I''d like to see less movement in the water, to see more detail, but this effect is very nice as is so who knows.  Not sure on the frame, especially the black, perhaps brown (or whatever color is in those rocks) would have enhanced it/complemented it better, not sure.', '2005-12-01 17:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913635, 263567, 17033, '<td valign="top">I think this might have had more impact if you had zoomed in on their meeting gazes which is the great thing about this pic.....at the moment my eyes are pulled away to the raised hand.</td>', 'I think this might have had more impact if you had zoomed in on their meeting gazes which is the great thing about this pic.....at the moment my eyes are pulled away to the raised hand.', '2005-12-01 17:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913640, 263551, 6900, '<td valign="top">The lighting is uneven and it''s not very original - the angle looks slightly wrong to me and the colors don''t pop enough.</td>', 'The lighting is uneven and it''s not very original - the angle looks slightly wrong to me and the colors don''t pop enough.', '2005-12-01 17:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913642, 264054, 42792, '<td valign="top">Absolutely mesmerizing!  10.</td>', 'Absolutely mesmerizing!  10.', '2005-12-01 17:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913643, 260477, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good concept.  Criticism; there is more potential here in my opinion, not sure ''how'', and perhaps camera dependent, but this ''feels'' a bit harsh and ''rigid'', whether it is the lighting (especially the green on the left) or the seemingly lack of ''depth'' on the boats, not sure.  Perhaps (depending what you had to work with) a little more space to the right and ''above'' the boats would have made this better in my opinion.  Not sure what that ''something'' (reddish color) is in the middle background, but that either enhanced or removed too would also improve this.</td>', '6 - Good concept.  Criticism; there is more potential here in my opinion, not sure ''how'', and perhaps camera dependent, but this ''feels'' a bit harsh and ''rigid'', whether it is the lighting (especially the green on the left) or the seemingly lack of ''depth'' on the boats, not sure.  Perhaps (depending what you had to work with) a little more space to the right and ''above'' the boats would have made this better in my opinion.  Not sure what that ''something'' (reddish color) is in the middle background, but that either enhanced or removed too would also improve this.', '2005-12-01 17:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913644, 264056, 6900, '<td valign="top">nice lens.</td>', 'nice lens.', '2005-12-01 17:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913647, 262810, 17033, '<td valign="top">Great composition with the repeating motif.....the lighting is a bit watery and flat...maybe I''m too used to DPC dodge and burn!</td>', 'Great composition with the repeating motif.....the lighting is a bit watery and flat...maybe I''m too used to DPC dodge and burn!', '2005-12-01 17:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
