(1913650, 263249, 33515, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, the lines are very sharp and clear. The crop on the top is a little to tight.</td>', 'Beautiful, the lines are very sharp and clear. The crop on the top is a little to tight.', '2005-12-01 17:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
