(1913656, 264194, 1041, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and composition.  I wish I could see a bit more of the bottom,  but I suspect there may have been something distracting there.  Or you just prefered it that way and we have different tastes :)</td>', 'Lovely colors and composition.  I wish I could see a bit more of the bottom,  but I suspect there may have been something distracting there.  Or you just prefered it that way and we have different tastes :)', '2005-12-01 17:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
