(1913665, 260370, 1041, '<td valign="top">I spent a week driving around Iceland, mainly eating in gas stations and sleeping in sleeping bags.  Best photo trip of my life.  We ended the trip with a relaxing day at the Blue Lagoon - heaven!  Thanks for bringing back the memories and posting such a beautiful picture.  Love the colors and the steam mingling with the sky.</td>', 'I spent a week driving around Iceland, mainly eating in gas stations and sleeping in sleeping bags.  Best photo trip of my life.  We ended the trip with a relaxing day at the Blue Lagoon - heaven!  Thanks for bringing back the memories and posting such a beautiful picture.  Love the colors and the steam mingling with the sky.', '2005-12-01 17:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913667, 264191, 4610, '<td valign="top">Great capture!. I know who wins...</td>', 'Great capture!. I know who wins...', '2005-12-01 17:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913668, 263894, 33515, '<td valign="top">It seems like the sharpening has been taken to an extreme. Other than that nice photograph</td>', 'It seems like the sharpening has been taken to an extreme. Other than that nice photograph', '2005-12-01 17:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913670, 263076, 17033, '<td valign="top">Wacky processing but I like!</td>', 'Wacky processing but I like!', '2005-12-01 17:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913672, 263894, 44980, '<td valign="top">This is a really good picture, I find your sharpening a bit harsh though. Those edges at the top look like they have a halo. Horizon is a bit tilted as well. Good pic overall though.</td>', 'This is a really good picture, I find your sharpening a bit harsh though. Those edges at the top look like they have a halo. Horizon is a bit tilted as well. Good pic overall though.', '2005-12-01 17:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913673, 262275, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Like the concept.  Criticism; obviously the size restrictions don''t do this justice but even still, it seems too ''high key''/contrasted to the point where too much detail, especially in the ''sail'' has been lost.  Be nice to be able to ''discern'' the horizon a little better (I can barely now), and have some more ''color'' in the emptiness in between, somehow, while still retaining the concept you''ve gone for - if that makes sense.  Wall size this might look much better, but again, my opinion, if you had have ''adjusted'' this to try to suit it to this medium, especially for this Challenge, would have helped you a lot but who knows.  The frame detracts in my opinion, especially at this size.  Again, perhaps it would work ''wall size'', but even then I can''t see it actually ''enhancing'' this shot/concept.</td>', '6 - Like the concept.  Criticism; obviously the size restrictions don''t do this justice but even still, it seems too ''high key''/contrasted to the point where too much detail, especially in the ''sail'' has been lost.  Be nice to be able to ''discern'' the horizon a little better (I can barely now), and have some more ''color'' in the emptiness in between, somehow, while still retaining the concept you''ve gone for - if that makes sense.  Wall size this might look much better, but again, my opinion, if you had have ''adjusted'' this to try to suit it to this medium, especially for this Challenge, would have helped you a lot but who knows.  The frame detracts in my opinion, especially at this size.  Again, perhaps it would work ''wall size'', but even then I can''t see it actually ''enhancing'' this shot/concept.', '2005-12-01 17:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913675, 264007, 35229, '<td valign="top">Skökk.</td>', 'Skökk.', '2005-12-01 17:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913676, 263626, 44980, '<td valign="top">It does work indeed. Beautiful expression. Good luck with the challenge</td>', 'It does work indeed. Beautiful expression. Good luck with the challenge', '2005-12-01 17:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913677, 263986, 1041, '<td valign="top">Billy Idol :)  Great composition and location ... I wish something was in focus though ... and it doesn''t have to be the bride and groom that I think you have OOF deliberately.</td>', 'Billy Idol :)  Great composition and location ... I wish something was in focus though ... and it doesn''t have to be the bride and groom that I think you have OOF deliberately.', '2005-12-01 17:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913681, 262390, 44980, '<td valign="top">Out of this world! Very good!</td>', 'Out of this world! Very good!', '2005-12-01 17:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
