(1913907, 260082, 42456, '<td valign="top">I think this is closer to the truth kids...If I worked year round on the project I had to complete by Christmas...I''d be looking a little puffy under the eyes too. Don''t forget little Rudolf there! PSSSSSST...Rudolf the Reindeer is a myth...Rudolf is actually a dog!! Rudolf manages Santa''s Naughty and Nice list...it''s true...Mrs. Claus started what is now known as the ''The Red Gate Rumors'' at the North Pole. A story about a reindeer that saved Christmas with his glowing red nose. How ridiculous!! Great Capture!!</td>', 'I think this is closer to the truth kids...If I worked year round on the project I had to complete by Christmas...I''d be looking a little puffy under the eyes too. Don''t forget little Rudolf there! PSSSSSST...Rudolf the Reindeer is a myth...Rudolf is actually a dog!! Rudolf manages Santa''s Naughty and Nice list...it''s true...Mrs. Claus started what is now known as the ''The Red Gate Rumors'' at the North Pole. A story about a reindeer that saved Christmas with his glowing red nose. How ridiculous!! Great Capture!!', '2005-12-01 19:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
