(1913921, 264076, 43380, '<td valign="top">There are several parts of this photograph that I love - i.e. the model is beautiful, the mood of the shot in general,  the reflection on the right , and the urban acid style/grunge effect colors.  However, there are a couple of changes that would really make this picture more powerful - i.e. removing the reflection of her ankles below her, and the reflection on her left, then making her skin tone on her face a little less washed out....  All in all, it''s a nice picture, very high "fashion".</td>', 'There are several parts of this photograph that I love - i.e. the model is beautiful, the mood of the shot in general,  the reflection on the right , and the urban acid style/grunge effect colors.  However, there are a couple of changes that would really make this picture more powerful - i.e. removing the reflection of her ankles below her, and the reflection on her left, then making her skin tone on her face a little less washed out....  All in all, it''s a nice picture, very high "fashion".', '2005-12-01 19:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1913926, 263072, 33352, '<td valign="top">Good Image, that loses it strenght with to much sky, would have croped closer to the top of the Building,the moon and stars are distracting.IMO</td>', 'Good Image, that loses it strenght with to much sky, would have croped closer to the top of the Building,the moon and stars are distracting.IMO', '2005-12-01 19:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
