(1914007, 261967, 27763, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo, but to be honest, I''ve seen this kind of photo too many times to be excited about it.  It really is very well done, though.  If this is the first time you''ve done such a photo, then I must say you''ve really done a great job.</td>', 'Beautiful photo, but to be honest, I''ve seen this kind of photo too many times to be excited about it.  It really is very well done, though.  If this is the first time you''ve done such a photo, then I must say you''ve really done a great job.', '2005-12-01 19:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
