(1914079, 263740, 25464, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous.  The border and burning around the edge seems a little heavy.  I think you would want this image to look larger than life rather than contained.  A thin border might have been better.  The color and composition are perfect.</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous.  The border and burning around the edge seems a little heavy.  I think you would want this image to look larger than life rather than contained.  A thin border might have been better.  The color and composition are perfect.', '2005-12-01 20:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1914095, 263384, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 -  Good capture/opportunity.  Criticism; this has/had more potential in my opinion, perhaps a different perspective, different crop, not sure.  Difficult, and camera/lens dependent, but more detail in at least a ''few birds'' would obviously have made this even better.  Also the potential here for an unusual abstract possibly, who knows.  Frame is too thick, especially at this size, and detracts, in my opinion.</td>', '6 -  Good capture/opportunity.  Criticism; this has/had more potential in my opinion, perhaps a different perspective, different crop, not sure.  Difficult, and camera/lens dependent, but more detail in at least a ''few birds'' would obviously have made this even better.  Also the potential here for an unusual abstract possibly, who knows.  Frame is too thick, especially at this size, and detracts, in my opinion.', '2005-12-01 20:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1914101, 263623, 6179, '<td valign="top">beautiful model. nicely done</td>', 'beautiful model. nicely done', '2005-12-01 20:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
