(1914115, 263967, 32997, '<td valign="top">3D effect is great..nice angle, nice shot!</td>', '3D effect is great..nice angle, nice shot!', '2005-12-01 20:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1914119, 264115, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice balance and colors.  Criticism; bad pixelation, maybe due to resizing, who knows.  That corrected and perhaps some more detail (or this would work as an abstract ''very soft'' type shot too in my opinion), would have made this a much better shot, ''in my opinion''.</td>', '6 - Nice balance and colors.  Criticism; bad pixelation, maybe due to resizing, who knows.  That corrected and perhaps some more detail (or this would work as an abstract ''very soft'' type shot too in my opinion), would have made this a much better shot, ''in my opinion''.', '2005-12-01 20:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1914130, 263872, 32997, '<td valign="top">I am not a fan of studio looking shots featuring animals..but since you have captured such a great look all I can say is awesome shot..</td>', 'I am not a fan of studio looking shots featuring animals..but since you have captured such a great look all I can say is awesome shot..', '2005-12-01 20:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1914133, 261983, 40019, '<td valign="top">This is an absolute &lt;10&gt;!  Outstanding shot!  Superb stop action, DOF, colors, details, texture...I can''t say enough about it.  I''ll be VERY disappointed if this doesn''t ribbon. Wow!   The space on the left side is begging for some action, perhaps cropping just a "little" off would great, but definitely not taking any points off for it!  Lovely shot - makes my Fav list.</td>', 'This is an absolute <10>!  Outstanding shot!  Superb stop action, DOF, colors, details, texture...I can''t say enough about it.  I''ll be VERY disappointed if this doesn''t ribbon. Wow!   The space on the left side is begging for some action, perhaps cropping just a "little" off would great, but definitely not taking any points off for it!  Lovely shot - makes my Fav list.', '2005-12-01 20:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1914135, 255744, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good use of ''distortion''.  Nice clean studio ''feel''.  Good colors, lighting, etc.  Criticism; would work a bit better if her legs were more ''together'', as it is, the distorted effect accentuates that and detracts in my opinion.  Perhaps also a little ''wider'', more space one &amp;/or either side, may also have made this even better in my opinion.</td>', '7 - Good use of ''distortion''.  Nice clean studio ''feel''.  Good colors, lighting, etc.  Criticism; would work a bit better if her legs were more ''together'', as it is, the distorted effect accentuates that and detracts in my opinion.  Perhaps also a little ''wider'', more space one &/or either side, may also have made this even better in my opinion.', '2005-12-01 20:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1914145, 261967, 40019, '<td valign="top">Great colors and textures, classic Librodo type picture.  The steely eyes are just a little to sharp for me, I would have liked them a little softer, but no points off for that!  This one will score well. Nice job.</td>', 'Great colors and textures, classic Librodo type picture.  The steely eyes are just a little to sharp for me, I would have liked them a little softer, but no points off for that!  This one will score well. Nice job.', '2005-12-01 20:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1914152, 264166, 22533, '<td valign="top">Good composition, but there seems to be some motion blur. A tripod would help this.</td>', 'Good composition, but there seems to be some motion blur. A tripod would help this.', '2005-12-01 20:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1914157, 263740, 22533, '<td valign="top">Stunning image. Great sharpness and composition. I would have perhaps had a smaller frame (or none at all), so that the image could have been bigger.</td>', 'Stunning image. Great sharpness and composition. I would have perhaps had a smaller frame (or none at all), so that the image could have been bigger.', '2005-12-01 20:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1914159, 262528, 40019, '<td valign="top">This is an incredible shot, I really like this one.  The trees, shadows, clouds - what a great mix of textures.  The only thing I would have done different is maybe a little more black border to make the white of the image really pop!  It blends a little too much with the gray background of this website and subsequently loses some of image contrast when viewing.  &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'This is an incredible shot, I really like this one.  The trees, shadows, clouds - what a great mix of textures.  The only thing I would have done different is maybe a little more black border to make the white of the image really pop!  It blends a little too much with the gray background of this website and subsequently loses some of image contrast when viewing.  <9>', '2005-12-01 20:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1914169, 263967, 22533, '<td valign="top">Great 3D illusion.</td>', 'Great 3D illusion.', '2005-12-01 20:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1914172, 263943, 40019, '<td valign="top">This is such a great shot!  The eyes really tell a story.  Outstanding focus and sharpness in the eyes (not over done!), great DOF, wonderful rich colors and textures....nice!  &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'This is such a great shot!  The eyes really tell a story.  Outstanding focus and sharpness in the eyes (not over done!), great DOF, wonderful rich colors and textures....nice!  <9>', '2005-12-01 20:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1914176, 260918, 46295, '<td valign="top">Really bold!</td>', 'Really bold!', '2005-12-01 20:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1914179, 259342, 22533, '<td valign="top">A little too soft for my tastes, but I like the color and contrast.</td>', 'A little too soft for my tastes, but I like the color and contrast.', '2005-12-01 20:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1914182, 264172, 25890, '<td valign="top">Focus is perfect, and the subject is nicely isolated from the background. However, half of the bird is in the dark, therefore barely visible. Moreover, the tail should not be cut out in my opinion, i.e the camera should have been moved to the right so as to frame the bird entirely.</td>', 'Focus is perfect, and the subject is nicely isolated from the background. However, half of the bird is in the dark, therefore barely visible. Moreover, the tail should not be cut out in my opinion, i.e the camera should have been moved to the right so as to frame the bird entirely.', '2005-12-01 20:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1914186, 263282, 40019, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a shot.  The foilage really help contrast the horse with the snowy background - if you planned it that way, smart thinking!  Great DOF and action.  That white eye is pretty ugly though. :-)  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'Wow, what a shot.  The foilage really help contrast the horse with the snowy background - if you planned it that way, smart thinking!  Great DOF and action.  That white eye is pretty ugly though. :-)  <8>', '2005-12-01 20:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1914188, 261270, 22533, '<td valign="top">The background people are distracting.</td>', 'The background people are distracting.', '2005-12-01 20:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1914191, 261364, 40019, '<td valign="top">This is such a fun shot!  I hope you plan to sell a bunch of posters of this one!  :-)  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'This is such a fun shot!  I hope you plan to sell a bunch of posters of this one!  :-)  <8>', '2005-12-01 20:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1914203, 256912, 40019, '<td valign="top">Very nice image!  I love the rich colors.  Great juxtaposition of bushes and sun.  Only peeve I have is with the slight pink line between the hill and skyline - shows PS tampering.  :-)   &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Very nice image!  I love the rich colors.  Great juxtaposition of bushes and sun.  Only peeve I have is with the slight pink line between the hill and skyline - shows PS tampering.  :-)   <7>', '2005-12-01 20:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1914207, 264151, 40019, '<td valign="top">This is such a great image!  The sharpness of the shadows is awesome!  Very touching.  Nicely done! &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'This is such a great image!  The sharpness of the shadows is awesome!  Very touching.  Nicely done! <7>', '2005-12-01 21:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1914211, 264026, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Wish you had gone down there with the others and got a closer shot.  Criticism; difficult in this situation - the view is good from this perspective, but just, in my opinion, something closer, still incorporating the flag and concaved ceiling/skylights/framing etc, and that shuttle - but, perhaps you are not allowed shots so close, who knows.  Even a different crop here - I just see more potential in such an opportunity but who knows what was, and was not, ''in your control''.  Anyway, a good inside look with a seemingly wide-angle lens,  so thanks.</td>', '6 - Wish you had gone down there with the others and got a closer shot.  Criticism; difficult in this situation - the view is good from this perspective, but just, in my opinion, something closer, still incorporating the flag and concaved ceiling/skylights/framing etc, and that shuttle - but, perhaps you are not allowed shots so close, who knows.  Even a different crop here - I just see more potential in such an opportunity but who knows what was, and was not, ''in your control''.  Anyway, a good inside look with a seemingly wide-angle lens,  so thanks.', '2005-12-01 21:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1914212, 263965, 40019, '<td valign="top">This is definitely poster material!  I LOVE the rich colors augmented by the fog rolling in.  Outstanding job! &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'This is definitely poster material!  I LOVE the rich colors augmented by the fog rolling in.  Outstanding job! <8>', '2005-12-01 21:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1914217, 256160, 28029, '<td valign="top">"I found you Bear"</td>', '"I found you Bear"', '2005-12-01 21:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1914219, 256160, 40019, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of sunset shots in this challenge, but this one is the best IMO.  I love the clean, crispness of the shot.  The reflection is great, but what really makes it for me is the slight twinkle of the sun just as it''s going done - great timing! &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'There are a lot of sunset shots in this challenge, but this one is the best IMO.  I love the clean, crispness of the shot.  The reflection is great, but what really makes it for me is the slight twinkle of the sun just as it''s going done - great timing! <8>', '2005-12-01 21:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1914223, 262855, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very nice, nice complementary background color and ''bokeh'' too.  Criticism; definitely 640 width would have helped this.  Sharper (though the detail in the feathers is good), and perhaps a slight crop adjustment (eliminating the minor distracting elements - thin tan/brown line on left and possibly the fork in the branch top right, etc), may have made this even better.</td>', '7 - Very nice, nice complementary background color and ''bokeh'' too.  Criticism; definitely 640 width would have helped this.  Sharper (though the detail in the feathers is good), and perhaps a slight crop adjustment (eliminating the minor distracting elements - thin tan/brown line on left and possibly the fork in the branch top right, etc), may have made this even better.', '2005-12-01 21:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1914227, 261967, 42492, '<td valign="top">nice very nice. beautiful focus</td>', 'nice very nice. beautiful focus', '2005-12-01 21:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1914233, 253317, 40019, '<td valign="top">This is a awesome shot!  Very sensual and seductive without needing to be a "nude" (major kudos to your model on that one! - the eyes tell it all).  Lighting, textures, color, DOF are all great.  I would expect to see this in Cosmo Mag or something.  Great shot! &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'This is a awesome shot!  Very sensual and seductive without needing to be a "nude" (major kudos to your model on that one! - the eyes tell it all).  Lighting, textures, color, DOF are all great.  I would expect to see this in Cosmo Mag or something.  Great shot! <8>', '2005-12-01 21:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1914246, 260010, 40355, '<td valign="top">Interesting colors and subject.  Well composed, like the can in the corner - makes it seem less "set-up" than some shots are.  A touch grainy, could you have lowered the ISO and gone for a longer exposure?</td>', 'Interesting colors and subject.  Well composed, like the can in the corner - makes it seem less "set-up" than some shots are.  A touch grainy, could you have lowered the ISO and gone for a longer exposure?', '2005-12-01 21:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
