(1914342, 260730, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice.  Not sure if those colors are natural or ''tweaked'' but very nice coloring too, the blues and the reds/pinks.  Criticism; I''m sure this looks excellent wall size with this crop (vertical), and also looks good here/this medium, but an even ''wider'' view (640 x 640), especially for ''here'', may have given this even more ''punch'', not sure.  Maybe some type of further detail or ''texture capture'' right at the fore, but likely very difficult to do that and still retain the equal ''balanced focus'' you have achieved so - who knows.  Very nice.</td>', '8 - Very nice.  Not sure if those colors are natural or ''tweaked'' but very nice coloring too, the blues and the reds/pinks.  Criticism; I''m sure this looks excellent wall size with this crop (vertical), and also looks good here/this medium, but an even ''wider'' view (640 x 640), especially for ''here'', may have given this even more ''punch'', not sure.  Maybe some type of further detail or ''texture capture'' right at the fore, but likely very difficult to do that and still retain the equal ''balanced focus'' you have achieved so - who knows.  Very nice.', '2005-12-01 21:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1914345, 263072, 19178, '<td valign="top">This photo has a great deal about it I like, but I think you would benefit by cropping the bottom 25% in order to place the horizon line at about 1/3 of th eway from the bottom.  Placing the building in the dead cernter of the photo both horizontally and vertically detracts from the overall imression.</td>', 'This photo has a great deal about it I like, but I think you would benefit by cropping the bottom 25% in order to place the horizon line at about 1/3 of th eway from the bottom.  Placing the building in the dead cernter of the photo both horizontally and vertically detracts from the overall imression.', '2005-12-01 21:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1914365, 257630, 19178, '<td valign="top">Despite the fact that it would be easy to mistake the frost for oversharpening halos, I think  this picture still looks overshapened.  It''s an appealing scene that might be improved by not having the body of water in the center of the frame.</td>', 'Despite the fact that it would be easy to mistake the frost for oversharpening halos, I think  this picture still looks overshapened.  It''s an appealing scene that might be improved by not having the body of water in the center of the frame.', '2005-12-01 21:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
