(1914591, 264132, 40019, '<td valign="top">Amazing capture! No real criticisms - I think a border around the picture would have framed it nicely and presented this amazing image a little better.  Great job, I really like this one - can''t wait to see the focal length of the lens you used - hopefully it wasn''t 50mm.  :-)    &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Amazing capture! No real criticisms - I think a border around the picture would have framed it nicely and presented this amazing image a little better.  Great job, I really like this one - can''t wait to see the focal length of the lens you used - hopefully it wasn''t 50mm.  :-)    <7>', '2005-12-01 22:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
