(1914610, 260331, 40019, '<td valign="top">This is a great image - the color combination is awesome.  Great job of saturating feathers and bring out the yellow against the red.  I like the motion, but the colors really make this shot.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'This is a great image - the color combination is awesome.  Great job of saturating feathers and bring out the yellow against the red.  I like the motion, but the colors really make this shot.  <7>', '2005-12-01 22:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
