(1914632, 264167, 40355, '<td valign="top">Wow...what more can I say?  Just wow.  First 10 I''ve seen yet.  This has it all - good composition, really neat subject matter, strong colors, good focus.  Hell of a shot, man!</td>', 'Wow...what more can I say?  Just wow.  First 10 I''ve seen yet.  This has it all - good composition, really neat subject matter, strong colors, good focus.  Hell of a shot, man!', '2005-12-01 22:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
