(1914634, 264109, 40355, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Love the romantic feel, very emotive.  Nice composition, rule of thirds and all that jazz. Colors are amazing, really fond of the shadows they cast, myself.  Definite 10 material!</td>', 'Very nice!  Love the romantic feel, very emotive.  Nice composition, rule of thirds and all that jazz. Colors are amazing, really fond of the shadows they cast, myself.  Definite 10 material!', '2005-12-01 23:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
