(1914647, 263562, 40019, '<td valign="top">This is a nice capture, but the birdseed dispenser stands out more than the bird.  Unfortunately the birds colors get muted by the shade and further more by the gray background.  Cropping more of the seed dispenser may have helped, IMO. I like the action though, with the seed in the beak.</td>', 'This is a nice capture, but the birdseed dispenser stands out more than the bird.  Unfortunately the birds colors get muted by the shade and further more by the gray background.  Cropping more of the seed dispenser may have helped, IMO. I like the action though, with the seed in the beak.', '2005-12-01 23:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
