(1914665, 263085, 40019, '<td valign="top">You found it!  Now where''s Gilligan?  -  Funny picture, and you wonder what an old boat is doing in the middle of a field, but I think you''re in some tough competition in this challenge.  This would have been a good entry for the "Odd" challenge.</td>', 'You found it!  Now where''s Gilligan?  -  Funny picture, and you wonder what an old boat is doing in the middle of a field, but I think you''re in some tough competition in this challenge.  This would have been a good entry for the "Odd" challenge.', '2005-12-01 23:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1914666, 263177, 40355, '<td valign="top">Very nice, but the colors look a bit overdone to me, especially the orange.  The fence appears to be oversharpened in places, too.</td>', 'Very nice, but the colors look a bit overdone to me, especially the orange.  The fence appears to be oversharpened in places, too.', '2005-12-01 23:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
