(1914696, 263654, 40355, '<td valign="top">May just be my monitor, but there are very defined gradiations between the darker sky colors.  If this is just me, forget I mentioned it.  If you can see them too, is it a post-processing thing?  Worth considering if it is.  But otherwise, very well done.</td>', 'May just be my monitor, but there are very defined gradiations between the darker sky colors.  If this is just me, forget I mentioned it.  If you can see them too, is it a post-processing thing?  Worth considering if it is.  But otherwise, very well done.', '2005-12-01 23:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1914699, 262055, 42100, '<td valign="top">What a fun and original photograph.  Very well executed.</td>', 'What a fun and original photograph.  Very well executed.', '2005-12-01 23:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1914703, 261514, 42100, '<td valign="top">I could walk by this a million times and never see the photograph.  I love it.  You''re a creative genious!</td>', 'I could walk by this a million times and never see the photograph.  I love it.  You''re a creative genious!', '2005-12-01 23:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1914709, 263889, 40820, '<td valign="top">great dof....crisp....and of course...sparkling....nice!</td>', 'great dof....crisp....and of course...sparkling....nice!', '2005-12-01 23:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1914710, 263854, 40019, '<td valign="top">This is a great picture.  Great sunlight and shadows, good detail.  The towels are in a perfect position, showing enough to know they are skinny dipping, but not revealing anything.  Very cool! (no pun intended).  The title is "ok", but I honestly can''t think of a better one, so who am I to judge.  :-)   &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'This is a great picture.  Great sunlight and shadows, good detail.  The towels are in a perfect position, showing enough to know they are skinny dipping, but not revealing anything.  Very cool! (no pun intended).  The title is "ok", but I honestly can''t think of a better one, so who am I to judge.  :-)   <7>', '2005-12-01 23:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1914714, 263812, 24846, '<td valign="top">This, at my first glance appeared desolate, but there is so much life. Forefront of image with the barren trees with the few conifers Pulls you toward the structure (church?), along the shore to deer, and my eye continues to follow the line to come around to th bluff and then rest upon the water,  Love the colors and the snowcover. Good work on this winter study and good luck. -10-</td>', 'This, at my first glance appeared desolate, but there is so much life. Forefront of image with the barren trees with the few conifers Pulls you toward the structure (church?), along the shore to deer, and my eye continues to follow the line to come around to th bluff and then rest upon the water,  Love the colors and the snowcover. Good work on this winter study and good luck. -10-', '2005-12-01 23:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1914715, 263569, 40019, '<td valign="top">This is really cool!  Great DOF and focus on the deer - very crisp, almost 3-dimensional.  Would have been nice to have some more color in the picture, but that''s not exactly under you control, is it.  :-)  Great shot! &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'This is really cool!  Great DOF and focus on the deer - very crisp, almost 3-dimensional.  Would have been nice to have some more color in the picture, but that''s not exactly under you control, is it.  :-)  Great shot! <7>', '2005-12-01 23:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
