(1914738, 263666, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very good.  Looks like a familiar shot but likely just the ''tabby effect''.  Criticism; the cropped ear(s) are noticeable, but this also works as is in my opinion, maybe some ''fine tuning'' with it (zoomed/cropped tighter or ears included (depending what you had to work with obviously)), may have made this better in my opinion.  Like the vivid color in the eyes and the seemingly horizontal ''patterned reflection'' adds an off-setting element to this too.  Nice focus on the brow and eyes, like the whiskers'' contrast, difficult but with the nose and whiskers even sharper may have made this even better - but likely difficult to get ''it all'' in good focus so not sure.  Background blue is nice and enhances those eyes.</td>', '7 - Very good.  Looks like a familiar shot but likely just the ''tabby effect''.  Criticism; the cropped ear(s) are noticeable, but this also works as is in my opinion, maybe some ''fine tuning'' with it (zoomed/cropped tighter or ears included (depending what you had to work with obviously)), may have made this better in my opinion.  Like the vivid color in the eyes and the seemingly horizontal ''patterned reflection'' adds an off-setting element to this too.  Nice focus on the brow and eyes, like the whiskers'' contrast, difficult but with the nose and whiskers even sharper may have made this even better - but likely difficult to get ''it all'' in good focus so not sure.  Background blue is nice and enhances those eyes.', '2005-12-01 23:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
