(1914804, 264129, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Clever idea, well done if it is original.  Criticism; more subtle in my opinion would have made this better, perhaps a pencil instead of ''ink'', not sure.  Also in this case, not quite so close, or rather, some more space around, especially to incorporate that foreshadow more if possible.  Seems a bit of grain which may be a result of too tight a crop, or maybe the grain is intentional, who knows.  Not sure on the frame, perhaps black would have complemented this better.</td>', '5 - Clever idea, well done if it is original.  Criticism; more subtle in my opinion would have made this better, perhaps a pencil instead of ''ink'', not sure.  Also in this case, not quite so close, or rather, some more space around, especially to incorporate that foreshadow more if possible.  Seems a bit of grain which may be a result of too tight a crop, or maybe the grain is intentional, who knows.  Not sure on the frame, perhaps black would have complemented this better.', '2005-12-01 23:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
