(1914885, 252969, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and colors. Part of the image seems a bit ''soft'' to me, maybe it''s just me. It also looks like there''s a line about 1/3rd of the way from the bottom of the image, where a filter ended or something.</td>', 'Very nice composition and colors. Part of the image seems a bit ''soft'' to me, maybe it''s just me. It also looks like there''s a line about 1/3rd of the way from the bottom of the image, where a filter ended or something.', '2005-12-01 23:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
