(1915377, 264167, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Excellent capture and if you did this one handed - amazing.  Criticism; frame detracts, maybe a thin one, and likely different color may have worked but this one doesn''t enhance your shot in my opinion, also depending what you had to work with, but if the quality was good enough, then just a larger size/crop/zoom.  The forearm is dominating too much here, so perhaps, with advanced editing, some selective ''adjustment'' there, as leaving the length of it in, adds a context that enhances this shot in my opinion.  Although I think the (seemingly) ''front yard'' feel here adds a good aspect, perhaps, again with adv. editing, trying to get it more subtle and perhaps slightly darker, enabling the bird and it''s colors and wing span/movement to really ''pop more'', would have likely made this even better in my opinion.  Good unique shot.</td>', '7 - Excellent capture and if you did this one handed - amazing.  Criticism; frame detracts, maybe a thin one, and likely different color may have worked but this one doesn''t enhance your shot in my opinion, also depending what you had to work with, but if the quality was good enough, then just a larger size/crop/zoom.  The forearm is dominating too much here, so perhaps, with advanced editing, some selective ''adjustment'' there, as leaving the length of it in, adds a context that enhances this shot in my opinion.  Although I think the (seemingly) ''front yard'' feel here adds a good aspect, perhaps, again with adv. editing, trying to get it more subtle and perhaps slightly darker, enabling the bird and it''s colors and wing span/movement to really ''pop more'', would have likely made this even better in my opinion.  Good unique shot.', '2005-12-02 06:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915379, 263809, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good angle and colors and reflection.  Criticism; those 4 extra pixels would have helped this.  If there was a little more sharpness (contrast likely was a big issue), would have made this even better in my opinion.  Perhaps a more finely tuned crop on the sides too.  Not sure on the frame.</td>', '7 - Good angle and colors and reflection.  Criticism; those 4 extra pixels would have helped this.  If there was a little more sharpness (contrast likely was a big issue), would have made this even better in my opinion.  Perhaps a more finely tuned crop on the sides too.  Not sure on the frame.', '2005-12-02 06:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
