(1915456, 261412, 41531, '<td valign="top">a beautiful pic of a beautiful place, i''m guessing laurent? Love the night shot for a difference and the stunning sky.</td>', 'a beautiful pic of a beautiful place, i''m guessing laurent? Love the night shot for a difference and the stunning sky.', '2005-12-02 07:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
