(1915475, 263873, 19982, '<td valign="top">I''m usually the one entering pictures of the Salt Lake Temple ... it''ll be interesting to find out who posted this one.  :-)</td>', 'I''m usually the one entering pictures of the Salt Lake Temple ... it''ll be interesting to find out who posted this one.  :-)', '2005-12-02 08:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915490, 263179, 37719, '<td valign="top">I like this shot - sets a great mood.  There is some grain/artifacts in the lower left upper right that is a bit distracting.  But it doesn''t depress the mood in the least.</td>', 'I like this shot - sets a great mood.  There is some grain/artifacts in the lower left upper right that is a bit distracting.  But it doesn''t depress the mood in the least.', '2005-12-02 08:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915498, 264129, 37719, '<td valign="top">Very original!  Nice job!</td>', 'Very original!  Nice job!', '2005-12-02 08:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915501, 262405, 37719, '<td valign="top">Very simple, but quite exquisite!  I really like the composition and perspective of this shot.  Something about it just hits me.  Well done!</td>', 'Very simple, but quite exquisite!  I really like the composition and perspective of this shot.  Something about it just hits me.  Well done!', '2005-12-02 08:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915518, 258053, 15711, '<td valign="top">The lighting is superb as is the clarity of this shot.  I like the detail of the hand. The human element mixed with the animal world always evokes such emotion for me. The closeness, the cameraderie.  Nothing beats touch and this depicts it perfectly.  10</td>', 'The lighting is superb as is the clarity of this shot.  I like the detail of the hand. The human element mixed with the animal world always evokes such emotion for me. The closeness, the cameraderie.  Nothing beats touch and this depicts it perfectly.  10', '2005-12-02 08:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915522, 262186, 15711, '<td valign="top">The crop encompases the entire bird, yet there is still some mystery to it because there are parts missing.  The colors are so rich.  This is pure eye candy for me.  Way to go!!! 9</td>', 'The crop encompases the entire bird, yet there is still some mystery to it because there are parts missing.  The colors are so rich.  This is pure eye candy for me.  Way to go!!! 9', '2005-12-02 08:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915525, 264203, 15711, '<td valign="top">Of all the sunset photos, I think this is one of my favs.  The blue water slowly becoming orange, with the mix of the sea grass in the foreground, really adds nice texture. It has a progression all the way to the back of the shot which is really good. Love the silhouette of the people. The seagulls make it for me as a final crowning touch.  Nicely composed. 9</td>', 'Of all the sunset photos, I think this is one of my favs.  The blue water slowly becoming orange, with the mix of the sea grass in the foreground, really adds nice texture. It has a progression all the way to the back of the shot which is really good. Love the silhouette of the people. The seagulls make it for me as a final crowning touch.  Nicely composed. 9', '2005-12-02 09:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915528, 262619, 15711, '<td valign="top">The sense of nostalgia cannot be denied here.  The leading line is perfect.  The depth of tone, even with the post edited sepia filter is variant and adds to the quality of it. It really helped enhance the sky.   Well done!!!</td>', 'The sense of nostalgia cannot be denied here.  The leading line is perfect.  The depth of tone, even with the post edited sepia filter is variant and adds to the quality of it. It really helped enhance the sky.   Well done!!!', '2005-12-02 09:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915531, 262097, 37719, '<td valign="top">One of my all time favorite places!   Beautiful photo!</td>', 'One of my all time favorite places!   Beautiful photo!', '2005-12-02 09:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915532, 262927, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think the building is what really sends this home for me.  The tree would have made a nice subject, but in combination with the structure, it grounds the shot and is very interesting with the mix of man made and the natural.  The peaks of the evergreens along the horizon just add more to this shot, as they almost mimic the  fence posts hidden in fog.  Really well done.  I''m wondering if adjusting curves and deepening it up would ruin that soft sense... hmmmm.. something to ponder.  8</td>', 'I think the building is what really sends this home for me.  The tree would have made a nice subject, but in combination with the structure, it grounds the shot and is very interesting with the mix of man made and the natural.  The peaks of the evergreens along the horizon just add more to this shot, as they almost mimic the  fence posts hidden in fog.  Really well done.  I''m wondering if adjusting curves and deepening it up would ruin that soft sense... hmmmm.. something to ponder.  8', '2005-12-02 09:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915533, 262186, 42100, '<td valign="top">Great clarity and contrast.  The flow of texture through the feathers is wondeerful.  Fantastic!</td>', 'Great clarity and contrast.  The flow of texture through the feathers is wondeerful.  Fantastic!', '2005-12-02 09:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915534, 262097, 42492, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2005-12-02 09:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915535, 260730, 42100, '<td valign="top">Excellent low light photograph.  Wonderful job of composing this photograph.</td>', 'Excellent low light photograph.  Wonderful job of composing this photograph.', '2005-12-02 09:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915536, 263700, 42492, '<td valign="top">nice shot</td>', 'nice shot', '2005-12-02 09:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915538, 263282, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the tone on tone quality of this image. The horse is tack sharp and the stop motion is well done.  All of the dry brush is a tad distracting, but given the situation, you did well with the landscape. I like that single twig in front of his hind quarters.  I wish you could have panned back to create more of a sense of movement through the field.  Just a thought.</td>', 'I love the tone on tone quality of this image. The horse is tack sharp and the stop motion is well done.  All of the dry brush is a tad distracting, but given the situation, you did well with the landscape. I like that single twig in front of his hind quarters.  I wish you could have panned back to create more of a sense of movement through the field.  Just a thought.', '2005-12-02 09:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915539, 262725, 42492, '<td valign="top">good b&amp;w</td>', 'good b&w', '2005-12-02 09:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915540, 263584, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful photograph.  I love the angle and composition.  Great photo!</td>', 'Very beautiful photograph.  I love the angle and composition.  Great photo!', '2005-12-02 09:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915541, 263940, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is nostalgia at its finest.  The perspective is perfect.  The depth of tone with the filter really accents the varations of the clouds.  I love the contrast.  This is so well done.  9</td>', 'This is nostalgia at its finest.  The perspective is perfect.  The depth of tone with the filter really accents the varations of the clouds.  I love the contrast.  This is so well done.  9', '2005-12-02 09:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915542, 254640, 42492, '<td valign="top">good one</td>', 'good one', '2005-12-02 09:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915543, 264195, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful and original photograph.  Well done!</td>', 'Very beautiful and original photograph.  Well done!', '2005-12-02 09:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915546, 256368, 42492, '<td valign="top">very very nice. I use to own a pet shop and I loved my saltwater setups</td>', 'very very nice. I use to own a pet shop and I loved my saltwater setups', '2005-12-02 09:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915547, 264127, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. The clarity of the birds is great. With the peaks being white, it almost diminishes the impact a bit for me. I wonder what it would have looked like to crop out most of the mountains and just zoomed in more on the birds.  Just a thought.  Still, well done and quite unique!!! 8</td>', 'Nicely done. The clarity of the birds is great. With the peaks being white, it almost diminishes the impact a bit for me. I wonder what it would have looked like to crop out most of the mountains and just zoomed in more on the birds.  Just a thought.  Still, well done and quite unique!!! 8', '2005-12-02 09:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915548, 257214, 42492, '<td valign="top">pretty . getting down close looks good</td>', 'pretty . getting down close looks good', '2005-12-02 09:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915549, 258302, 15711, '<td valign="top">Excellent night shot.  I love the sirl of what is probably the aurora borealis. The building with the scaffolding around it is interesting amidst the natural setting. Very well done!  I''d love a print of this!!!! 9</td>', 'Excellent night shot.  I love the sirl of what is probably the aurora borealis. The building with the scaffolding around it is interesting amidst the natural setting. Very well done!  I''d love a print of this!!!! 9', '2005-12-02 09:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915550, 256214, 15711, '<td valign="top">The sense of an earlier time is evident here. The worn bridge, the bare trees evoke a lonely sense. I like the mixture of textures with the stone, the wood, the natural, the manmade. The leading line of the railing all the way to the end of the bridge sends your eye through the shot perfectly. Good job!!</td>', 'The sense of an earlier time is evident here. The worn bridge, the bare trees evoke a lonely sense. I like the mixture of textures with the stone, the wood, the natural, the manmade. The leading line of the railing all the way to the end of the bridge sends your eye through the shot perfectly. Good job!!', '2005-12-02 09:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915551, 261684, 42492, '<td valign="top">good</td>', 'good', '2005-12-02 09:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915553, 260848, 42492, '<td valign="top">very good</td>', 'very good', '2005-12-02 09:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915555, 263571, 42492, '<td valign="top">good</td>', 'good', '2005-12-02 09:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915558, 263079, 42100, '<td valign="top">Overiding the metering will help get the exposure correct for the kid instead of the background.  Methods for that depends on your camera.</td>', 'Overiding the metering will help get the exposure correct for the kid instead of the background.  Methods for that depends on your camera.', '2005-12-02 09:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915559, 260078, 15711, '<td valign="top">The abstractness of this is very artfully captured. It looks like something Georgio O''Keefe would have painted during her time in the desert southwest. I love the tonal variations and the complementary orange and purple.  The shadow and light is superb. The striations of the rock are very interesting and serve as leading lines to send your eye back and forth across the image.  Great perspective too. You took a beautiful work of nature and captured it in an extraordinary way!  WOW</td>', 'The abstractness of this is very artfully captured. It looks like something Georgio O''Keefe would have painted during her time in the desert southwest. I love the tonal variations and the complementary orange and purple.  The shadow and light is superb. The striations of the rock are very interesting and serve as leading lines to send your eye back and forth across the image.  Great perspective too. You took a beautiful work of nature and captured it in an extraordinary way!  WOW', '2005-12-02 09:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915560, 262156, 42492, '<td valign="top">nice title for this one</td>', 'nice title for this one', '2005-12-02 09:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915562, 262933, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the stars amidst the night sky.  The clouds are beautiful and the richness of the blue against the silvery white mountain is gorgeous!!!</td>', 'I love the stars amidst the night sky.  The clouds are beautiful and the richness of the blue against the silvery white mountain is gorgeous!!!', '2005-12-02 09:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915563, 263943, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the depth of field. Great clarity and detail in his wonderful face.  Nice job.</td>', 'I like the depth of field. Great clarity and detail in his wonderful face.  Nice job.', '2005-12-02 09:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915566, 256649, 42492, '<td valign="top">very pretty</td>', 'very pretty', '2005-12-02 09:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915567, 263076, 15711, '<td valign="top">The intense colors really work here. The blues and greens work so well together. It almost has a surreal sense to it.  Good job!!!</td>', 'The intense colors really work here. The blues and greens work so well together. It almost has a surreal sense to it.  Good job!!!', '2005-12-02 09:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915568, 262508, 42492, '<td valign="top">nice shot</td>', 'nice shot', '2005-12-02 09:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915570, 258248, 15711, '<td valign="top">The clarity and detail of his eye from that far away is excellent. I like the perspective and the crop.  Really well done. 8</td>', 'The clarity and detail of his eye from that far away is excellent. I like the perspective and the crop.  Really well done. 8', '2005-12-02 09:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915571, 261279, 42492, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2005-12-02 09:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915572, 263877, 15711, '<td valign="top">Stunning landscape.  It has all the elements that really capture my eye: reflection, a beautiful sky and an old building.  Nicely done!!! 8</td>', 'Stunning landscape.  It has all the elements that really capture my eye: reflection, a beautiful sky and an old building.  Nicely done!!! 8', '2005-12-02 09:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915573, 257484, 42492, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2005-12-02 09:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
