(1915662, 255145, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like everything about the image.  The composition, the stop action, the overall tonality of it.  Plus I really like the title.  The light skimming off of the wings with the smoke trailing past really is well done here.</td>', 'I like everything about the image.  The composition, the stop action, the overall tonality of it.  Plus I really like the title.  The light skimming off of the wings with the smoke trailing past really is well done here.', '2005-12-02 09:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915664, 257752, 43463, '<td valign="top">Classic B&amp;W adds a portrait feel to this in addition to making the image clean and simple without distractions of color. Lighting is spot on with it calling our eye''s attention directly to the model. Pose, dress, and expression of the model also plays into the concept of ''playful'' study. Very well done. One suggestion I have that could possibly add to the composition is to have had the model hold the book at a 45-60 degree angle such that the title of the book would be visible - and it would be titled "The Study of the Human Body" of course (or some title similiar to that - a textbook that I believe some art students studying how to draw the human body would use).</td>', 'Classic B&W adds a portrait feel to this in addition to making the image clean and simple without distractions of color. Lighting is spot on with it calling our eye''s attention directly to the model. Pose, dress, and expression of the model also plays into the concept of ''playful'' study. Very well done. One suggestion I have that could possibly add to the composition is to have had the model hold the book at a 45-60 degree angle such that the title of the book would be visible - and it would be titled "The Study of the Human Body" of course (or some title similiar to that - a textbook that I believe some art students studying how to draw the human body would use).', '2005-12-02 09:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915665, 263740, 15711, '<td valign="top">A beautiful winter scene.  All of the variations of blue are soothing and interesting. It''s like the mountains are encircling me and drawing me in.  Well done!!!</td>', 'A beautiful winter scene.  All of the variations of blue are soothing and interesting. It''s like the mountains are encircling me and drawing me in.  Well done!!!', '2005-12-02 09:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915670, 263787, 42492, '<td valign="top">very pretty</td>', 'very pretty', '2005-12-02 09:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915671, 261955, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really well done.  I can see this on the cover of a novel. The lighting in combination with the composure and leading line just sends your eye right to the subject. The subtle variations of shadow really help create the title''s mood.  Bravo. 9</td>', 'Really well done.  I can see this on the cover of a novel. The lighting in combination with the composure and leading line just sends your eye right to the subject. The subtle variations of shadow really help create the title''s mood.  Bravo. 9', '2005-12-02 09:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915673, 262857, 22533, '<td valign="top">Excellent colors, contrast, focus. The white area of the wing is a little hot though. Great job!</td>', 'Excellent colors, contrast, focus. The white area of the wing is a little hot though. Great job!', '2005-12-02 09:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915674, 253317, 42492, '<td valign="top">nice one</td>', 'nice one', '2005-12-02 09:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915675, 263970, 43463, '<td valign="top">A very interesting capture that invokes imagery of a magical and mysterious place that is ensrouded in fog. I love how you see just a smattering of trees through this heavy pinkish/blueish tinged fog. Colors tend to make me think of watercolors. In fact this photograph could almost pass for a painting. Very nice capture.</td>', 'A very interesting capture that invokes imagery of a magical and mysterious place that is ensrouded in fog. I love how you see just a smattering of trees through this heavy pinkish/blueish tinged fog. Colors tend to make me think of watercolors. In fact this photograph could almost pass for a painting. Very nice capture.', '2005-12-02 09:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915676, 264186, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is the superlative image of fall foliage.  The brightness and crisp detail amidst the blurred background - WOW.  Perfect DOF. I like that there are hints of blue and green in the background to help showcase the reds and golds of the leaves.  The lighting is spot on as well. This is pure visual eye candy for me.  BRAVO</td>', 'This is the superlative image of fall foliage.  The brightness and crisp detail amidst the blurred background - WOW.  Perfect DOF. I like that there are hints of blue and green in the background to help showcase the reds and golds of the leaves.  The lighting is spot on as well. This is pure visual eye candy for me.  BRAVO', '2005-12-02 09:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915677, 264054, 42492, '<td valign="top">very pretty</td>', 'very pretty', '2005-12-02 09:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915679, 264159, 15711, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject matter. I like how the shadow mimics the blue of the sky.  Ver unique take on the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting subject matter. I like how the shadow mimics the blue of the sky.  Ver unique take on the challenge.', '2005-12-02 09:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915681, 264109, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great metallic glow of gold.  The bird makes the shot for me. The softness reallyworks in combination with the vivid  colors, light and shadow.</td>', 'Great metallic glow of gold.  The bird makes the shot for me. The softness reallyworks in combination with the vivid  colors, light and shadow.', '2005-12-02 09:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915682, 263833, 22533, '<td valign="top">Dang, this is sweet. Great smoothness and clarity. Great job.</td>', 'Dang, this is sweet. Great smoothness and clarity. Great job.', '2005-12-02 09:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915683, 256160, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  The richs tones of blue and yellow with hints or orange are stunning. I like the flare created by the sun in the reflection. Beautiful panorama!!!</td>', 'Very pretty.  The richs tones of blue and yellow with hints or orange are stunning. I like the flare created by the sun in the reflection. Beautiful panorama!!!', '2005-12-02 09:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
