(1915697, 264027, 47205, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture. I love the colors in this</td>', 'Wonderful capture. I love the colors in this', '2005-12-02 09:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915698, 261556, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the light and shadow.  The perspective is nice.  I feel as if she is slightly out of focus. Her eyes are very intense and even show through in black and white.  They must be blue or light green.  The wisp of hair falling down on her right side is a nice touch. 7</td>', 'I like the light and shadow.  The perspective is nice.  I feel as if she is slightly out of focus. Her eyes are very intense and even show through in black and white.  They must be blue or light green.  The wisp of hair falling down on her right side is a nice touch. 7', '2005-12-02 09:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915705, 263048, 43463, '<td valign="top">I like those strong visual shots with stong clean shapes/lines that are color but could easily pass for B&amp;W because only those two colors dominate the scene. The stark, white groundplane and background compliment this barren tree by making it pop off the page. My only critique is that I would have changed the angle slightly so that the eye doesn''t have the distracting element of the some buildings which are visible on the far right hand side. Just a solid, clean, fully uncluttered white static background really complements the main subject - the tree.</td>', 'I like those strong visual shots with stong clean shapes/lines that are color but could easily pass for B&W because only those two colors dominate the scene. The stark, white groundplane and background compliment this barren tree by making it pop off the page. My only critique is that I would have changed the angle slightly so that the eye doesn''t have the distracting element of the some buildings which are visible on the far right hand side. Just a solid, clean, fully uncluttered white static background really complements the main subject - the tree.', '2005-12-02 09:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915706, 262275, 43463, '<td valign="top">A clean uncluttered image with just the sea below and the parasailer high above. Cropping is good for it calls attention directly and instantly to the main focus - the parasailer sailing high above the ocean waters. It also gives the viewer a sense of height and distance. My only critiques on improving the image would be that the color on the parasail be more richer in hue such that it really pops of the page - here it looks a little washed out. Also if the parasailer could be in sharper focus such that more details are visible would be good.</td>', 'A clean uncluttered image with just the sea below and the parasailer high above. Cropping is good for it calls attention directly and instantly to the main focus - the parasailer sailing high above the ocean waters. It also gives the viewer a sense of height and distance. My only critiques on improving the image would be that the color on the parasail be more richer in hue such that it really pops of the page - here it looks a little washed out. Also if the parasailer could be in sharper focus such that more details are visible would be good.', '2005-12-02 09:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915713, 254741, 43463, '<td valign="top">Interesting overall composition of B&amp;W with a smattering of color. The gold hue is what really stands out - actually it pops off the page and really captures the eye''s attention. What I find interesting about this photo is the gold of the fence trails down as a horizon line off into the distance much like the orange/gold leaves near the cobblestone pathway do as well. My critique on this piece is that for added interest you could have included more of that trail of leaves to follow and mimic that horizon line of the fence. A juxtaposition of a man-made one to a nature made one.</td>', 'Interesting overall composition of B&W with a smattering of color. The gold hue is what really stands out - actually it pops off the page and really captures the eye''s attention. What I find interesting about this photo is the gold of the fence trails down as a horizon line off into the distance much like the orange/gold leaves near the cobblestone pathway do as well. My critique on this piece is that for added interest you could have included more of that trail of leaves to follow and mimic that horizon line of the fence. A juxtaposition of a man-made one to a nature made one.', '2005-12-02 10:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915716, 264109, 43463, '<td valign="top">Visually and techincally this is a very good capture. The hues of golds and oranges project warmth. The two subjects stand hand in hand observing the warm glow of the sunset. An added boon to the visual interest is the addition of the capture of a seagull flying above the surf.</td>', 'Visually and techincally this is a very good capture. The hues of golds and oranges project warmth. The two subjects stand hand in hand observing the warm glow of the sunset. An added boon to the visual interest is the addition of the capture of a seagull flying above the surf.', '2005-12-02 10:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915726, 262316, 43463, '<td valign="top">A good capture of the moment. I think the visual would better suit the title if the zoom/crop was closer - a chest to head shot fully filling the frame. There is too much space surrounding the gorilla that it takes focus away from what you want to call attention too. A stronger visual equation to The Thinker and this gorilla which is striking the same pose would have been to tightly crop or frame your image as a medium shot (waist to head). Not only would you call direct attention to the action and pose of the gorilla but an added boon would be that we would see more of those facial features including what looks to be an intense stare.</td>', 'A good capture of the moment. I think the visual would better suit the title if the zoom/crop was closer - a chest to head shot fully filling the frame. There is too much space surrounding the gorilla that it takes focus away from what you want to call attention too. A stronger visual equation to The Thinker and this gorilla which is striking the same pose would have been to tightly crop or frame your image as a medium shot (waist to head). Not only would you call direct attention to the action and pose of the gorilla but an added boon would be that we would see more of those facial features including what looks to be an intense stare.', '2005-12-02 10:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915731, 263997, 24846, '<td valign="top">An eye grabbing silhouette. The colors are great. The convergence of clouds and sunset frames the main subject perfectly with the additional horseman adding another dimension to your image. As the lighting changes by the minute with sunsets and sunrises you picked a great shot from several you must have had. <br/>Good luck with this sunset/silhouette study. -10-</td>', 'An eye grabbing silhouette. The colors are great. The convergence of clouds and sunset frames the main subject perfectly with the additional horseman adding another dimension to your image. As the lighting changes by the minute with sunsets and sunrises you picked a great shot from several you must have had. Good luck with this sunset/silhouette study. -10-', '2005-12-02 10:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915735, 264185, 24846, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the morning fog. Nice composition. When I scroll down I like the image better with the yellow shrub in forground gone. Good luck with this landscape study.</td>', 'Nice capture of the morning fog. Nice composition. When I scroll down I like the image better with the yellow shrub in forground gone. Good luck with this landscape study.', '2005-12-02 10:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915742, 263638, 42638, '<td valign="top">Very nice action shot. This may sound strange but I really like his hair, It makes this shot different from many others. Good color</td>', 'Very nice action shot. This may sound strange but I really like his hair, It makes this shot different from many others. Good color', '2005-12-02 10:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915744, 264078, 42638, '<td valign="top">Wow, interesting picture, a bit out of focus but the light is intriguing(sp)</td>', 'Wow, interesting picture, a bit out of focus but the light is intriguing(sp)', '2005-12-02 10:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915745, 264054, 42638, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, sweet expression.</td>', 'Beautiful, sweet expression.', '2005-12-02 10:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915754, 260730, 15711, '<td valign="top">This almost has a plastic sense to it.  Neat image perhaps?  I like it though. Looks almost like a watercolor painting.  The huges from blue to purple are stunning. I like the texture of the dry grass peeking through the snow.  Nice~~ 7</td>', 'This almost has a plastic sense to it.  Neat image perhaps?  I like it though. Looks almost like a watercolor painting.  The huges from blue to purple are stunning. I like the texture of the dry grass peeking through the snow.  Nice~~ 7', '2005-12-02 10:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915758, 263025, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is a good portrait.  The focus seems on the mouth and nose and not the eyes though. The lighting is good and I like the tight crop.  I might do a slight selective color work and "unyellow" his skin just a touch.</td>', 'This is a good portrait.  The focus seems on the mouth and nose and not the eyes though. The lighting is good and I like the tight crop.  I might do a slight selective color work and "unyellow" his skin just a touch.', '2005-12-02 10:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915768, 261385, 7786, '<td valign="top">looks oversaturated to me.</td>', 'looks oversaturated to me.', '2005-12-02 10:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915776, 258117, 24846, '<td valign="top">Yes it is. I love cardinals and you captured a great image here.Great dof and the bg colors really accent your subject. The weathered branch accents it too. Good luck on this avian study -9-</td>', 'Yes it is. I love cardinals and you captured a great image here.Great dof and the bg colors really accent your subject. The weathered branch accents it too. Good luck on this avian study -9-', '2005-12-02 10:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915782, 261754, 1202, '<td valign="top">I can''t help but be a bit harsh on your picture.  I give you credit for getting out and shooting and please continue to do so.  Critisism: The old car and fence post overpower the sunflowers and they become lost in what may have been a much better landscape. suggestion:  Get in closer to your main subject, use a large aperature if possible as this will blurr out unwanted background.  Like I said, keep shooting and enjoy photography.</td>', 'I can''t help but be a bit harsh on your picture.  I give you credit for getting out and shooting and please continue to do so.  Critisism: The old car and fence post overpower the sunflowers and they become lost in what may have been a much better landscape. suggestion:  Get in closer to your main subject, use a large aperature if possible as this will blurr out unwanted background.  Like I said, keep shooting and enjoy photography.', '2005-12-02 10:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915788, 263675, 42792, '<td valign="top">A great Kaleidoscope of colours.  Just find the blurred colourful background a bit too busy and distracting to contrast well with the leaf in focus.</td>', 'A great Kaleidoscope of colours.  Just find the blurred colourful background a bit too busy and distracting to contrast well with the leaf in focus.', '2005-12-02 10:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915790, 263541, 42792, '<td valign="top">Nice composition potential with the interesting colours.  Unfortunately, it''s lost on overall sharpness.  DoF needs some work here between the foreground pink, middle green/turqoise and the background yellow.</td>', 'Nice composition potential with the interesting colours.  Unfortunately, it''s lost on overall sharpness.  DoF needs some work here between the foreground pink, middle green/turqoise and the background yellow.', '2005-12-02 10:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915792, 263875, 1202, '<td valign="top">You have used two strong aspects of good photography. A large clear main subject and motion blur for a background.  The image is still lacking in interest as you have chose a rather common subject which didn''t have any added  subject matter to make it of high interest.</td>', 'You have used two strong aspects of good photography. A large clear main subject and motion blur for a background.  The image is still lacking in interest as you have chose a rather common subject which didn''t have any added  subject matter to make it of high interest.', '2005-12-02 10:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915797, 263948, 42792, '<td valign="top">Composition:  would have positioned the 2 girls a little off-center maybe to the right.  <br/>Lighting: doesn''t seem even.  I could be wrong but the flash on the figures look a bit too artificial (see the harsh shadows) compared to the nice natural light of the sky.</td>', 'Composition:  would have positioned the 2 girls a little off-center maybe to the right.  Lighting: doesn''t seem even.  I could be wrong but the flash on the figures look a bit too artificial (see the harsh shadows) compared to the nice natural light of the sky.', '2005-12-02 10:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915798, 263558, 24846, '<td valign="top">As lighting changes by the minute you captured a lovely sunrise, great sky refelection on the water. the skiff in the reeds on shore make this more than a sunrise. Good luck with this sunrise study. -8-</td>', 'As lighting changes by the minute you captured a lovely sunrise, great sky refelection on the water. the skiff in the reeds on shore make this more than a sunrise. Good luck with this sunrise study. -8-', '2005-12-02 10:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915799, 264166, 42792, '<td valign="top">This could have been a really pretty picture with the composition you''ve chosen and sparkling light reflected on the pads.  Unfortunately, it''s OOF everywhere.</td>', 'This could have been a really pretty picture with the composition you''ve chosen and sparkling light reflected on the pads.  Unfortunately, it''s OOF everywhere.', '2005-12-02 10:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915801, 263623, 1202, '<td valign="top">First of all you have a lovely model.  I always say it is hard to take a bad picture of a great subject. Critism: I feel you needed to get some light into her left eye.  The three highlights in her right eye are a bit distracting, with none from the other.  Tight crops semm to be in, but I like her hair more than her sweater.</td>', 'First of all you have a lovely model.  I always say it is hard to take a bad picture of a great subject. Critism: I feel you needed to get some light into her left eye.  The three highlights in her right eye are a bit distracting, with none from the other.  Tight crops semm to be in, but I like her hair more than her sweater.', '2005-12-02 10:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915802, 260848, 42792, '<td valign="top">Some interesting colours but too over-processes.  Rather painful to the eye.</td>', 'Some interesting colours but too over-processes.  Rather painful to the eye.', '2005-12-02 10:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915805, 263631, 24846, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of this oask  majesty Love the tinge of pink and gradient of sky. Good luck with this nice study.</td>', 'Nice capture of this oask  majesty Love the tinge of pink and gradient of sky. Good luck with this nice study.', '2005-12-02 10:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915807, 264188, 42792, '<td valign="top">A bigger image might have been better, zooming in on the bulb.  As is, the bulb is almost lost overshadowed to a large degree by the blurred lights.</td>', 'A bigger image might have been better, zooming in on the bulb.  As is, the bulb is almost lost overshadowed to a large degree by the blurred lights.', '2005-12-02 10:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
