(1915812, 264050, 42792, '<td valign="top">The misty background does begin to look a little interesting except that a lot of details in the foreground is lost.  The harsh glare from the sky doesn''t help because that dominates the viewer''s eye.  Another observation which has nothing to do with the photo quality and how I score - don''t really get what this image is trying to convey in relation to the title.</td>', 'The misty background does begin to look a little interesting except that a lot of details in the foreground is lost.  The harsh glare from the sky doesn''t help because that dominates the viewer''s eye.  Another observation which has nothing to do with the photo quality and how I score - don''t really get what this image is trying to convey in relation to the title.', '2005-12-02 10:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915815, 258678, 39349, '<td valign="top">Like the textures you have working in this shot. Colors seem a bit flat, not sure if you were going for a selective desaturation. Good detail otherwise.</td>', 'Like the textures you have working in this shot. Colors seem a bit flat, not sure if you were going for a selective desaturation. Good detail otherwise.', '2005-12-02 11:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915816, 263854, 42638, '<td valign="top">Wow, Beautiful picture. I live in the desert and its too cold NOW to go swimming, can''t imagine it in this type of weather. Great title.</td>', 'Wow, Beautiful picture. I live in the desert and its too cold NOW to go swimming, can''t imagine it in this type of weather. Great title.', '2005-12-02 11:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915817, 263760, 39349, '<td valign="top">Interesting, I like the cool tones and your choice of DOF. Only thing taking away from this IMHO is the grain n the eyes. Otherwise gret stuff.</td>', 'Interesting, I like the cool tones and your choice of DOF. Only thing taking away from this IMHO is the grain n the eyes. Otherwise gret stuff.', '2005-12-02 11:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915818, 263503, 42792, '<td valign="top">I think I know what you''re getting at but it looks over-processes all the same.  Would actually like to see the original and what you intended.</td>', 'I think I know what you''re getting at but it looks over-processes all the same.  Would actually like to see the original and what you intended.', '2005-12-02 11:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
