(1916124, 263558, 15711, '<td valign="top">Stunning picture that goes from shadow into the light.  I love the dimly lit boat and grasses. Beautful image.</td>', 'Stunning picture that goes from shadow into the light.  I love the dimly lit boat and grasses. Beautful image.', '2005-12-02 12:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916126, 261908, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the half face crop.  Great clarity of the eye. I wonder if a darker background would have worked better. Hmmmmmm <br/> <br/>Nice lighting too.  8</td>', 'I like the half face crop.  Great clarity of the eye. I wonder if a darker background would have worked better. Hmmmmmm  Nice lighting too.  8', '2005-12-02 12:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916127, 260078, 21915, '<td valign="top">A classic shot, works well</td>', 'A classic shot, works well', '2005-12-02 12:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916128, 260833, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is lonely and emotive. I like the misty background with the single focal point - the boat.</td>', 'This is lonely and emotive. I like the misty background with the single focal point - the boat.', '2005-12-02 12:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916130, 263833, 15711, '<td valign="top">Like the boats are on a giant mirros.  Nice leading line.  The deep rich darkness of the colors is my kind of detail!! Well done. 8</td>', 'Like the boats are on a giant mirros.  Nice leading line.  The deep rich darkness of the colors is my kind of detail!! Well done. 8', '2005-12-02 12:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916131, 253317, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really interesting.  The water almost has a plastic appearance. This has a surreal sense and is unusual from the landscapes and other fare of this challenge. The placement of her face dead center works here. It would be a great study in black and white as well.</td>', 'Really interesting.  The water almost has a plastic appearance. This has a surreal sense and is unusual from the landscapes and other fare of this challenge. The placement of her face dead center works here. It would be a great study in black and white as well.', '2005-12-02 12:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916136, 264131, 15711, '<td valign="top">Simple architectural shots like this really appeal to me. I like the glas blocks immitating the lines of the larger stone squareso fht e building. It''s all so geometric. I can''t figure out if the window is the only color of the shot, or if indeed the bench and building are the same color. Well, whatever, it is striking and I like it.</td>', 'Simple architectural shots like this really appeal to me. I like the glas blocks immitating the lines of the larger stone squareso fht e building. It''s all so geometric. I can''t figure out if the window is the only color of the shot, or if indeed the bench and building are the same color. Well, whatever, it is striking and I like it.', '2005-12-02 12:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916140, 264121, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the monochromatic color scheme.  All the variations of green are very refreshing. Great detail on the lime!!!</td>', 'I like the monochromatic color scheme.  All the variations of green are very refreshing. Great detail on the lime!!!', '2005-12-02 12:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916147, 263461, 15711, '<td valign="top">This almost looks like a Christmas tree by accident. I like the vivid colors and the stars coming from the lights.  Great leading line.  Interesting and quite nice to look at!!</td>', 'This almost looks like a Christmas tree by accident. I like the vivid colors and the stars coming from the lights.  Great leading line.  Interesting and quite nice to look at!!', '2005-12-02 12:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916152, 256702, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the slight grain of this photo. It works for the dirty hands. The detail of the skin is well done. Good lighting too.</td>', 'I like the slight grain of this photo. It works for the dirty hands. The detail of the skin is well done. Good lighting too.', '2005-12-02 12:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916153, 263392, 21915, '<td valign="top">Good use of gradient, it works well</td>', 'Good use of gradient, it works well', '2005-12-02 12:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916154, 253936, 15711, '<td valign="top">Interesting. The light and shadow is good. The dirt on the face looks very "put on," but still the effect is there. I wish there were a glint in her left eye. Good detailing. Not sure about what she has around her neck. Looks almost like a snake but maybe a knitted scarf?  I can''t tell. 7</td>', 'Interesting. The light and shadow is good. The dirt on the face looks very "put on," but still the effect is there. I wish there were a glint in her left eye. Good detailing. Not sure about what she has around her neck. Looks almost like a snake but maybe a knitted scarf?  I can''t tell. 7', '2005-12-02 12:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916157, 264058, 15711, '<td valign="top">Brighton Beach?  I like the graphic sense. Very geometric. Great leading line and symmetry. The primary colors are terrific.</td>', 'Brighton Beach?  I like the graphic sense. Very geometric. Great leading line and symmetry. The primary colors are terrific.', '2005-12-02 12:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916159, 263640, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of the bridge and the person with the umbrella.  It has lots of black and I like it. Almost a dreamy sense without being blurred.</td>', 'I like the contrast of the bridge and the person with the umbrella.  It has lots of black and I like it. Almost a dreamy sense without being blurred.', '2005-12-02 12:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916161, 259418, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the canvas feel of this.  Looks like an old worn photo. The light and shadow is good. I like the slightly tousled hair in the back too. Almost like she awoke and went straight to the window to see if he was coming.</td>', 'I like the canvas feel of this.  Looks like an old worn photo. The light and shadow is good. I like the slightly tousled hair in the back too. Almost like she awoke and went straight to the window to see if he was coming.', '2005-12-02 12:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916162, 263646, 12311, '<td valign="top">This captures some painful memories for me... when my beloved Bills were driven out of the Charger''s stadium in an oh-so humiliating way :-(  (very nice job, BTW)</td>', 'This captures some painful memories for me... when my beloved Bills were driven out of the Charger''s stadium in an oh-so humiliating way :-(  (very nice job, BTW)', '2005-12-02 12:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916166, 264108, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of the baby.  I could do without the lips of the other person, but I''m sure that has some significance for you. Maybe "un red" the skin tones ever so slightly. Beautiful child. Love the eyes and lips.</td>', 'Nice shot of the baby.  I could do without the lips of the other person, but I''m sure that has some significance for you. Maybe "un red" the skin tones ever so slightly. Beautiful child. Love the eyes and lips.', '2005-12-02 12:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916168, 261418, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think this may have a touch too much Neat Image - her skin almost doesn''t look real. I like the clarity and the lighting very much. Her eyes are great!  7</td>', 'I think this may have a touch too much Neat Image - her skin almost doesn''t look real. I like the clarity and the lighting very much. Her eyes are great!  7', '2005-12-02 12:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916172, 261484, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice clear image. The makeup is great - very theatrical. I like the DOF too. I might whiten the teeth just a smidge. The overall composition is good and he being ever so slightly off centered works for me.</td>', 'Nice clear image. The makeup is great - very theatrical. I like the DOF too. I might whiten the teeth just a smidge. The overall composition is good and he being ever so slightly off centered works for me.', '2005-12-02 12:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916176, 263629, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the detail and the tight crop.</td>', 'I like the detail and the tight crop.', '2005-12-02 12:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916179, 254640, 15711, '<td valign="top">Not to be rude, but this just looks like a snapshot taken on a whim.  There is nothing artful or awe inspiring.  For this challenge, I think we expected deliberate well thought out images.  I''m sure it has sentimental value to you, but if it were to be effective, I''d take away the bottle, the towel, have the mom and baby maybe with just skin - nude (but nothing "showing) and have a black background or dark solid background.  It would evoke some sense of esthetic and really have impact.</td>', 'Not to be rude, but this just looks like a snapshot taken on a whim.  There is nothing artful or awe inspiring.  For this challenge, I think we expected deliberate well thought out images.  I''m sure it has sentimental value to you, but if it were to be effective, I''d take away the bottle, the towel, have the mom and baby maybe with just skin - nude (but nothing "showing) and have a black background or dark solid background.  It would evoke some sense of esthetic and really have impact.', '2005-12-02 12:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
