(1916244, 263492, 4226, '<td valign="top">the hue seems a bit off for the sky on my monitor... Its a great capture none the less</td>', 'the hue seems a bit off for the sky on my monitor... Its a great capture none the less', '2005-12-02 13:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916245, 263631, 45672, '<td valign="top">Good shot and use of the oak tree.  I think this could have been a little more effective if you were able to underexpose the foreground a little more.  In other words, the foreground should be completely black.  in doing this, you can usually get a little more color out of the sky because you are limiting the exposure time and thus not washing away all of the colors in the sky.  I am a big fan of oak trees and sunsets.  Nice going.</td>', 'Good shot and use of the oak tree.  I think this could have been a little more effective if you were able to underexpose the foreground a little more.  In other words, the foreground should be completely black.  in doing this, you can usually get a little more color out of the sky because you are limiting the exposure time and thus not washing away all of the colors in the sky.  I am a big fan of oak trees and sunsets.  Nice going.', '2005-12-02 13:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916254, 262055, 24784, '<td valign="top">not much Jimi Hendrix in the photo</td>', 'not much Jimi Hendrix in the photo', '2005-12-02 13:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
