(1916474, 262927, 40019, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot!  Very classic look to it. My only criticism would be in the "presentation" of the picture. I would have put a border of some type around it, to really focus you into the shot.  Unfortunately, the mid-tones get muted with the gray background of this web site.  If the background were black, this picture would really pop!  Just something to think about when previewing future entries - i.e., how does the picture present on the web page.  Great picture though! Love it!</td>', 'This is a great shot!  Very classic look to it. My only criticism would be in the "presentation" of the picture. I would have put a border of some type around it, to really focus you into the shot.  Unfortunately, the mid-tones get muted with the gray background of this web site.  If the background were black, this picture would really pop!  Just something to think about when previewing future entries - i.e., how does the picture present on the web page.  Great picture though! Love it!', '2005-12-02 14:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
