(1916505, 260010, 42100, '<td valign="top">I hope your scoring for this photo is going well.  This seems to be the type of photo that might get unfairly overlooked, simply because it is just a bus bench.  I hope everbody sees the qualities of this photo.  The composition is great.  Also, the tones and colors are very warm and wonderful.  Great eye for this shot!</td>', 'I hope your scoring for this photo is going well.  This seems to be the type of photo that might get unfairly overlooked, simply because it is just a bus bench.  I hope everbody sees the qualities of this photo.  The composition is great.  Also, the tones and colors are very warm and wonderful.  Great eye for this shot!', '2005-12-02 14:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916527, 263943, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - Excellent.  Good color, texture, focus, crop, background and character.  Criticism; not much, want to say the nose a bit sharper, but likely difficult to get those eyes so good as you have, not sure.  Like the leaf/grass(?) in the mouth (if that also were sharper, be even better) and the bits of grass(?) ''here and there'' on the fur, which maybe, a fraction more detail/texture in may have made this even better (the focus shift issues aside) but not sure on that as I like this like it is.  Doesn''t look over-processed, which is good.  Maybe, wider (640), but not sure, like the vertical framing - also would depend what you had to work with.  Great shot as is.  Title (minor), ''works'', but those eyes lend themselves to a more befitting title, ''maybe''. edit:wording<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-08 15:40:09.</i></td>', '9 - Excellent.  Good color, texture, focus, crop, background and character.  Criticism; not much, want to say the nose a bit sharper, but likely difficult to get those eyes so good as you have, not sure.  Like the leaf/grass(?) in the mouth (if that also were sharper, be even better) and the bits of grass(?) ''here and there'' on the fur, which maybe, a fraction more detail/texture in may have made this even better (the focus shift issues aside) but not sure on that as I like this like it is.  Doesn''t look over-processed, which is good.  Maybe, wider (640), but not sure, like the vertical framing - also would depend what you had to work with.  Great shot as is.  Title (minor), ''works'', but those eyes lend themselves to a more befitting title, ''maybe''. edit:wording', '2005-12-02 15:05:55.000000', '2005-12-08 15:40:09.000000', 1),
