(1916621, 264167, 46097, '<td valign="top">Thats a great capture, well done. You''ve managed to hold the camera with one hand ( I think ), while feeding the bird with the other, and still have sharp focus and perfect timing. If only this had a narrow depth of field, so that the background was less busy, it would have been sensational. Also, I wonder if you can darken your arm with a selection in photoshop, so that the attention is more focused on the bird. Still, a very good entry indeed. 8.</td>', 'Thats a great capture, well done. You''ve managed to hold the camera with one hand ( I think ), while feeding the bird with the other, and still have sharp focus and perfect timing. If only this had a narrow depth of field, so that the background was less busy, it would have been sensational. Also, I wonder if you can darken your arm with a selection in photoshop, so that the attention is more focused on the bird. Still, a very good entry indeed. 8.', '2005-12-02 15:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
