(1916763, 259613, 24846, '<td valign="top">So delicate. Good luck.</td>', 'So delicate. Good luck.', '2005-12-02 16:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916764, 263894, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice picture and sunset.  Two slight criticisms: 1) need to work the horizontal, unless you were trying to give the illusion that you are on a boat (in which case, don''t do that), and 2) just a little too over sharpened - very noticable by the hanging plant.  Straighten it out and soften it up and you''ll have an outstanding shot (IMO).</td>', 'Nice picture and sunset.  Two slight criticisms: 1) need to work the horizontal, unless you were trying to give the illusion that you are on a boat (in which case, don''t do that), and 2) just a little too over sharpened - very noticable by the hanging plant.  Straighten it out and soften it up and you''ll have an outstanding shot (IMO).', '2005-12-02 16:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916767, 264025, 24846, '<td valign="top">A different perspective. Good luck.</td>', 'A different perspective. Good luck.', '2005-12-02 16:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916769, 264069, 24846, '<td valign="top">A delight.Good luck.</td>', 'A delight.Good luck.', '2005-12-02 16:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916772, 263999, 24846, '<td valign="top">Like the yellows.Good luck.</td>', 'Like the yellows.Good luck.', '2005-12-02 16:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916775, 263515, 24846, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting and shadow study. Good luck.</td>', 'Interesting lighting and shadow study. Good luck.', '2005-12-02 16:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916777, 263646, 24846, '<td valign="top">Yor sure ae. Great action study.</td>', 'Yor sure ae. Great action study.', '2005-12-02 16:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916785, 264007, 24846, '<td valign="top">Like the perspective you picked on this volcanic landscape study. Nice to see an Icelandic work without the Aurelius. Good luck.</td>', 'Like the perspective you picked on this volcanic landscape study. Nice to see an Icelandic work without the Aurelius. Good luck.', '2005-12-02 16:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916787, 263137, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice job on the eyes.  I think I know where you were trying to go with this, but it just doesn''t appeal to me - more color would have been nice, it''s a little too bleached out. The eyes are very striking though - it worked there!</td>', 'Nice job on the eyes.  I think I know where you were trying to go with this, but it just doesn''t appeal to me - more color would have been nice, it''s a little too bleached out. The eyes are very striking though - it worked there!', '2005-12-02 16:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916790, 264060, 24846, '<td valign="top">Nice b/w study of light and shadow. Like the way he''s just visually detectable. <br/>Good luck.</td>', 'Nice b/w study of light and shadow. Like the way he''s just visually detectable. Good luck.', '2005-12-02 16:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916792, 254511, 24846, '<td valign="top">Pretty capture, dof. Good luck.</td>', 'Pretty capture, dof. Good luck.', '2005-12-02 16:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916794, 261617, 28299, '<td valign="top">Has a "joey-like" quality. Love the textures and the colors against the white. 10</td>', 'Has a "joey-like" quality. Love the textures and the colors against the white. 10', '2005-12-02 16:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916795, 262381, 24846, '<td valign="top">Nice use of exposure and like the perspective. Good luck.</td>', 'Nice use of exposure and like the perspective. Good luck.', '2005-12-02 16:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916797, 259418, 40019, '<td valign="top">Ok, you got me on this one (as I am traveling on business this week) - I''ll be home tonight!  Nicely done, evokes emotion (at least from me), I like the grain.  Can''t wait to see my own daughter.  :-)  [bumping up]</td>', 'Ok, you got me on this one (as I am traveling on business this week) - I''ll be home tonight!  Nicely done, evokes emotion (at least from me), I like the grain.  Can''t wait to see my own daughter.  :-)  [bumping up]', '2005-12-02 16:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916801, 263934, 24846, '<td valign="top">A surreal type effect for me. Interesting capture. Good luck.</td>', 'A surreal type effect for me. Interesting capture. Good luck.', '2005-12-02 16:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916802, 263982, 40019, '<td valign="top">I guess those gloves don''t come off?  Good thing there is hardly anyone in the crowd.  :-)  Fun picture, good focus.  Tough competition in this challenge though.</td>', 'I guess those gloves don''t come off?  Good thing there is hardly anyone in the crowd.  :-)  Fun picture, good focus.  Tough competition in this challenge though.', '2005-12-02 16:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916804, 263228, 40019, '<td valign="top">Great colors! (although I don''t think I have ever seen the sky that purple before).</td>', 'Great colors! (although I don''t think I have ever seen the sky that purple before).', '2005-12-02 16:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916812, 262921, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice macro, but the colors are detail are a little muted.  I would have done a little more saturation and sharpening.  It has a nice soft feel to it though.</td>', 'Nice macro, but the colors are detail are a little muted.  I would have done a little more saturation and sharpening.  It has a nice soft feel to it though.', '2005-12-02 16:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916815, 260918, 40019, '<td valign="top">Scary clouds.  Love the rich colors!</td>', 'Scary clouds.  Love the rich colors!', '2005-12-02 16:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916817, 264086, 40019, '<td valign="top">Wow, looks like a gray card - very cool!</td>', 'Wow, looks like a gray card - very cool!', '2005-12-02 16:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916819, 262055, 40019, '<td valign="top">What a crack-up!  Do you vacuum your hair when it needs cleaning?  Fun capture!</td>', 'What a crack-up!  Do you vacuum your hair when it needs cleaning?  Fun capture!', '2005-12-02 16:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916822, 259353, 30881, '<td valign="top">Normally I try to find something positive to say about a photo. This leaves me wordless.<br/>Terrible background choice, poor lighting skills, Layout is over cluttered and tacky, lacks sharpness/contrast. Terrible subject choice and a very trashy pose. With all the highly competent and skilled members presenting there work here, its quite likely this will be fighting over last place. If you really are serious about photography perhaps browse through the challenge archives and see what previous winners have done to achieve ribbon status.</td>', 'Normally I try to find something positive to say about a photo. This leaves me wordless.Terrible background choice, poor lighting skills, Layout is over cluttered and tacky, lacks sharpness/contrast. Terrible subject choice and a very trashy pose. With all the highly competent and skilled members presenting there work here, its quite likely this will be fighting over last place. If you really are serious about photography perhaps browse through the challenge archives and see what previous winners have done to achieve ribbon status.', '2005-12-02 16:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916825, 263385, 40019, '<td valign="top">Very cute!  Good job on the eyes! The rest is just a little over sharpened for my liking, I would have liked it a little softer.  Great focus and DOF though!  Looks like a fun time was had in making this picture. :-)</td>', 'Very cute!  Good job on the eyes! The rest is just a little over sharpened for my liking, I would have liked it a little softer.  Great focus and DOF though!  Looks like a fun time was had in making this picture. :-)', '2005-12-02 16:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916830, 264005, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice job Ali, I love the rich colors.  Nice find and capture!</td>', 'Nice job Ali, I love the rich colors.  Nice find and capture!', '2005-12-02 16:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
