(1917073, 264023, 41066, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous Color.  Great detail in the middle.  I think I personally would have liked to have seen the edges of the petals a little sharper but the overall effect is great!</td>', 'Gorgeous Color.  Great detail in the middle.  I think I personally would have liked to have seen the edges of the petals a little sharper but the overall effect is great!', '2005-12-02 18:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
