(1917075, 263806, 27789, '<td valign="top">nice capture, my suggestion would be to crop out the top half of the photograph; i think the foreground bird, with its shadow, pointing right at the rainbow of colors, is where the magic of the shot is at. And if that were brightened up, would make a really nice bird shot.</td>', 'nice capture, my suggestion would be to crop out the top half of the photograph; i think the foreground bird, with its shadow, pointing right at the rainbow of colors, is where the magic of the shot is at. And if that were brightened up, would make a really nice bird shot.', '2005-12-02 18:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
