(1917590, 258931, 8125, '<td valign="top">oooohhhh, aaaaahhhh  -  where is this???  Great color saturation.  It''s a tough time of day to shoot with partial sun and clouds - you did a nice job despite that!</td>', 'oooohhhh, aaaaahhhh  -  where is this???  Great color saturation.  It''s a tough time of day to shoot with partial sun and clouds - you did a nice job despite that!', '2005-12-02 21:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
