(1917669, 263390, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love the bold action caught here. The figure leaps into the air and seems to escape the bonds of gravity as he/she hurls skyward.The pose of the figure is great for it conveys to me the idea of someone leaping with all their might.  Love the hues and the brilliance of the sun seen bursting through the clouds.</td>', 'Love the bold action caught here. The figure leaps into the air and seems to escape the bonds of gravity as he/she hurls skyward.The pose of the figure is great for it conveys to me the idea of someone leaping with all their might.  Love the hues and the brilliance of the sun seen bursting through the clouds.', '2005-12-02 21:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
