(1918396, 264039, 26679, '<td valign="top">The simplicity makes the image.  I would prefer to see the string not leading right through the corner, A slighly different crop would fix this.</td>', 'The simplicity makes the image.  I would prefer to see the string not leading right through the corner, A slighly different crop would fix this.', '2005-12-03 04:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918398, 263894, 26679, '<td valign="top">The colours here are beautiful, and the framing used does draw ones eye into the image. I am one of those people who prefer their horizons to be horizontal, so I would like to see some rotation here and maybe a little less sharpening as those tell tale halos can be distracting.  <br/> <br/>That all being said this still captures my eye<br/></td>', 'The colours here are beautiful, and the framing used does draw ones eye into the image. I am one of those people who prefer their horizons to be horizontal, so I would like to see some rotation here and maybe a little less sharpening as those tell tale halos can be distracting.   That all being said this still captures my eye', '2005-12-03 04:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918401, 264203, 26679, '<td valign="top">The colours here are fantastic, you have created a lovely image. For me rotating the image CCW about 1/3 of a degree would straighten the horizon, and avoid the distraction this causes.</td>', 'The colours here are fantastic, you have created a lovely image. For me rotating the image CCW about 1/3 of a degree would straighten the horizon, and avoid the distraction this causes.', '2005-12-03 04:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
