(1918459, 264171, 33145, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot (composition, lighting, color) ruined by over-smoothing of the subject''s skin. While this type of shot has been done many times before (with good results) I think this would have scored very high had there been more natural skin and eye texture.</td>', 'Fantastic shot (composition, lighting, color) ruined by over-smoothing of the subject''s skin. While this type of shot has been done many times before (with good results) I think this would have scored very high had there been more natural skin and eye texture.', '2005-12-03 05:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
