(1918559, 264020, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good execution.  Good color &amp; color matching.  Criticism; the ''paper''(?) base ''works'' but doesn''t add to the feel in this shot in my opinion.  Perhaps if the focus were not so sharp on it (especially under the limiwi), might have made this even better, or perhaps an ''even distribution'', it just is noticeable on that side.  Overall a fraction ''sterile'' feeling, perhaps a slightly different placement (more fore) of the limiwi, giving a little more ''depth'', may have also given this extra.  Would like to see similiar texture on that left lime, as is on the slightly out of focus one on the right.  Perhaps the ''space'' top/bottom shifted so it wasn''t so centered, not sure.</td>', '8 - Good execution.  Good color & color matching.  Criticism; the ''paper''(?) base ''works'' but doesn''t add to the feel in this shot in my opinion.  Perhaps if the focus were not so sharp on it (especially under the limiwi), might have made this even better, or perhaps an ''even distribution'', it just is noticeable on that side.  Overall a fraction ''sterile'' feeling, perhaps a slightly different placement (more fore) of the limiwi, giving a little more ''depth'', may have also given this extra.  Would like to see similiar texture on that left lime, as is on the slightly out of focus one on the right.  Perhaps the ''space'' top/bottom shifted so it wasn''t so centered, not sure.', '2005-12-03 06:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918563, 262072, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very good.  Criticism; perhaps looks a little ''softened'', but it works.  The capture and ''composition'', choice of crop/framing, is what I like most in this.  Just to contradict that, if the tail were not cropped, would be good (depending what you had to work with of course), but then you''d likely lose the detail you have here, and/or, just be a different style/shot again (obviously).  Possibly contrast/blow out issues in the ''hair'' but, very difficult to adjust this I imagine, especially while trying to retain the ''softness''.  Still like to see a little more detail in the face, especially the ''right'' eye with the same ''sparkle'' as the ''left''.</td>', '8 - Very good.  Criticism; perhaps looks a little ''softened'', but it works.  The capture and ''composition'', choice of crop/framing, is what I like most in this.  Just to contradict that, if the tail were not cropped, would be good (depending what you had to work with of course), but then you''d likely lose the detail you have here, and/or, just be a different style/shot again (obviously).  Possibly contrast/blow out issues in the ''hair'' but, very difficult to adjust this I imagine, especially while trying to retain the ''softness''.  Still like to see a little more detail in the face, especially the ''right'' eye with the same ''sparkle'' as the ''left''.', '2005-12-03 07:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918564, 263390, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Like it.  Good silhouette and movement capture and pose.  Criticism; minor, but perhaps the title doesn''t ''enhance'' this as much as another may have, but your call.  Perhaps a slightly tighter crop on the left, a little more texture (difficult and camera/lens dependent likely) in the foreground sand (especially using the footsteps, or not) and a slight tweaking of the colors (contrast issues likely), may have made this even better in my opinion.  Not sure on the frame.</td>', '8 - Like it.  Good silhouette and movement capture and pose.  Criticism; minor, but perhaps the title doesn''t ''enhance'' this as much as another may have, but your call.  Perhaps a slightly tighter crop on the left, a little more texture (difficult and camera/lens dependent likely) in the foreground sand (especially using the footsteps, or not) and a slight tweaking of the colors (contrast issues likely), may have made this even better in my opinion.  Not sure on the frame.', '2005-12-03 07:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918567, 262628, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Excellent.  An almost perfect reflection, barring perspective(s).  Criticism; difficult, perhaps slightly enhancing the ''blue'' of the ice more, the browns in the rocks and pinks in the sunset/rise, may have made this even better in my opinion.  Not sure on the frame, works but, at this size, not sure.  Of course this size does not do this justice - but you know that.</td>', '8 - Excellent.  An almost perfect reflection, barring perspective(s).  Criticism; difficult, perhaps slightly enhancing the ''blue'' of the ice more, the browns in the rocks and pinks in the sunset/rise, may have made this even better in my opinion.  Not sure on the frame, works but, at this size, not sure.  Of course this size does not do this justice - but you know that.', '2005-12-03 07:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918569, 262097, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice.  Criticism; difficult, but perhaps a little more detail in the fore rocks (if possible without losing the excellent focus as is), may have made this even better and given it an extra element.  The cropping (depending what you had to work with) works well, but perhaps a slight adjustment, off-setting more, or balancing more, who knows.</td>', '8 - Very nice.  Criticism; difficult, but perhaps a little more detail in the fore rocks (if possible without losing the excellent focus as is), may have made this even better and given it an extra element.  The cropping (depending what you had to work with) works well, but perhaps a slight adjustment, off-setting more, or balancing more, who knows.', '2005-12-03 07:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918572, 258587, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Excellent perspective and scaling.  Criticism; apologies if wrong but, the horizon looks like it needs a slight nudge up on the right.  Depending what you had to work with, perhaps the couple a little more off center, or centered more, not sure.  Works well like this, but wonder whether a variation would have given this just a little ''extra''.  The colors are nice and difficult to adjust given the variation I imagine.  Perhaps a small ''issue'' bottom right corner of the frame, ''dark area'', not sure.  As I said, for me, the best thing about this shot, is the perspective and scale.</td>', '8 - Excellent perspective and scaling.  Criticism; apologies if wrong but, the horizon looks like it needs a slight nudge up on the right.  Depending what you had to work with, perhaps the couple a little more off center, or centered more, not sure.  Works well like this, but wonder whether a variation would have given this just a little ''extra''.  The colors are nice and difficult to adjust given the variation I imagine.  Perhaps a small ''issue'' bottom right corner of the frame, ''dark area'', not sure.  As I said, for me, the best thing about this shot, is the perspective and scale.', '2005-12-03 07:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918573, 257902, 44728, '<td valign="top">Ahw that''s a great capture of a lovely expression!<br/> <br/>Wish I could vote on it, I would give it a 9 !</td>', 'Ahw that''s a great capture of a lovely expression! Wish I could vote on it, I would give it a 9 !', '2005-12-03 07:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918596, 262470, 12311, '<td valign="top">Interesting capture, seems to be a good range of tones.  To me, however, the color appears a little unrealistic, and I think a not-so-tight crop would make this an even better shot.  Pretty good as it is, though.</td>', 'Interesting capture, seems to be a good range of tones.  To me, however, the color appears a little unrealistic, and I think a not-so-tight crop would make this an even better shot.  Pretty good as it is, though.', '2005-12-03 08:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918597, 263982, 12311, '<td valign="top">Love the title!!  Nice DOF to focus attention on the foreground.  The only thing I''d change is to not crop so tightly.  I''d prefer a little more ground on the bottom, - but that''s just me.  Nice capture!</td>', 'Love the title!!  Nice DOF to focus attention on the foreground.  The only thing I''d change is to not crop so tightly.  I''d prefer a little more ground on the bottom, - but that''s just me.  Nice capture!', '2005-12-03 08:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918599, 262832, 12311, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture.  What might improve this shot would be to up the contrast and use a little less sharpening.  Good scene, though.</td>', 'Very nice capture.  What might improve this shot would be to up the contrast and use a little less sharpening.  Good scene, though.', '2005-12-03 08:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918602, 261955, 12311, '<td valign="top">Good use of toning here.  I like the expression on the little girl''s face.  My nephew appears to be about the same age.  I always try to piss him off just to get some interesting facial contortions ;-)  Nice work!!</td>', 'Good use of toning here.  I like the expression on the little girl''s face.  My nephew appears to be about the same age.  I always try to piss him off just to get some interesting facial contortions ;-)  Nice work!!', '2005-12-03 08:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918603, 262921, 12311, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  As a suggestion for improvement, I''d try to enhance the contrast and color saturation a bit, to make it "pop".</td>', 'Nice image.  As a suggestion for improvement, I''d try to enhance the contrast and color saturation a bit, to make it "pop".', '2005-12-03 08:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918606, 264085, 29490, '<td valign="top">Wow!!  I don''t know what else to say - what an excellent capture.  The definition in the smoke is amazing and Ilove the lighting.  This is a contender!!</td>', 'Wow!!  I don''t know what else to say - what an excellent capture.  The definition in the smoke is amazing and Ilove the lighting.  This is a contender!!', '2005-12-03 08:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918607, 263946, 34133, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours and vivid greens, wonderful</td>', 'Beautiful colours and vivid greens, wonderful', '2005-12-03 08:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918611, 263076, 34133, '<td valign="top">How did you do this? The brightness of the center and the dark surrundings, amazing lighting</td>', 'How did you do this? The brightness of the center and the dark surrundings, amazing lighting', '2005-12-03 08:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918612, 264132, 31443, '<td valign="top">What a magnificent animal! Pity you didn´t get all of it into the frame, powerful as is though!</td>', 'What a magnificent animal! Pity you didn´t get all of it into the frame, powerful as is though!', '2005-12-03 08:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
