(1918673, 263151, 42638, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture. Reminds me of home. Love the lone saguaro there and the blue hues in the water and sky. Love it! .....Has to be AZ?</td>', 'Excellent picture. Reminds me of home. Love the lone saguaro there and the blue hues in the water and sky. Love it! .....Has to be AZ?', '2005-12-03 09:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
