(1918679, 260918, 42638, '<td valign="top">Wow, those clouds are amazing. Love the color but the texture is incredible, nice catch!</td>', 'Wow, those clouds are amazing. Love the color but the texture is incredible, nice catch!', '2005-12-03 09:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
