(1918687, 262711, 42638, '<td valign="top">Mmmm...I love prickley pear fruit! Good picture. Love the reds and greens against the beautiful blue. There is some glare on that pad, you might want to use some filters or adjust your exposure a bit. Nice composition.</td>', 'Mmmm...I love prickley pear fruit! Good picture. Love the reds and greens against the beautiful blue. There is some glare on that pad, you might want to use some filters or adjust your exposure a bit. Nice composition.', '2005-12-03 09:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
