(1918739, 261364, 42256, '<td valign="top">Is the glass really huge or the cat really small, whatever it is, great composition ! It feels good to see something you vote high to finish up high :) <br/> <br/>Good Luck!</td>', 'Is the glass really huge or the cat really small, whatever it is, great composition ! It feels good to see something you vote high to finish up high :)  Good Luck!', '2005-12-03 10:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918741, 264171, 41675, '<td valign="top">The veil is nice, but the eyebrows and eyes are just a bit too overprocessed for my personal tastes.</td>', 'The veil is nice, but the eyebrows and eyes are just a bit too overprocessed for my personal tastes.', '2005-12-03 10:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918742, 263930, 41675, '<td valign="top">Your photo makes me smile. What a great capture. Racoons are so inquisitive. Well done.</td>', 'Your photo makes me smile. What a great capture. Racoons are so inquisitive. Well done.', '2005-12-03 10:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918750, 263730, 37544, '<td valign="top">this would have been great for the camo challenge, his shirt and the sepia tone almost make him dissapear! I like the angle of the shot and the texture of the wood combined with the dead branches.</td>', 'this would have been great for the camo challenge, his shirt and the sepia tone almost make him dissapear! I like the angle of the shot and the texture of the wood combined with the dead branches.', '2005-12-03 10:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918751, 264165, 34133, '<td valign="top">Excellent title, wonderful image</td>', 'Excellent title, wonderful image', '2005-12-03 10:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918776, 253018, 37544, '<td valign="top">the lighting is a little too harsh on top of her head, but in a way I like it. The rest of the picture looks fantanstic! Love that expression on her face.</td>', 'the lighting is a little too harsh on top of her head, but in a way I like it. The rest of the picture looks fantanstic! Love that expression on her face.', '2005-12-03 10:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918782, 264194, 37544, '<td valign="top">wonderful</td>', 'wonderful', '2005-12-03 10:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918784, 263765, 37544, '<td valign="top">great moment! Wish the edges of the faces were more in focus.</td>', 'great moment! Wish the edges of the faces were more in focus.', '2005-12-03 10:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918787, 263391, 40386, '<td valign="top">I like this shot but the horizon and person are a bit too central for my liking, personally I would have cropped a bit from the bottom and behind the man to use the rule of thirds to more advantage.  Good luck</td>', 'I like this shot but the horizon and person are a bit too central for my liking, personally I would have cropped a bit from the bottom and behind the man to use the rule of thirds to more advantage.  Good luck', '2005-12-03 10:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918792, 262310, 32767, '<td valign="top">Nice image...terrible title.</td>', 'Nice image...terrible title.', '2005-12-03 10:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918796, 263833, 27562, '<td valign="top">What you have created here is an incredible photo with beautiful lighting, excellent tonality and with a wonderful atmosphere.  I love how the horizon line virtually disappears.  My only critique would be that, IMO the composition would benefit from a slightly simpler elements. I would have excluded the boats in the background (although they are beautifully lit) leaving the solitary one as the principle subject.  I realize that this could have been out your control.  Outstanding work.</td>', 'What you have created here is an incredible photo with beautiful lighting, excellent tonality and with a wonderful atmosphere.  I love how the horizon line virtually disappears.  My only critique would be that, IMO the composition would benefit from a slightly simpler elements. I would have excluded the boats in the background (although they are beautifully lit) leaving the solitary one as the principle subject.  I realize that this could have been out your control.  Outstanding work.', '2005-12-03 10:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918804, 264004, 27562, '<td valign="top">The sky &amp; clouds are quite lovely, but the lighting on the structure is a bit disturbing.  IMO it would have benfited by letting it go to comlete siGreat composition.  The foreground, sky &amp; clouds are quite lovely, but the lighting on the structure is a bit disturbing.  IMO it would have benefited by letting it go to complete silhouette (which cold have been difficult with the white trim) or better yet add some fill light with a flash. Good work.</td>', 'The sky & clouds are quite lovely, but the lighting on the structure is a bit disturbing.  IMO it would have benfited by letting it go to comlete siGreat composition.  The foreground, sky & clouds are quite lovely, but the lighting on the structure is a bit disturbing.  IMO it would have benefited by letting it go to complete silhouette (which cold have been difficult with the white trim) or better yet add some fill light with a flash. Good work.', '2005-12-03 10:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918812, 262337, 27562, '<td valign="top">Sharpness where it counts.  Could have been improved with come color/tone in the background.  Good work.</td>', 'Sharpness where it counts.  Could have been improved with come color/tone in the background.  Good work.', '2005-12-03 11:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918813, 262933, 27562, '<td valign="top">Beautiful alpine glow.  Clasiic composition and rich wonderful colors.  Great work.</td>', 'Beautiful alpine glow.  Clasiic composition and rich wonderful colors.  Great work.', '2005-12-03 11:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918817, 263391, 40126, '<td valign="top">rather than dead centered, id position the man to the left a thrid halfway. my one cent.</td>', 'rather than dead centered, id position the man to the left a thrid halfway. my one cent.', '2005-12-03 11:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918821, 262693, 7485, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo, but I''d much prefer it with the whole bright region in the lower right corner cropped away.</td>', 'Lovely photo, but I''d much prefer it with the whole bright region in the lower right corner cropped away.', '2005-12-03 11:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918822, 263833, 49005, '<td valign="top">very good composition.</td>', 'very good composition.', '2005-12-03 11:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918830, 263562, 7485, '<td valign="top">Fabulous lighting! That little sliver of light on the eye really makes the photo. The out-of-focus background is excellent, but unfortunately it makes the noise very apparent. Noise Ninja/Neatimage would solve that, but you might have to mask out the bird to save the plumage. 8</td>', 'Fabulous lighting! That little sliver of light on the eye really makes the photo. The out-of-focus background is excellent, but unfortunately it makes the noise very apparent. Noise Ninja/Neatimage would solve that, but you might have to mask out the bird to save the plumage. 8', '2005-12-03 11:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918839, 263438, 7485, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot. The fade to black at the top is perfect. Too bad about the noise, Noise Ninja/Neatimage might be able to solve that. Also, the high-contrast frame is a bit too distracting, a thin solid color would''ve been better. 7</td>', 'Gorgeous shot. The fade to black at the top is perfect. Too bad about the noise, Noise Ninja/Neatimage might be able to solve that. Also, the high-contrast frame is a bit too distracting, a thin solid color would''ve been better. 7', '2005-12-03 11:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918841, 257902, 48928, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites so far :)</td>', 'One of my favorites so far :)', '2005-12-03 11:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918843, 263629, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great crop and excellent use of very high contrast - 8</td>', 'Great crop and excellent use of very high contrast - 8', '2005-12-03 11:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918846, 259342, 7485, '<td valign="top">Good pose and background (and great model!), but the skin is to heavily processed for my taste.</td>', 'Good pose and background (and great model!), but the skin is to heavily processed for my taste.', '2005-12-03 11:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918847, 259826, 48928, '<td valign="top">The light is almost too distracting, but still a good picture</td>', 'The light is almost too distracting, but still a good picture', '2005-12-03 11:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918853, 261634, 7485, '<td valign="top">Wow, you should win the "thought-provoking picture" price! Very well shot too, with the blend of crisp texture (the letters and lines of the palm) and smooth gradients. Only nit to pick is that little distracting bright dot on the far right - 9</td>', 'Wow, you should win the "thought-provoking picture" price! Very well shot too, with the blend of crisp texture (the letters and lines of the palm) and smooth gradients. Only nit to pick is that little distracting bright dot on the far right - 9', '2005-12-03 11:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918856, 263048, 41703, '<td valign="top">Stunning. Good luck.</td>', 'Stunning. Good luck.', '2005-12-03 11:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918859, 264031, 7485, '<td valign="top">Well composed, that guy in the middle really brings the photo together. Too bad about all the compression artifacts.</td>', 'Well composed, that guy in the middle really brings the photo together. Too bad about all the compression artifacts.', '2005-12-03 11:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918866, 264175, 41703, '<td valign="top">I really like the overall colour tone. A very evocative shot</td>', 'I really like the overall colour tone. A very evocative shot', '2005-12-03 11:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918869, 261556, 7485, '<td valign="top">Beautiful expression, artistically lit (especially the eyes!), and great use of shallow DOF. The eyelashes on her right eye look a little odd, either over-processed or too much mascara.</td>', 'Beautiful expression, artistically lit (especially the eyes!), and great use of shallow DOF. The eyelashes on her right eye look a little odd, either over-processed or too much mascara.', '2005-12-03 11:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
