(1919103, 263894, 19982, '<td valign="top">Watch out for the halos...  the tiny branches especially show that the image has been oversharpened, but you can also see the halo around the island in the center.  Love the texture of the sky. The water probably shouldn''t be sharpened at all.  Then tilt your horizon back to where the water is level....  everyone knows water will run down hill so images of water especially need to be straight.</td>', 'Watch out for the halos...  the tiny branches especially show that the image has been oversharpened, but you can also see the halo around the island in the center.  Love the texture of the sky. The water probably shouldn''t be sharpened at all.  Then tilt your horizon back to where the water is level....  everyone knows water will run down hill so images of water especially need to be straight.', '2005-12-03 14:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
