(1919109, 256370, 19982, '<td valign="top">There is a funny brownish darkening in the center of her left cheek ... as if it has been dodged while the surrounding cheek was not.  If anything, the way light falls on a curved surface, that part of her cheek ought to be brighter than the rest.</td>', 'There is a funny brownish darkening in the center of her left cheek ... as if it has been dodged while the surrounding cheek was not.  If anything, the way light falls on a curved surface, that part of her cheek ought to be brighter than the rest.', '2005-12-03 14:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
