(1919568, 262349, 24846, '<td valign="top">Neat perspective. Great colors, sky maybe a bit oversharpened. A unique astronomical study. Good luck -8-</td>', 'Neat perspective. Great colors, sky maybe a bit oversharpened. A unique astronomical study. Good luck -8-', '2005-12-03 19:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1919570, 263872, 33256, '<td valign="top">Creepy ape. Excellent photo.</td>', 'Creepy ape. Excellent photo.', '2005-12-03 19:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1919575, 264027, 45000, '<td valign="top">Excellent...I really really like this one.</td>', 'Excellent...I really really like this one.', '2005-12-03 19:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1919576, 255145, 40797, '<td valign="top">Excellent Capture! The lighting, composition, depth of field are perfect!! This is a wonderful entry for Free Study!!!  Best of Luck</td>', 'Excellent Capture! The lighting, composition, depth of field are perfect!! This is a wonderful entry for Free Study!!!  Best of Luck', '2005-12-03 19:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1919578, 262483, 24846, '<td valign="top">Wow ! So far my favorite study. A study of textures shown with the grainy beach and gull., the water ripples and smooth cloudy sky. The color blend is spectacular and the yellow boat or buoy is a plus. Good luck on this piece, look forward to seeing its ribbon placement.</td>', 'Wow ! So far my favorite study. A study of textures shown with the grainy beach and gull., the water ripples and smooth cloudy sky. The color blend is spectacular and the yellow boat or buoy is a plus. Good luck on this piece, look forward to seeing its ribbon placement.', '2005-12-03 19:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1919580, 263869, 6999, '<td valign="top">This challenge is overburdened with cloud shots, or at least shots that overly deoend on cloud formations to make their impact - this at least is different from that crowd, largely. I don''t really see the sense of cutting the bloke and his shed off at the waist, nor of the implied tilt to the frame (in fact I think their accidental, though I''m allowing you the benefit of the doubt), but the impact of the clouds is more interestnig in this shot than in the vast majority.</td>', 'This challenge is overburdened with cloud shots, or at least shots that overly deoend on cloud formations to make their impact - this at least is different from that crowd, largely. I don''t really see the sense of cutting the bloke and his shed off at the waist, nor of the implied tilt to the frame (in fact I think their accidental, though I''m allowing you the benefit of the doubt), but the impact of the clouds is more interestnig in this shot than in the vast majority.', '2005-12-03 19:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1919582, 263012, 24846, '<td valign="top">Happy holidays. Great study. Nice depth, good luck.</td>', 'Happy holidays. Great study. Nice depth, good luck.', '2005-12-03 19:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1919584, 258302, 6999, '<td valign="top">An interesting presentation - as much for the monochromatic treatment as anything, I think. This free study seems to have been treated as a landscape challenge, and this at least adds more drama. It''s striking, but not overly arresting.</td>', 'An interesting presentation - as much for the monochromatic treatment as anything, I think. This free study seems to have been treated as a landscape challenge, and this at least adds more drama. It''s striking, but not overly arresting.', '2005-12-03 19:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1919585, 263579, 24846, '<td valign="top">Brilliant colors and framing. Good luck on this study.</td>', 'Brilliant colors and framing. Good luck on this study.', '2005-12-03 19:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1919587, 261908, 24846, '<td valign="top">Like the radiant colors. I would have liked you looking more direct. Good luck on the self portrait study.</td>', 'Like the radiant colors. I would have liked you looking more direct. Good luck on the self portrait study.', '2005-12-03 19:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1919589, 263874, 24846, '<td valign="top">Great stop action study.</td>', 'Great stop action study.', '2005-12-03 19:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1919590, 264048, 6999, '<td valign="top">Not sure this is successful, but it''s far more interesting than the rather humdrum bulk of this challenge. My impression is that the chaos of those branches is your reference for ''tormented'' - but if that''s the case i think I''d want a heap more contrast there. If that isn''t your aim, then I don''t understand this shot.</td>', 'Not sure this is successful, but it''s far more interesting than the rather humdrum bulk of this challenge. My impression is that the chaos of those branches is your reference for ''tormented'' - but if that''s the case i think I''d want a heap more contrast there. If that isn''t your aim, then I don''t understand this shot.', '2005-12-03 19:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1919596, 264102, 24846, '<td valign="top">Like the depth of the image you created with the steps. Brilliant/rdiant processing of colors. Good luck.</td>', 'Like the depth of the image you created with the steps. Brilliant/rdiant processing of colors. Good luck.', '2005-12-03 19:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1919597, 263872, 24846, '<td valign="top">Wondwerfully captured expression. Great color and composition. Good luck on this primate study.</td>', 'Wondwerfully captured expression. Great color and composition. Good luck on this primate study.', '2005-12-03 19:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1919598, 262098, 6999, '<td valign="top">This is slightly reminiscent of Kertesz'' famous Washington Square shots - making use of the inevitable contrast in the scene to emphasise the graphic world. I don''t think it''s absolutely successful, though: there are stong elements - the first tree certainly, and the lines of the fences - but it doesn''t have quite the clarity of composition to emphasise those lines strongly enough. A good treatment, but it steers to close to cluttered to my eye.</td>', 'This is slightly reminiscent of Kertesz'' famous Washington Square shots - making use of the inevitable contrast in the scene to emphasise the graphic world. I don''t think it''s absolutely successful, though: there are stong elements - the first tree certainly, and the lines of the fences - but it doesn''t have quite the clarity of composition to emphasise those lines strongly enough. A good treatment, but it steers to close to cluttered to my eye.', '2005-12-03 19:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1919601, 263282, 6999, '<td valign="top">There are two very strong horse portraits in this challenge, and I can''t choose between them. This, as does this other, holds a great sense of the power of the animal, of the weight, and shape and strength of it. I like it for that - but i think your background and framing generally let the shot down otherwise: to do really well here you need to get away from that very cluttered scene. nevertheless, you''ve captured a lot more than a trite sunset, which makes this far more interesting than most shots.</td>', 'There are two very strong horse portraits in this challenge, and I can''t choose between them. This, as does this other, holds a great sense of the power of the animal, of the weight, and shape and strength of it. I like it for that - but i think your background and framing generally let the shot down otherwise: to do really well here you need to get away from that very cluttered scene. nevertheless, you''ve captured a lot more than a trite sunset, which makes this far more interesting than most shots.', '2005-12-03 19:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1919602, 263076, 24846, '<td valign="top">An interesting pastoral scene.The saturation of green and blue is vivid accenting the grazing cattle. Good luck with this rural study.</td>', 'An interesting pastoral scene.The saturation of green and blue is vivid accenting the grazing cattle. Good luck with this rural study.', '2005-12-03 19:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1919604, 263514, 6999, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail and a strong sense of light - well planned grown-up shooting. I''m not sure that a judicious crop at the top mightn''t have strengthened the composition - you''ve left me expecting more at top of frame, and pulling my eye from that interesting structure of frozen water which you''ve placed dead centre. Even that progression to black isn''t enough to hold the eye at the top.</td>', 'Excellent detail and a strong sense of light - well planned grown-up shooting. I''m not sure that a judicious crop at the top mightn''t have strengthened the composition - you''ve left me expecting more at top of frame, and pulling my eye from that interesting structure of frozen water which you''ve placed dead centre. Even that progression to black isn''t enough to hold the eye at the top.', '2005-12-03 19:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1919606, 261967, 8891, '<td valign="top">I enjoyed this very much at DIC...and it is excellent, Manny! Love the shy facade on Jooi and as you pointed out the great textures and jewelry. But if you got a ''Great Shot'' comment from Lou Hartman, I know it''s got to be a 10!</td>', 'I enjoyed this very much at DIC...and it is excellent, Manny! Love the shy facade on Jooi and as you pointed out the great textures and jewelry. But if you got a ''Great Shot'' comment from Lou Hartman, I know it''s got to be a 10!', '2005-12-03 19:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1919607, 264159, 24846, '<td valign="top">Almost like a hieroglyphic. Good luck on this study of shadow.</td>', 'Almost like a hieroglyphic. Good luck on this study of shadow.', '2005-12-03 19:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1919611, 264203, 24846, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture of family against this brilliant sunset, Good luck.</td>', 'Lovely capture of family against this brilliant sunset, Good luck.', '2005-12-03 19:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1919612, 264132, 6999, '<td valign="top">I think you just win the sub-competition of horse portraits - there''s a sense of blatant processing that is rather a turn-off here, although the definition of the animal just about lets you get away with it. There''s a good sense of motion, and of grance and strength, which is well, and usefully, caught, but that lightned background and a feeling of sentimentality doesn''t hang well for me with the idea of horse.</td>', 'I think you just win the sub-competition of horse portraits - there''s a sense of blatant processing that is rather a turn-off here, although the definition of the animal just about lets you get away with it. There''s a good sense of motion, and of grance and strength, which is well, and usefully, caught, but that lightned background and a feeling of sentimentality doesn''t hang well for me with the idea of horse.', '2005-12-03 19:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1919614, 258356, 24846, '<td valign="top">Well composed stuy. Like color and reflection.</td>', 'Well composed stuy. Like color and reflection.', '2005-12-03 19:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1919617, 261634, 24846, '<td valign="top">Lucy in the Sky with Diamonds. Like the tonal range here. Nice lighting and crop.<br/>Good luck on this Timothy Leary study.</td>', 'Lucy in the Sky with Diamonds. Like the tonal range here. Nice lighting and crop.Good luck on this Timothy Leary study.', '2005-12-03 19:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1919620, 262843, 24846, '<td valign="top">Great winter study. Well composed, only quibble is the white of the roof. Good luck.</td>', 'Great winter study. Well composed, only quibble is the white of the roof. Good luck.', '2005-12-03 19:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1919622, 258678, 24846, '<td valign="top">Good luck.</td>', 'Good luck.', '2005-12-03 19:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1919623, 260511, 24846, '<td valign="top">Nice use of exposure,like the sky tones.  Good luck</td>', 'Nice use of exposure,like the sky tones.  Good luck', '2005-12-03 19:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1919624, 256702, 24846, '<td valign="top">Like the angle and crop of this gritty composition. Good luck.</td>', 'Like the angle and crop of this gritty composition. Good luck.', '2005-12-03 20:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1919628, 264109, 8891, '<td valign="top">Chafer? Framing is the same so I guess it must be. I like this better thatn "three"! Wish the gull was just a smidge further right, but those union gulls don''t always hit there mark when they''re supposed to. Great hues of browns and gold. Lovely.</td>', 'Chafer? Framing is the same so I guess it must be. I like this better thatn "three"! Wish the gull was just a smidge further right, but those union gulls don''t always hit there mark when they''re supposed to. Great hues of browns and gold. Lovely.', '2005-12-03 20:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1919634, 263390, 8891, '<td valign="top">Like the idea, lighting colours and composition. Just wish the jumping silhouette  had a head.</td>', 'Like the idea, lighting colours and composition. Just wish the jumping silhouette  had a head.', '2005-12-03 20:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1919636, 263986, 8891, '<td valign="top">Guess you were going for a dream like quality. It might have worked better either less blurred or less bright, I think. Not sure It''s a good choice of background except may for the handrail, but the white is too bright for me?....not sure. It is different and I do appreciate the attempt.</td>', 'Guess you were going for a dream like quality. It might have worked better either less blurred or less bright, I think. Not sure It''s a good choice of background except may for the handrail, but the white is too bright for me?....not sure. It is different and I do appreciate the attempt.', '2005-12-03 20:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1919643, 260730, 10263, '<td valign="top">Striking. I love the colors and the composition. Very well done.</td>', 'Striking. I love the colors and the composition. Very well done.', '2005-12-03 20:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1919646, 256912, 8891, '<td valign="top">Marvelous. Like the levels of color of the background, the detail on the tendrils and the composition. My only nit is the celestial body at the top. Not sure what is is supposed to be and it just pulls me away from the rest of the picture which I really enjoy. So...I scroll down a bit... and mystically it is gone and I am very happy with everything else I see.</td>', 'Marvelous. Like the levels of color of the background, the detail on the tendrils and the composition. My only nit is the celestial body at the top. Not sure what is is supposed to be and it just pulls me away from the rest of the picture which I really enjoy. So...I scroll down a bit... and mystically it is gone and I am very happy with everything else I see.', '2005-12-03 20:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1919647, 254361, 10263, '<td valign="top">Came back to bump this up to a 10. The clarity is amazing</td>', 'Came back to bump this up to a 10. The clarity is amazing', '2005-12-03 20:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1919649, 263604, 8891, '<td valign="top">The colors and detail on the funjus is quite fine and there are some very nice textures contrasts between it and the surrounding dross. The branches and the white above are very distracting to me. This might have been better in a horizontal orientation giving more emphasis to the fungus and its immediate surroundings and losing the area above the fungus in the image as is.</td>', 'The colors and detail on the funjus is quite fine and there are some very nice textures contrasts between it and the surrounding dross. The branches and the white above are very distracting to me. This might have been better in a horizontal orientation giving more emphasis to the fungus and its immediate surroundings and losing the area above the fungus in the image as is.', '2005-12-03 20:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
