(1920709, 264186, 10390, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo, I like the clarity in it and the blurred background. The missing tip of the leaf at the bottom is the only thing that I can drag it down for. But otherwise this is very good.</td>', 'Very nice photo, I like the clarity in it and the blurred background. The missing tip of the leaf at the bottom is the only thing that I can drag it down for. But otherwise this is very good.', '2005-12-04 10:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
