(1921080, 264085, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think I recognize this model and whether or not I''m right, this is unbelievably good.  The lighting and that velvet smoke.  HOLY $#*T!!!! I am in total awe. 10<br/> <br/>Just to let you know after seeing all of the entries this is still my stand out favorite.  Sooooo artsy and esthetic.  BRAVO - Bravissimo!!!!!</td>', 'I think I recognize this model and whether or not I''m right, this is unbelievably good.  The lighting and that velvet smoke.  HOLY $#*T!!!! I am in total awe. 10 Just to let you know after seeing all of the entries this is still my stand out favorite.  Sooooo artsy and esthetic.  BRAVO - Bravissimo!!!!!', '2005-12-04 13:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921083, 256912, 15711, '<td valign="top">That is just amazing!!!!  I love it on all levels. COmposition, color, texture, focus.  WOW Only given out 3 10''s and this is one of them!!!!<br/> <br/>After reviewing all of the entries, this is still just so well done.  I can look at it over and over and never tire of it.  I hope it ribbons - it surely deserves to.</td>', 'That is just amazing!!!!  I love it on all levels. COmposition, color, texture, focus.  WOW Only given out 3 10''s and this is one of them!!!! After reviewing all of the entries, this is still just so well done.  I can look at it over and over and never tire of it.  I hope it ribbons - it surely deserves to.', '2005-12-04 13:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921085, 263277, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this old building.  I think it loses impact cause it just looks like a snapshot.  Maybe do some serious post editing and make it look old, or do a stark contrast with black and white.  I''d also like to see you take about 30 steps back, so there is some area around it with the fallen leaves. As it is, it lacks perspective. Hope this is helpful.</td>', 'I like the idea of this old building.  I think it loses impact cause it just looks like a snapshot.  Maybe do some serious post editing and make it look old, or do a stark contrast with black and white.  I''d also like to see you take about 30 steps back, so there is some area around it with the fallen leaves. As it is, it lacks perspective. Hope this is helpful.', '2005-12-04 13:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921087, 262725, 15711, '<td valign="top">Like the hat.  I''m sorry to say it looks blurred on his face, where the focus should be.  The buttons are tack sharp, but it should be his face that has the main clarity. I might also like to see more contrast.</td>', 'Like the hat.  I''m sorry to say it looks blurred on his face, where the focus should be.  The buttons are tack sharp, but it should be his face that has the main clarity. I might also like to see more contrast.', '2005-12-04 13:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921094, 259418, 27763, '<td valign="top">Really, really well done.  Not overly sappy or cute like many kid portraits.  Great lighting, pose, and facial expression.  Lovely muted color palette.  And that brush stroke effect (?) works really well here.  This is expertly and tastefully done.  I''m impressed.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Really, really well done.  Not overly sappy or cute like many kid portraits.  Great lighting, pose, and facial expression.  Lovely muted color palette.  And that brush stroke effect (?) works really well here.  This is expertly and tastefully done.  I''m impressed.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-12-04 13:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921096, 259572, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this and the single touch of red, but it''s just too blurred for my taste.</td>', 'I like the idea of this and the single touch of red, but it''s just too blurred for my taste.', '2005-12-04 13:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921102, 260082, 27763, '<td valign="top">LOL, I love the dog on his lap.  It looks as if some significant post-processing was done on this (highlights on man''s face, etc.), and I think you did it well.  Good luck.</td>', 'LOL, I love the dog on his lap.  It looks as if some significant post-processing was done on this (highlights on man''s face, etc.), and I think you did it well.  Good luck.', '2005-12-04 13:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921105, 263062, 44860, '<td valign="top">Nice colors...7</td>', 'Nice colors...7', '2005-12-04 13:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921110, 257484, 44860, '<td valign="top">Strange title...</td>', 'Strange title...', '2005-12-04 13:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921116, 257902, 27763, '<td valign="top">Very expressive/emotive portrait.  Good work.</td>', 'Very expressive/emotive portrait.  Good work.', '2005-12-04 13:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921118, 259353, 15711, '<td valign="top">In a challenge with so many artfully presented shots, this has an almost yellow journalism sense to it.  I find it extremely disappointing. You could have done this so artfully. I like the leg and the tatto and the fishnets. I think alot less props,not so much busy and distractions- a solid background, and you might realy have something.</td>', 'In a challenge with so many artfully presented shots, this has an almost yellow journalism sense to it.  I find it extremely disappointing. You could have done this so artfully. I like the leg and the tatto and the fishnets. I think alot less props,not so much busy and distractions- a solid background, and you might realy have something.', '2005-12-04 13:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921122, 264160, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think in order for the single sat to realy work, the flowers in the foreground need to be tack sharp. AS it is, I can''t tell for sure where the focus is. Maybe in the center on the snow. This has great potential and actually, I''d prefer it be all black and white in high contrast, but that''s just my taste.</td>', 'I think in order for the single sat to realy work, the flowers in the foreground need to be tack sharp. AS it is, I can''t tell for sure where the focus is. Maybe in the center on the snow. This has great potential and actually, I''d prefer it be all black and white in high contrast, but that''s just my taste.', '2005-12-04 13:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921124, 255521, 44860, '<td valign="top">Learn to submit it bigger.</td>', 'Learn to submit it bigger.', '2005-12-04 13:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921130, 263869, 27763, '<td valign="top">I like the unusual composition here, rotated slightly askew with the person almost out of the frame as he/she hustles back inside to get out of the cold weather.  Well done.</td>', 'I like the unusual composition here, rotated slightly askew with the person almost out of the frame as he/she hustles back inside to get out of the cold weather.  Well done.', '2005-12-04 13:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921132, 264037, 44860, '<td valign="top">Like the picture. Can''t get to the title...6</td>', 'Like the picture. Can''t get to the title...6', '2005-12-04 14:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921136, 263760, 27763, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.  Well done.</td>', 'Cool shot.  Well done.', '2005-12-04 14:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921140, 264005, 44860, '<td valign="top">Unexpected, surprising, nicely done...8</td>', 'Unexpected, surprising, nicely done...8', '2005-12-04 14:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921142, 264098, 15711, '<td valign="top">I don''t sense high contrast.  I sense blurred and blown out.  This has great potential, but it''s tilted too. I''d straighten it, make sure I had tack sharp focus and shoot when the light isn''t so bright. As it is, it blanches them out somewhat. I might zoom in on a single horse for more impact.</td>', 'I don''t sense high contrast.  I sense blurred and blown out.  This has great potential, but it''s tilted too. I''d straighten it, make sure I had tack sharp focus and shoot when the light isn''t so bright. As it is, it blanches them out somewhat. I might zoom in on a single horse for more impact.', '2005-12-04 14:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921148, 261951, 44741, '<td valign="top">The borders complement this picture nicely. - 8</td>', 'The borders complement this picture nicely. - 8', '2005-12-04 14:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
