(1921178, 264065, 41675, '<td valign="top">Wow - amazing colors. The yellow almost pops a bit too much for my eyes as they keep getting drawn to the middle, right hand side. My favorite part is the bottom third. Nicely captured.</td>', 'Wow - amazing colors. The yellow almost pops a bit too much for my eyes as they keep getting drawn to the middle, right hand side. My favorite part is the bottom third. Nicely captured.', '2005-12-04 14:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
