(1921217, 264120, 10390, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo, one of the best I''ve seen so far when voting (25% done) in the challenge. I like the clarity in it and the colors.</td>', 'This is a great photo, one of the best I''ve seen so far when voting (25% done) in the challenge. I like the clarity in it and the colors.', '2005-12-04 15:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921218, 263943, 42792, '<td valign="top">Great "portrait" indeed!  Bumping it up on another look to 10.  It''s a great study on bringing out its human face.</td>', 'Great "portrait" indeed!  Bumping it up on another look to 10.  It''s a great study on bringing out its human face.', '2005-12-04 15:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921219, 264188, 1041, '<td valign="top">Use the maximum size available, your photo will fare much better.  To me, even though the one lightblub is sharp, the out of focus background dominates, with the lines being in contrast to what I imagine from Xmas decoration.  The multi-color item is nice.  Overall, I think I, as the user, am confused what the subject of the image is.</td>', 'Use the maximum size available, your photo will fare much better.  To me, even though the one lightblub is sharp, the out of focus background dominates, with the lines being in contrast to what I imagine from Xmas decoration.  The multi-color item is nice.  Overall, I think I, as the user, am confused what the subject of the image is.', '2005-12-04 15:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921221, 255521, 1041, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to tell if this image is in focus, it''s too small (you''ve probably already got a comment or two about this).  These birds are much more impressive (to me) when the fence is not visible in the image.</td>', 'It''s hard to tell if this image is in focus, it''s too small (you''ve probably already got a comment or two about this).  These birds are much more impressive (to me) when the fence is not visible in the image.', '2005-12-04 15:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921223, 263666, 46870, '<td valign="top">perffect shot v good</td>', 'perffect shot v good', '2005-12-04 15:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921224, 262920, 1041, '<td valign="top">Two things that really distract me when looking at this shot is the tilt (enough to be distracting, not enough to seem on purpose, or, if it was on purpose it eludes me) and the blown out bit of sky at the top.</td>', 'Two things that really distract me when looking at this shot is the tilt (enough to be distracting, not enough to seem on purpose, or, if it was on purpose it eludes me) and the blown out bit of sky at the top.', '2005-12-04 15:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921226, 260848, 1041, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but personally, I find the colors significantly oversaturated and the whole image quality has suffered though excessive post-processing (again, for me).  Well worth starting over and try a more subtle approach I think.</td>', 'Nice composition, but personally, I find the colors significantly oversaturated and the whole image quality has suffered though excessive post-processing (again, for me).  Well worth starting over and try a more subtle approach I think.', '2005-12-04 15:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921227, 263997, 22734, '<td valign="top">An image that invokes the aesthetic spirit deep in us. Dramatic and fluid to hold the viewers attention. Bumping up. This is so good it gets the final bump.</td>', 'An image that invokes the aesthetic spirit deep in us. Dramatic and fluid to hold the viewers attention. Bumping up. This is so good it gets the final bump.', '2005-12-04 15:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921230, 264085, 22734, '<td valign="top">One of the most highly artistic studies in this challenge. 7 on first pass. Will return!<br/> <br/>This is a well thought image with an appropiate tiltle. I do hope it receives the credit. Yes, many novice photographers always avoid voting high a dark image but then they cheat themselves in understanding. Others have a political aversion to cigarette smoke. But surely, the looker should be bowled over by the subject presentation, technique and outstanding composition. You have my full 10 and I wish you luck.</td>', 'One of the most highly artistic studies in this challenge. 7 on first pass. Will return! This is a well thought image with an appropiate tiltle. I do hope it receives the credit. Yes, many novice photographers always avoid voting high a dark image but then they cheat themselves in understanding. Others have a political aversion to cigarette smoke. But surely, the looker should be bowled over by the subject presentation, technique and outstanding composition. You have my full 10 and I wish you luck.', '2005-12-04 15:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921233, 263946, 10390, '<td valign="top">There is too much "going on" in this photo, there''s no strong point of interest in it for the eye to stop for. A person placed to the left, maybe looking at the big tree would give this photo very much. You''ve got a beautiful "stage" there, but there''s no one to play the needed "role" and let there be something "going on".  Now I''ve used "going on" in two different ways, maybe I''m just making you wonder what I really mean, but I hope you understand where I''m going in this comment.</td>', 'There is too much "going on" in this photo, there''s no strong point of interest in it for the eye to stop for. A person placed to the left, maybe looking at the big tree would give this photo very much. You''ve got a beautiful "stage" there, but there''s no one to play the needed "role" and let there be something "going on".  Now I''ve used "going on" in two different ways, maybe I''m just making you wonder what I really mean, but I hope you understand where I''m going in this comment.', '2005-12-04 15:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921240, 264171, 42792, '<td valign="top">This could have been much better if it didn''t look over-processed.</td>', 'This could have been much better if it didn''t look over-processed.', '2005-12-04 15:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921245, 259418, 1041, '<td valign="top">One of my top picks for the challenge.  The lighting, the look, is simply fantastic.  The filter works really well with the muted colors and the two really set the emotional tone of the image!</td>', 'One of my top picks for the challenge.  The lighting, the look, is simply fantastic.  The filter works really well with the muted colors and the two really set the emotional tone of the image!', '2005-12-04 15:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921247, 264085, 1041, '<td valign="top">Simply stunning.  Love the backlighting for the guy, more than "just" as smoke picture.  One of my top picks!</td>', 'Simply stunning.  Love the backlighting for the guy, more than "just" as smoke picture.  One of my top picks!', '2005-12-04 15:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921249, 263117, 10390, '<td valign="top">The sky is too much burnt out to white and if it wasn''t this photo would be great. It''s not bad, but this burnt out sky is dragging the photo down. Maybe you should have pointed your camera more down, so the horizon line wouldn''t be cutting the photo in half as it is.  I like how the pier is placed in it and the birds are adding very much. I like the big white frame, no matter what others may say about it.</td>', 'The sky is too much burnt out to white and if it wasn''t this photo would be great. It''s not bad, but this burnt out sky is dragging the photo down. Maybe you should have pointed your camera more down, so the horizon line wouldn''t be cutting the photo in half as it is.  I like how the pier is placed in it and the birds are adding very much. I like the big white frame, no matter what others may say about it.', '2005-12-04 15:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921252, 263934, 1041, '<td valign="top">This image has potential, I like that sliver of bright orange in the otherwise blue image.  However, it looks very overprocessed to me ... for example, the halo around the poles in the water.  Worth reprocessing I think.</td>', 'This image has potential, I like that sliver of bright orange in the otherwise blue image.  However, it looks very overprocessed to me ... for example, the halo around the poles in the water.  Worth reprocessing I think.', '2005-12-04 15:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921253, 255132, 35161, '<td valign="top">So scary! But it seems friendly here! Nice dof and yellow tone! :)</td>', 'So scary! But it seems friendly here! Nice dof and yellow tone! :)', '2005-12-04 15:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921255, 264008, 42792, '<td valign="top">Like this composition.  Too bad the blue looks processed and the eyes struggle to appreciate the details.</td>', 'Like this composition.  Too bad the blue looks processed and the eyes struggle to appreciate the details.', '2005-12-04 15:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921256, 262275, 1041, '<td valign="top">Unique concept, but too overexposed for my liking (the edge around the parasailer looks uneven because of it) and too much white space to keep the interest of the viewer for long.</td>', 'Unique concept, but too overexposed for my liking (the edge around the parasailer looks uneven because of it) and too much white space to keep the interest of the viewer for long.', '2005-12-04 15:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921257, 263804, 10390, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity and colors, maybe a little bit wider shot would make it even better, some might say tighter, but then it would loose it''s originality, I like the blue background.</td>', 'Nice clarity and colors, maybe a little bit wider shot would make it even better, some might say tighter, but then it would loose it''s originality, I like the blue background.', '2005-12-04 15:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921258, 264078, 1041, '<td valign="top">Cool effect, but the blurriness and shadows, plus grain detract from the overall success of the image in my opinion.</td>', 'Cool effect, but the blurriness and shadows, plus grain detract from the overall success of the image in my opinion.', '2005-12-04 15:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921260, 263618, 1041, '<td valign="top">Hard to see for me what the intent of this photo is ... from your title I suspect it''s supposed to tell me a story ... but I''m not quite seeing it, sorry.</td>', 'Hard to see for me what the intent of this photo is ... from your title I suspect it''s supposed to tell me a story ... but I''m not quite seeing it, sorry.', '2005-12-04 15:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921262, 263872, 42792, '<td valign="top">Nice capture on the "look" but it looks overly saturated.</td>', 'Nice capture on the "look" but it looks overly saturated.', '2005-12-04 15:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921263, 264127, 10390, '<td valign="top">A little bit over sharpened, nice to see the mountain peaks in the background, maybe you should add more contrast to them.</td>', 'A little bit over sharpened, nice to see the mountain peaks in the background, maybe you should add more contrast to them.', '2005-12-04 15:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921264, 263946, 42792, '<td valign="top">Nice colours but it''s too small to appreciate the details.</td>', 'Nice colours but it''s too small to appreciate the details.', '2005-12-04 15:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921265, 264134, 1041, '<td valign="top">To be honest, this has a ''snapshot'' feel to me.  I know, everyone hates that word.  The reason I''m saying that is the composition (taking the photo from eye-level height), the shadow from the flash, the maestro not looking at the camera, plus some of the background.  Maybe getting lower down, so you get more of his face, or closeup of the hands on the zither (I know, that would be a different photo) would be more interesting here (to me, that is).</td>', 'To be honest, this has a ''snapshot'' feel to me.  I know, everyone hates that word.  The reason I''m saying that is the composition (taking the photo from eye-level height), the shadow from the flash, the maestro not looking at the camera, plus some of the background.  Maybe getting lower down, so you get more of his face, or closeup of the hands on the zither (I know, that would be a different photo) would be more interesting here (to me, that is).', '2005-12-04 15:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921267, 262316, 1041, '<td valign="top">Great creatures, aren''t they?  I think your photo would rate higher if it wasn''t underexposed (look at some of the higher-rating animal photos for comparison)) and therefore had more detail in the fur and face.  Also doesn''t look 100% sharp to me.</td>', 'Great creatures, aren''t they?  I think your photo would rate higher if it wasn''t underexposed (look at some of the higher-rating animal photos for comparison)) and therefore had more detail in the fur and face.  Also doesn''t look 100% sharp to me.', '2005-12-04 15:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921270, 261469, 10390, '<td valign="top">Intersting to watch without being very interesting, but then again it must be a interesting photo, hehe. Nice colors, a person sitting in the forground looking to the right side at the photo would make this an outstanding photo, a woman in a white dress would make it awesome.</td>', 'Intersting to watch without being very interesting, but then again it must be a interesting photo, hehe. Nice colors, a person sitting in the forground looking to the right side at the photo would make this an outstanding photo, a woman in a white dress would make it awesome.', '2005-12-04 15:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
