(1921411, 263946, 43437, '<td valign="top">Colors are great, stunning really.  The fence is a nice touch.  It lacks sharpness though and maybe is a little small.</td>', 'Colors are great, stunning really.  The fence is a nice touch.  It lacks sharpness though and maybe is a little small.', '2005-12-04 16:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1921421, 263976, 43437, '<td valign="top">On second look Im bumping it up, I like the colors and the reflection off the water.  Its maybe a bit too "dramy" looking, soft and out of focus but I think I like it.</td>', 'On second look Im bumping it up, I like the colors and the reflection off the water.  Its maybe a bit too "dramy" looking, soft and out of focus but I think I like it.', '2005-12-04 17:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
