(1921469, 262777, 37961, '<td valign="top">I''m gonna guess Susi on this shot. Lovely portrait, not sure how voters will respond to the heavy editing though. I myself love it and think all portraits should look this way! Great job and good luck!</td>', 'I''m gonna guess Susi on this shot. Lovely portrait, not sure how voters will respond to the heavy editing though. I myself love it and think all portraits should look this way! Great job and good luck!', '2005-12-04 17:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
