(1921480, 264160, 43844, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like the composition and use of color.  The only thing that bugs me a bit is the headstones to the right are very soft compared to the church.</td>', 'Very nice.  I like the composition and use of color.  The only thing that bugs me a bit is the headstones to the right are very soft compared to the church.', '2005-12-04 17:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
