(1922013, 264177, 10413, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!!!  This would have won the light on white challenge and should be one of the top one in this challenge.  Good Luck!</td>', 'Beautiful!!!  This would have won the light on white challenge and should be one of the top one in this challenge.  Good Luck!', '2005-12-04 21:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1922017, 263931, 23002, '<td valign="top">OUCH!  # 43 is going to need a chiropractor.</td>', 'OUCH!  # 43 is going to need a chiropractor.', '2005-12-04 21:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1922028, 254361, 10413, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture.  They are such beautiful birds.</td>', 'Very nice capture.  They are such beautiful birds.', '2005-12-04 22:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1922040, 263034, 10413, '<td valign="top">Burrrr that looks so cold.  I love the shades of blue.</td>', 'Burrrr that looks so cold.  I love the shades of blue.', '2005-12-04 22:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1922042, 262843, 10413, '<td valign="top">Looks like it should be on a Christmas card.  Beautiful shot.</td>', 'Looks like it should be on a Christmas card.  Beautiful shot.', '2005-12-04 22:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1922049, 261572, 10413, '<td valign="top">Cute idea. Great contrast, perspective, and DOF.</td>', 'Cute idea. Great contrast, perspective, and DOF.', '2005-12-04 22:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1922053, 263833, 10413, '<td valign="top">So peaceful and still.  Really like this one.</td>', 'So peaceful and still.  Really like this one.', '2005-12-04 22:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1922061, 260331, 35804, '<td valign="top">Simply gorgeous...the movement, the blur and the deep luscious red...what a beautiful dance you have captured here.</td>', 'Simply gorgeous...the movement, the blur and the deep luscious red...what a beautiful dance you have captured here.', '2005-12-04 22:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1922076, 256912, 10413, '<td valign="top">This almost looks like a painting.  Very nice.</td>', 'This almost looks like a painting.  Very nice.', '2005-12-04 22:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1922077, 262461, 42256, '<td valign="top">Great shot, love the way you captured the light!<br/>Edit : Every time I look at this shot, I like it even more, finally i''ve increased the rating to a point I can''t increase it any further !</td>', 'Great shot, love the way you captured the light!Edit : Every time I look at this shot, I like it even more, finally i''ve increased the rating to a point I can''t increase it any further !', '2005-12-04 22:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1922081, 255145, 35804, '<td valign="top">I can''t put my finger on it...there is something quite magical about this image...perhaps it is the light?...or is it the nostalgic warm tone?...I think it doesn''t matter really, the image makes me want to create a spectacular and daring story to go along with it...a super fine image.</td>', 'I can''t put my finger on it...there is something quite magical about this image...perhaps it is the light?...or is it the nostalgic warm tone?...I think it doesn''t matter really, the image makes me want to create a spectacular and daring story to go along with it...a super fine image.', '2005-12-04 22:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1922086, 264165, 42256, '<td valign="top">Simple but beautifully composed, I can see this picture framed neatly with a mordern architecture !!</td>', 'Simple but beautifully composed, I can see this picture framed neatly with a mordern architecture !!', '2005-12-04 22:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1922088, 260078, 35804, '<td valign="top">Fantastic! Stone that looks like a beautiful silk fabric...very nice.</td>', 'Fantastic! Stone that looks like a beautiful silk fabric...very nice.', '2005-12-04 22:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1922093, 263075, 42256, '<td valign="top">I like to believe the sunset is real.  Doesnt matter if it is not, its a beautiful effect and is on my list of the highly rated shots!</td>', 'I like to believe the sunset is real.  Doesnt matter if it is not, its a beautiful effect and is on my list of the highly rated shots!', '2005-12-04 22:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1922098, 263854, 10413, '<td valign="top">Burrrr.  Gives me goosebumps looking at it.  The trees in the background are beautiful.  I would love to see this place in person but with a heavy coat on.  Good luck.</td>', 'Burrrr.  Gives me goosebumps looking at it.  The trees in the background are beautiful.  I would love to see this place in person but with a heavy coat on.  Good luck.', '2005-12-04 22:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1922100, 263833, 43437, '<td valign="top">Thought I had already commented on this....<br/>Colors are gorgous, I love how your boats look like they are floating in the clouds, there isnt a real line between the two.  I would  maybe like to see some more of the character of the boat come out.  Very incredible picture 10</td>', 'Thought I had already commented on this....Colors are gorgous, I love how your boats look like they are floating in the clouds, there isnt a real line between the two.  I would  maybe like to see some more of the character of the boat come out.  Very incredible picture 10', '2005-12-04 22:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1922101, 263646, 554, '<td valign="top">Well, alan, I wonder who took this fine photo....10</td>', 'Well, alan, I wonder who took this fine photo....10', '2005-12-04 22:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1922105, 262310, 3214, '<td valign="top">What a perfect study!  His face looks like it was carved out of stone.</td>', 'What a perfect study!  His face looks like it was carved out of stone.', '2005-12-04 22:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
