(1922795, 264145, 19831, '<td valign="top">A neat setting. Although busy can work sometimes, in this case I am left trying to find a solid point to hold my attention.</td>', 'A neat setting. Although busy can work sometimes, in this case I am left trying to find a solid point to hold my attention.', '2005-12-05 03:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1922804, 261754, 19831, '<td valign="top">A good idea. Flowers can make a fine subject for photos. In this shot though, I find most of my attention is drawn to the car, which doesn''t seem like was your intent. This seems like a case where simplifying the presentation could strengthen the image. Color wise, it seems a little on the flat side. Maybe just some simple adjusting in post processing, some levels and color adjustments could make a big difference.</td>', 'A good idea. Flowers can make a fine subject for photos. In this shot though, I find most of my attention is drawn to the car, which doesn''t seem like was your intent. This seems like a case where simplifying the presentation could strengthen the image. Color wise, it seems a little on the flat side. Maybe just some simple adjusting in post processing, some levels and color adjustments could make a big difference.', '2005-12-05 03:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
