(1922988, 258778, 19831, '<td valign="top">Kinda quirky. Different, unique. I rather like it. Quite interesting point of view. Looking at the various looks and gestures, I find it holds my attention quite well actually. Fascinating how the one dark haired girl just to the right of center is the only one not looking up at the camera. I''m not sure how the mainstream voters here will go for it, but, yeah, I really like it. Looks like a really fun shoot. Cool :-)</td>', 'Kinda quirky. Different, unique. I rather like it. Quite interesting point of view. Looking at the various looks and gestures, I find it holds my attention quite well actually. Fascinating how the one dark haired girl just to the right of center is the only one not looking up at the camera. I''m not sure how the mainstream voters here will go for it, but, yeah, I really like it. Looks like a really fun shoot. Cool :-)', '2005-12-05 06:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1922990, 262315, 19831, '<td valign="top">Good subject. Shot and composed well. Holds my attention. Good job.</td>', 'Good subject. Shot and composed well. Holds my attention. Good job.', '2005-12-05 06:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1922995, 260280, 19831, '<td valign="top">Great action shot! You nailed it. Good comp. Very crisp and great detail.  Very nice.</td>', 'Great action shot! You nailed it. Good comp. Very crisp and great detail.  Very nice.', '2005-12-05 06:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1923000, 264058, 19831, '<td valign="top">Good subject. Great colors and nice use of a vanishing point. Might be nice to have just a little deeper dof, but not bad. Neat shot.</td>', 'Good subject. Great colors and nice use of a vanishing point. Might be nice to have just a little deeper dof, but not bad. Neat shot.', '2005-12-05 06:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1923004, 263436, 23478, '<td valign="top">Nicely silhouetted, the sunlight is hitting the water just right.</td>', 'Nicely silhouetted, the sunlight is hitting the water just right.', '2005-12-05 06:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1923006, 257755, 23478, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo, good light and colors</td>', 'This is a nice photo, good light and colors', '2005-12-05 06:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1923017, 262711, 19831, '<td valign="top">Good idea and nice subject. Focus and colors look good. Lighting seems just a little on the harsh side, perhaps a different time of day would be better? Overall, although a nice subject, it seems like there is just too much here, it''s kind of busy, and a little aimless. I''m thinking maybe simplifying things a little and study some compositional rules, go for a cleaner more solid composition and it could make for a much stronger presentation. Maybe applying the rule of thirds, some leading lines and dof. I do like the reds and greens together, the reds stand out well.</td>', 'Good idea and nice subject. Focus and colors look good. Lighting seems just a little on the harsh side, perhaps a different time of day would be better? Overall, although a nice subject, it seems like there is just too much here, it''s kind of busy, and a little aimless. I''m thinking maybe simplifying things a little and study some compositional rules, go for a cleaner more solid composition and it could make for a much stronger presentation. Maybe applying the rule of thirds, some leading lines and dof. I do like the reds and greens together, the reds stand out well.', '2005-12-05 06:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1923023, 263983, 23478, '<td valign="top">Great photo, the colors and composition are great.</td>', 'Great photo, the colors and composition are great.', '2005-12-05 06:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1923054, 262920, 8125, '<td valign="top">This looks like a beautiful place!  You have captured an image that makes me want to visit this place.  My suggestions: It looks like you could use a little color saturation; I haven''t decided yet if I like the tilted composition.  If you are able to use filters, try a neutral density to slow your shutter down a little bit and smooth out the water, or go back at early morning/late evening.</td>', 'This looks like a beautiful place!  You have captured an image that makes me want to visit this place.  My suggestions: It looks like you could use a little color saturation; I haven''t decided yet if I like the tilted composition.  If you are able to use filters, try a neutral density to slow your shutter down a little bit and smooth out the water, or go back at early morning/late evening.', '2005-12-05 07:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1923059, 264004, 48228, '<td valign="top">eerie feel about this with the lights but very good composition</td>', 'eerie feel about this with the lights but very good composition', '2005-12-05 07:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
