(1923156, 257636, 30881, '<td valign="top">Great light beams shining down through the branches. Mother nature was being very nice to you! lol Has a wonderful misty morning feel to it. Great colors in the leaves. Overall a very good phot. Well done!</td>', 'Great light beams shining down through the branches. Mother nature was being very nice to you! lol Has a wonderful misty morning feel to it. Great colors in the leaves. Overall a very good phot. Well done!', '2005-12-05 08:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
