(1923373, 262832, 30881, '<td valign="top">Overcast sky really helps this image. Sharp clean edges,just the right amount of lighting to give it a sad forlorn feel. If foreground twigs on hill were any sharper i think they would have distracted from subject. Good choice keeping them blurred just a touch. Hope it scores high. Good job, very well done.</td>', 'Overcast sky really helps this image. Sharp clean edges,just the right amount of lighting to give it a sad forlorn feel. If foreground twigs on hill were any sharper i think they would have distracted from subject. Good choice keeping them blurred just a touch. Hope it scores high. Good job, very well done.', '2005-12-05 09:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1923375, 254081, 1041, '<td valign="top">Very very nice image.  I like the close crop, how the child looks directly in the camera and is clearly the focus, yet the mother is also there and also in focus, but looking away.  Great colors and expressions, too.  Congratulations on a wonderful shot!</td>', 'Very very nice image.  I like the close crop, how the child looks directly in the camera and is clearly the focus, yet the mother is also there and also in focus, but looking away.  Great colors and expressions, too.  Congratulations on a wonderful shot!', '2005-12-05 09:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
