(1923443, 263879, 30881, '<td valign="top">This certainly awoke some fond memories of a visit to Greenland several years ago. The white boat breaks up all the dark water and shoreline. Great contrasting effect. Nicely done.<br/>My congratulations.</td>', 'This certainly awoke some fond memories of a visit to Greenland several years ago. The white boat breaks up all the dark water and shoreline. Great contrasting effect. Nicely done.My congratulations.', '2005-12-05 10:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1923447, 263765, 2612, '<td valign="top">The thumbnail just doesn''t do this image justice. I passed by several times thining this was a typical mom and  baby shot, but it''s much better than typical. <br/>+ Wonderful matching expressions from mom and baby.<br/>+ Outstanding use of depth of field to bring the focus in to eyes, nose, and lips... the element that seem to match between your subjects.<br/>+ Magnificent tones from your B&amp;W conversion.<br/>10</td>', 'The thumbnail just doesn''t do this image justice. I passed by several times thining this was a typical mom and  baby shot, but it''s much better than typical. + Wonderful matching expressions from mom and baby.+ Outstanding use of depth of field to bring the focus in to eyes, nose, and lips... the element that seem to match between your subjects.+ Magnificent tones from your B&W conversion.10', '2005-12-05 10:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1923450, 258462, 10634, '<td valign="top">Perspective is interesting. I keep thinking, boy her neck must be killing her. First time I saw this, I thought of the Cirque Du Soleil contortionists. Perhaps something under her neck to make her tilt her head back a little more would get rid of the feeling that she is standing on her head. Also, the wrinkles in the white background are distracting.</td>', 'Perspective is interesting. I keep thinking, boy her neck must be killing her. First time I saw this, I thought of the Cirque Du Soleil contortionists. Perhaps something under her neck to make her tilt her head back a little more would get rid of the feeling that she is standing on her head. Also, the wrinkles in the white background are distracting.', '2005-12-05 10:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1923455, 263948, 2612, '<td valign="top">I think the biggest challenge here is that you have wonderful warm light in the sky and cooler daylight balanced light (flash?) illuminating your subjects. I think a gel to warm the light from the left of the frame would have helped.</td>', 'I think the biggest challenge here is that you have wonderful warm light in the sky and cooler daylight balanced light (flash?) illuminating your subjects. I think a gel to warm the light from the left of the frame would have helped.', '2005-12-05 10:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
