(1923623, 264079, 10634, '<td valign="top">A very pretty photo. the colors are great. It just doesn''t grab me like the ones I scored higher. All the same, it is above average and a 7 for me.</td>', 'A very pretty photo. the colors are great. It just doesn''t grab me like the ones I scored higher. All the same, it is above average and a 7 for me.', '2005-12-05 11:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1923626, 253645, 10634, '<td valign="top">technically, a nice shot. Would I have chosen to enter this in a free study? No. It''s rather stale and boring compared to the other entries.</td>', 'technically, a nice shot. Would I have chosen to enter this in a free study? No. It''s rather stale and boring compared to the other entries.', '2005-12-05 11:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1923631, 259418, 14603, '<td valign="top">Lovely image..don`t know how well the use of the filter will go down with some voters..but I think it adds to the feel of the picture.<br/>Nice work.</td>', 'Lovely image..don`t know how well the use of the filter will go down with some voters..but I think it adds to the feel of the picture.Nice work.', '2005-12-05 11:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1923637, 264065, 10634, '<td valign="top">I think the fact that there are so many sunsets in this challenge hurts you. If the bottom half of the shot were more interesting, it would match how spectacular the upper part is and make this have more appeal. Looking down into a valley, etc. I also think the bright yellow/orange sun line that runs across the middle of the shot should not be so in the middle. Maybe getting rid of some of the ground would help.</td>', 'I think the fact that there are so many sunsets in this challenge hurts you. If the bottom half of the shot were more interesting, it would match how spectacular the upper part is and make this have more appeal. Looking down into a valley, etc. I also think the bright yellow/orange sun line that runs across the middle of the shot should not be so in the middle. Maybe getting rid of some of the ground would help.', '2005-12-05 11:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1923641, 264167, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nice motion capture on a difficult subject.<br/>Well done</td>', 'Nice motion capture on a difficult subject.Well done', '2005-12-05 11:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
