(1924067, 257551, 20235, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful photo! The composition and the way you worked with the lighting, shadows, and angles gives a nice ethereal feel to it. Deep DOF works well with the look and it appears you''ve managed to get some good color saturation despite the bright sky. Nice work.......9</td>', 'What a beautiful photo! The composition and the way you worked with the lighting, shadows, and angles gives a nice ethereal feel to it. Deep DOF works well with the look and it appears you''ve managed to get some good color saturation despite the bright sky. Nice work.......9', '2005-12-05 13:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
