(1924080, 262832, 30625, '<td valign="top">Seems just a little too flat. Enhancing the colors of the roof and that of the grass would could have added some compostional element. Maybe a different angle of shooting would have created more impact.</td>', 'Seems just a little too flat. Enhancing the colors of the roof and that of the grass would could have added some compostional element. Maybe a different angle of shooting would have created more impact.', '2005-12-05 13:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
