(1924086, 253214, 44104, '<td valign="top">I usually don''t care for cat photos, but this one is very good.  Nice composition and cropping.</td>', 'I usually don''t care for cat photos, but this one is very good.  Nice composition and cropping.', '2005-12-05 13:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924089, 264115, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot. Definitely makes the subject matter interesting to look at. The color saturation and textures you''ve captured is great. Personally, I would have liked to see the water a little less overexposed at the top left. And maybe rotating the shot to make the line between water and leaves angular would add more to the shot. But that''s just personal opinion. Great shot nonetheless</td>', 'Very interesting shot. Definitely makes the subject matter interesting to look at. The color saturation and textures you''ve captured is great. Personally, I would have liked to see the water a little less overexposed at the top left. And maybe rotating the shot to make the line between water and leaves angular would add more to the shot. But that''s just personal opinion. Great shot nonetheless', '2005-12-05 13:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924093, 263455, 30625, '<td valign="top">Nice set up and use of light. I love the background how it meshes over from one color to the next. Diagonal composition is a good choice. Well done.  (9)</td>', 'Nice set up and use of light. I love the background how it meshes over from one color to the next. Diagonal composition is a good choice. Well done.  (9)', '2005-12-05 13:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924095, 258302, 44104, '<td valign="top">This is eerie and captivating.  Great job on this.</td>', 'This is eerie and captivating.  Great job on this.', '2005-12-05 13:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924096, 264129, 41802, '<td valign="top">Great idea and use of DOF.</td>', 'Great idea and use of DOF.', '2005-12-05 13:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924098, 260082, 30625, '<td valign="top">Oh my god I thought the Dog was santas beard at first. I had to get my head closer to see what was going on or if it was my eyes. This could have been a top notch image in Black and white with some dodge and burn you would have set the focus element towards the santa. In color there is just too much other things going on behind him and around him. (6)</td>', 'Oh my god I thought the Dog was santas beard at first. I had to get my head closer to see what was going on or if it was my eyes. This could have been a top notch image in Black and white with some dodge and burn you would have set the focus element towards the santa. In color there is just too much other things going on behind him and around him. (6)', '2005-12-05 13:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924103, 263541, 20235, '<td valign="top">MMmm tasty! Good composition and use of shapes and colors to make the shot interesting. Maybe using spot focus would help in emphasizing the central cookie with the DOF. The two cookies you put in focus make the shot look somwhat "split". Nice shot nonetheless.</td>', 'MMmm tasty! Good composition and use of shapes and colors to make the shot interesting. Maybe using spot focus would help in emphasizing the central cookie with the DOF. The two cookies you put in focus make the shot look somwhat "split". Nice shot nonetheless.', '2005-12-05 13:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
