(1924109, 263886, 30625, '<td valign="top">Good use of light and capture of the action. I thinking the blue ray of light is caused by the smoke from a smoke machine thus the faded colors over the guitar. Man if this image was sharper over the instrument it would have been top notch. (7)</td>', 'Good use of light and capture of the action. I thinking the blue ray of light is caused by the smoke from a smoke machine thus the faded colors over the guitar. Man if this image was sharper over the instrument it would have been top notch. (7)', '2005-12-05 13:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
