(1924177, 264088, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very brave direction you''ve taken with the composition and use of negative space here. Creates a visually interesting photo.</td>', 'Very brave direction you''ve taken with the composition and use of negative space here. Creates a visually interesting photo.', '2005-12-05 14:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
