(1924217, 264176, 20235, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. the selective desaturation works well to emphasize the subject. Great angle you''ve used as to bring that title to life. Suggestions: maybe shooting from more of a side angle, shallower DOF, and slower shutter while tracking the girl may emphasize and convey the motion better and give a more kinetic feel? nice shot nonetheless</td>', 'Nice shot. the selective desaturation works well to emphasize the subject. Great angle you''ve used as to bring that title to life. Suggestions: maybe shooting from more of a side angle, shallower DOF, and slower shutter while tracking the girl may emphasize and convey the motion better and give a more kinetic feel? nice shot nonetheless', '2005-12-05 14:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924221, 261392, 10634, '<td valign="top">Wow. What a capture. Was there any way to get the structure that was on fire in the shot at all?</td>', 'Wow. What a capture. Was there any way to get the structure that was on fire in the shot at all?', '2005-12-05 14:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924225, 263034, 20235, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot. I sat here looking at it for a couple minutes trying to think of constructive criticism, but don''t have a thing to say. So here''s a 9 instead :)</td>', 'Amazing shot. I sat here looking at it for a couple minutes trying to think of constructive criticism, but don''t have a thing to say. So here''s a 9 instead :)', '2005-12-05 14:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
