(1924231, 264172, 10634, '<td valign="top">A very colorful, pretty bird for sure. Just lacking something in the "wow" department. Perhaps a closer shot, filling the frame better with the bird. Or a lighter color background so he/she doesn''t look like he/she has no beak?</td>', 'A very colorful, pretty bird for sure. Just lacking something in the "wow" department. Perhaps a closer shot, filling the frame better with the bird. Or a lighter color background so he/she doesn''t look like he/she has no beak?', '2005-12-05 14:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924235, 261122, 10634, '<td valign="top">He/she looks like he/she is posing for you. I think the sky is a bit bright for the rest of the shot. Perhaps burning it a little? I like where you have positioned the horse in the frame and your focus is good.</td>', 'He/she looks like he/she is posing for you. I think the sky is a bit bright for the rest of the shot. Perhaps burning it a little? I like where you have positioned the horse in the frame and your focus is good.', '2005-12-05 14:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924241, 257129, 10634, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective. The brightness of the sky draws my eye and instead of just naturally moving through the photo, I have to tell myself to look down.</td>', 'I like the perspective. The brightness of the sky draws my eye and instead of just naturally moving through the photo, I have to tell myself to look down.', '2005-12-05 14:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924245, 262308, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great skyline shot. The clarity and DOF is nice and you''ve picked up the colors and reflections well. It''s too bad DPC only allows a 640pixel submission because it looks like this is one of those shots that can only be done justice when seen blown up. Suggestions: A little less negative space, or slightly less sky may balance the shot more?</td>', 'Great skyline shot. The clarity and DOF is nice and you''ve picked up the colors and reflections well. It''s too bad DPC only allows a 640pixel submission because it looks like this is one of those shots that can only be done justice when seen blown up. Suggestions: A little less negative space, or slightly less sky may balance the shot more?', '2005-12-05 14:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924250, 263860, 20235, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait. The focus, detail, and DOF are spot on.</td>', 'Nice portrait. The focus, detail, and DOF are spot on.', '2005-12-05 14:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924257, 261412, 13958, '<td valign="top">Good to see old Tablemountain again. I lived there for almost 30 years. Say hallo to everybody there. How is the rugby / cricket doing. Will be there next year. Bytheway, love your foto.  Good luck.</td>', 'Good to see old Tablemountain again. I lived there for almost 30 years. Say hallo to everybody there. How is the rugby / cricket doing. Will be there next year. Bytheway, love your foto.  Good luck.', '2005-12-05 14:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924258, 263930, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. The composition and DOF are perfect here. I also like the monochromatic scheme and how the textures create visual seperation. nie work</td>', 'Very nice shot. The composition and DOF are perfect here. I also like the monochromatic scheme and how the textures create visual seperation. nie work', '2005-12-05 14:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924272, 262582, 20235, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. I spent a good few minutes just looking at the different elements in it. I hope you don''t get any "Too busy" or "no subject" comments, because those people would completely be missing the point here. You''ve perfectly captured this moment and the title is great too. Nice detail and DOF...... 8</td>', 'I really like this shot. I spent a good few minutes just looking at the different elements in it. I hope you don''t get any "Too busy" or "no subject" comments, because those people would completely be missing the point here. You''ve perfectly captured this moment and the title is great too. Nice detail and DOF...... 8', '2005-12-05 14:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924280, 263048, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very pretty shot and composition. It has a very sureal and ehtereal quality to it. focus and DOF look nice.</td>', 'Very pretty shot and composition. It has a very sureal and ehtereal quality to it. focus and DOF look nice.', '2005-12-05 14:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924284, 263711, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very nice macro. Composition is nice and leads the eye around the whole shot. Detail, focus, and DOF are nice.</td>', 'Very nice macro. Composition is nice and leads the eye around the whole shot. Detail, focus, and DOF are nice.', '2005-12-05 14:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
