(1924310, 259337, 30625, '<td valign="top">Great capture of motion. I wish however you would gotten just bit wider on the shot and brought more of the rocks into the effect. (8)</td>', 'Great capture of motion. I wish however you would gotten just bit wider on the shot and brought more of the rocks into the effect. (8)', '2005-12-05 14:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924319, 262810, 30625, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. Compostion is just top notch. The colors make me feel like I''m out there. (10)</td>', 'Excellent shot. Compostion is just top notch. The colors make me feel like I''m out there. (10)', '2005-12-05 14:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924330, 263963, 30625, '<td valign="top">Extreme Fishing. I didnt know you could catch fish on coasts like that. The compostion is great really shows the size of the cliff in comparsion to the fisherman. Just a little too flat on the black and white. (8)</td>', 'Extreme Fishing. I didnt know you could catch fish on coasts like that. The compostion is great really shows the size of the cliff in comparsion to the fisherman. Just a little too flat on the black and white. (8)', '2005-12-05 14:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924332, 264173, 17033, '<td valign="top">What makes this stand out is the very rare capture of striking action stretching out from foreground to background. I wonder about a vertical crop removing the empty left and the single bird on the right...It might emphasise the layered nature of the image. But who am I to suggest improvement on this shot?!!</td>', 'What makes this stand out is the very rare capture of striking action stretching out from foreground to background. I wonder about a vertical crop removing the empty left and the single bird on the right...It might emphasise the layered nature of the image. But who am I to suggest improvement on this shot?!!', '2005-12-05 14:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924342, 258362, 30625, '<td valign="top">The lanscape shot is very nice and pleasant to look at. I might have even cloned out the birds and just done the landscape. (8)</td>', 'The lanscape shot is very nice and pleasant to look at. I might have even cloned out the birds and just done the landscape. (8)', '2005-12-05 14:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
