(1924804, 264079, 18552, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this is beautiful. It makes an ordinary scene look somehow magical.</td>', 'The lighting on this is beautiful. It makes an ordinary scene look somehow magical.', '2005-12-05 17:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924806, 261447, 35786, '<td valign="top">I think this would be better if you had cropped out the jeans- a bit of a distraction</td>', 'I think this would be better if you had cropped out the jeans- a bit of a distraction', '2005-12-05 17:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924807, 264021, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot. I like the colors and different elements in the photo. Not sure if the wide-angle distortion adds to the photo, but nice shot nonetheless.</td>', 'Very interesting shot. I like the colors and different elements in the photo. Not sure if the wide-angle distortion adds to the photo, but nice shot nonetheless.', '2005-12-05 17:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924810, 263533, 35786, '<td valign="top">might have liked it if you cropped in so the center leaf was the subject, the composition seems off to me</td>', 'might have liked it if you cropped in so the center leaf was the subject, the composition seems off to me', '2005-12-05 17:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924813, 263751, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors and detail here. Your decision to weight the sky heavier in the composition works well.... 8</td>', 'Very nice colors and detail here. Your decision to weight the sky heavier in the composition works well.... 8', '2005-12-05 17:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924818, 262727, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.  Kind of reminds me of a Van Gogh painting! The colors and textures throughout add alot of interest here, and the composition is good. focus seems to be a little off in some areas, but good photo overall.</td>', 'Very nice photo.  Kind of reminds me of a Van Gogh painting! The colors and textures throughout add alot of interest here, and the composition is good. focus seems to be a little off in some areas, but good photo overall.', '2005-12-05 17:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924821, 263151, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great landscape. The play between the sky and water is very interesting. Color saturation is great, DOF and focus is good throughout. It may just be me, but the horizon looks a little tilted CCW? Nice shot nonetheless.... 7</td>', 'Great landscape. The play between the sky and water is very interesting. Color saturation is great, DOF and focus is good throughout. It may just be me, but the horizon looks a little tilted CCW? Nice shot nonetheless.... 7', '2005-12-05 18:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924823, 264161, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Your decision to shoot vertically really adds to the photo and the composition leads the eyes throughout the shot. Nice lighting and DOF...... 8</td>', 'Great capture. Your decision to shoot vertically really adds to the photo and the composition leads the eyes throughout the shot. Nice lighting and DOF...... 8', '2005-12-05 18:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924826, 263461, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very cool capture. I love the colors and shapes in this. Exposure, WB, and focus are nice.... 8</td>', 'Very cool capture. I love the colors and shapes in this. Exposure, WB, and focus are nice.... 8', '2005-12-05 18:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924828, 262310, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great portrait of a great subject. The detail, focus, and color looks nice..... 8</td>', 'Great portrait of a great subject. The detail, focus, and color looks nice..... 8', '2005-12-05 18:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924831, 262214, 20235, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. I would have preferred the exclusion of the keyboard player to add more focus on the sax player. And a slightly shallower DOF may have added to the shot. But nice photo nonetheless</td>', 'Nice capture. I would have preferred the exclusion of the keyboard player to add more focus on the sax player. And a slightly shallower DOF may have added to the shot. But nice photo nonetheless', '2005-12-05 18:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924835, 263943, 20235, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Composition is nice and the detail, DOF, and focus is great..... 8</td>', 'Nice capture. Composition is nice and the detail, DOF, and focus is great..... 8', '2005-12-05 18:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924838, 264186, 20235, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. The colors, textures, and layers in this photo make it very interesting. Focus and DOF is nice...... 8</td>', 'Beautiful shot. The colors, textures, and layers in this photo make it very interesting. Focus and DOF is nice...... 8', '2005-12-05 18:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924843, 262933, 20235, '<td valign="top">Beautiful landscape. So many nice elements from composition to color..... 9</td>', 'Beautiful landscape. So many nice elements from composition to color..... 9', '2005-12-05 18:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924846, 262857, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great capture. The detail and focus look spot-on...... 8</td>', 'Great capture. The detail and focus look spot-on...... 8', '2005-12-05 18:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924854, 264203, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very nice landscape. Your choice to include a significant amount of foreground adds alot to the photo. Color saturation and composition is nice.... 7</td>', 'Very nice landscape. Your choice to include a significant amount of foreground adds alot to the photo. Color saturation and composition is nice.... 7', '2005-12-05 18:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924856, 259758, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Amazing detail, color, and focus..... 8</td>', 'Great capture. Amazing detail, color, and focus..... 8', '2005-12-05 18:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924860, 263646, 20235, '<td valign="top">This photo makes me feel like running for cover! Great capture with this action shot. The colors, focus, and DOF are great...... 9</td>', 'This photo makes me feel like running for cover! Great capture with this action shot. The colors, focus, and DOF are great...... 9', '2005-12-05 18:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924867, 264004, 20235, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture. The color saturation and composition are perfect..... 8</td>', 'Beautiful capture. The color saturation and composition are perfect..... 8', '2005-12-05 18:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924901, 259418, 20235, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait. The choice of colors, lighting, and grain really add to the shot</td>', 'Nice portrait. The choice of colors, lighting, and grain really add to the shot', '2005-12-05 18:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924905, 261231, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Great color saturation and use of negative space in the compostion. Very tricky focus but looks like you''ve got the whole subject in great focus and detail.... 8</td>', 'Very nice shot. Great color saturation and use of negative space in the compostion. Very tricky focus but looks like you''ve got the whole subject in great focus and detail.... 8', '2005-12-05 18:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924952, 263886, 25397, '<td valign="top">Ah! Sigur Ros! I''m listening to them right now. <br/>I hear they have wacky lighting at their shows, so getting such a shot like this would be pretty difficult, no? You did an excellent job capturing the heat of the performance, good luck!<br/> <br/>P.S. This has got to be arnit... If it is, I saw you credited on the sigur ros website :-D Great work man!</td>', 'Ah! Sigur Ros! I''m listening to them right now. I hear they have wacky lighting at their shows, so getting such a shot like this would be pretty difficult, no? You did an excellent job capturing the heat of the performance, good luck! P.S. This has got to be arnit... If it is, I saw you credited on the sigur ros website :-D Great work man!', '2005-12-05 18:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924969, 259342, 25397, '<td valign="top">eh, no pirate hat? ;-)<br/>awesome work man, hope you do well</td>', 'eh, no pirate hat? ;-)awesome work man, hope you do well', '2005-12-05 18:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924976, 262381, 18552, '<td valign="top">Nicely done to capture the colors in the trees when it is this dark.</td>', 'Nicely done to capture the colors in the trees when it is this dark.', '2005-12-05 19:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924980, 260082, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great photo on many different levels. The weathered man nad  dog speak volumes. Nice colors, composition, and DOF..... 9</td>', 'Great photo on many different levels. The weathered man nad  dog speak volumes. Nice colors, composition, and DOF..... 9', '2005-12-05 19:08:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1924981, 261307, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is so pretty. I can almost feel how soft the feathers are. Wonderful picture.</td>', 'This is so pretty. I can almost feel how soft the feathers are. Wonderful picture.', '2005-12-05 19:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924982, 263930, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.</td>', 'Very nice composition.', '2005-12-05 19:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924985, 264051, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo. Your composition and decision to angle the shot really add interest to it. Colors are nice too. I would have liked to see a deeper DOF and more clarity on the middle singer, but the lighting looks tricky and a smaller f-value may not have been possible? nice shot nonetheless..... 7</td>', 'Very nice photo. Your composition and decision to angle the shot really add interest to it. Colors are nice too. I would have liked to see a deeper DOF and more clarity on the middle singer, but the lighting looks tricky and a smaller f-value may not have been possible? nice shot nonetheless..... 7', '2005-12-05 19:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924987, 255963, 20235, '<td valign="top">Nice color saturation and composition here. I would have liked to see the trees and foreground more exposed, but nice shot nonetheless</td>', 'Nice color saturation and composition here. I would have liked to see the trees and foreground more exposed, but nice shot nonetheless', '2005-12-05 19:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925013, 262614, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is such a pretty portrait. I like the background and the fact that you didn''t cut off some part of their heads. Great job.</td>', 'This is such a pretty portrait. I like the background and the fact that you didn''t cut off some part of their heads. Great job.', '2005-12-05 19:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925019, 264120, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is really a cute baby. I don''t know why it is the style anymore to cut off the top of the head in a portrait - to me, this would look SO much better if the whole head was in the picture. Also, it looks like a bit too much neat image - the skin really looks unnatural.</td>', 'This is really a cute baby. I don''t know why it is the style anymore to cut off the top of the head in a portrait - to me, this would look SO much better if the whole head was in the picture. Also, it looks like a bit too much neat image - the skin really looks unnatural.', '2005-12-05 19:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925054, 262832, 26313, '<td valign="top">Screaming for black and white...</td>', 'Screaming for black and white...', '2005-12-05 19:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925057, 264004, 26313, '<td valign="top">Nice, but church and foreground could be a little lighter I think.</td>', 'Nice, but church and foreground could be a little lighter I think.', '2005-12-05 19:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925066, 264203, 26313, '<td valign="top">Though in a way, I like the inclusion of the foreground, the photo ends up broken in half, and the foreground distracts from the kite flying. The bottom half is much busier than the top. I would consider cropping the bottom third.</td>', 'Though in a way, I like the inclusion of the foreground, the photo ends up broken in half, and the foreground distracts from the kite flying. The bottom half is much busier than the top. I would consider cropping the bottom third.', '2005-12-05 20:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925070, 259861, 26313, '<td valign="top">Having made some recent attempts at seagull photos, I have an appreciation for this. Nice shot.</td>', 'Having made some recent attempts at seagull photos, I have an appreciation for this. Nice shot.', '2005-12-05 20:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925076, 264109, 6999, '<td valign="top">November 20th, by any chance? I don''t see the point of putting this into this challenge with that other shot sitting on the front page all week. Whilst may people (obviously, from that previous challenge result) find this stuff attractive, I find it cloyingly sentimental. It has a contrived adge that, for me, simplifies the idea (and ideal) of relationships, and is actually, I beloieve, damaging, in that it encourages people to think that this kind of dreamy sunset gush is an attainable reality; its like people with flawless ''perfect'' bodies having sex without producing any sticky mess - just like the worst kind of movies.</td>', 'November 20th, by any chance? I don''t see the point of putting this into this challenge with that other shot sitting on the front page all week. Whilst may people (obviously, from that previous challenge result) find this stuff attractive, I find it cloyingly sentimental. It has a contrived adge that, for me, simplifies the idea (and ideal) of relationships, and is actually, I beloieve, damaging, in that it encourages people to think that this kind of dreamy sunset gush is an attainable reality; its like people with flawless ''perfect'' bodies having sex without producing any sticky mess - just like the worst kind of movies.', '2005-12-05 20:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925080, 263804, 26313, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for flower pics, but this is nice. DOF is just right, composition great, excellent colours, nice and sharp....</td>', 'I''m not much for flower pics, but this is nice. DOF is just right, composition great, excellent colours, nice and sharp....', '2005-12-05 20:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925087, 253647, 26313, '<td valign="top">Sharper focus on shoe/leg would be nice, and not cropped so tight on the right. Composition is nice, I like the angle, though some may not.</td>', 'Sharper focus on shoe/leg would be nice, and not cropped so tight on the right. Composition is nice, I like the angle, though some may not.', '2005-12-05 20:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925090, 264020, 26313, '<td valign="top">Intriguing...</td>', 'Intriguing...', '2005-12-05 20:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925107, 263833, 43774, '<td valign="top">Stunning!</td>', 'Stunning!', '2005-12-05 20:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925110, 260116, 26313, '<td valign="top">Not bad. I can only imagine how difficult it was to get them to cooperate... Focus seems decent on the eyes, but a little too soft on the noses, so a larger DOF might be in order. Some sharpening might help a little though. All in all, there is little to complain about, but among the rest of the photos it really doesn''t stand out. A more interesting (or more contrasting), yet not distracting background might help.</td>', 'Not bad. I can only imagine how difficult it was to get them to cooperate... Focus seems decent on the eyes, but a little too soft on the noses, so a larger DOF might be in order. Some sharpening might help a little though. All in all, there is little to complain about, but among the rest of the photos it really doesn''t stand out. A more interesting (or more contrasting), yet not distracting background might help.', '2005-12-05 20:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925112, 264004, 43774, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous sky and colours.</td>', 'Gorgeous sky and colours.', '2005-12-05 20:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925116, 260082, 6999, '<td valign="top">I don''t go a bundle on the processing - puts it more into the field of painting than photography, for me. Of course, the detail and all that stuff is everso well done, and the knackered quality of the geezer''s clothes, and his little prison tattoo add a contrast to his ;''cheerful'' santa hat. I think I don''t like the gaze into camera - inevitably, that becomes a performance thing - and the shot becomes a simple portrait. Perhaps I work too much with performance, but perhaps an idea of the photographer not being part of the story - and you undoubtedly are, when your subject fixes his gaze on you - is old hat, and belongs to a documentary idea that the world has left behind; nevertheless, that engagement pushed an absence of authenticity into this shot: he knows you''re shooting, and so what he <i>is</i> at this moment is perhaps less real.<br/> <br/>My first reaction was that I wanted to know more of his environment - and then, of course, from the posters on the lamppost, and the newspaper box (?), it is clear enough. People, I think, don''t exist in isolation - a difficulty I have with more portraits. People are part of their environment, and both contribute to it and belong to it; and without it, however battered and entrancig their face, I find them rather meaningless, perhaps. I''m not sure, as I write, that that''s anything to be proud of.<br/> <br/>This might well be the most interesting shot in this challenge, however - I''m just expressing the thoughts that spring to mind from it - and anything that prompts thoughts like that <i>has</i> to be a good photograph. I just want more documentary (which we get little enough of here), and less ''study'' - of which we get far too much, though rarely with this kind of love.</td>', 'I don''t go a bundle on the processing - puts it more into the field of painting than photography, for me. Of course, the detail and all that stuff is everso well done, and the knackered quality of the geezer''s clothes, and his little prison tattoo add a contrast to his ;''cheerful'' santa hat. I think I don''t like the gaze into camera - inevitably, that becomes a performance thing - and the shot becomes a simple portrait. Perhaps I work too much with performance, but perhaps an idea of the photographer not being part of the story - and you undoubtedly are, when your subject fixes his gaze on you - is old hat, and belongs to a documentary idea that the world has left behind; nevertheless, that engagement pushed an absence of authenticity into this shot: he knows you''re shooting, and so what he is at this moment is perhaps less real. My first reaction was that I wanted to know more of his environment - and then, of course, from the posters on the lamppost, and the newspaper box (?), it is clear enough. People, I think, don''t exist in isolation - a difficulty I have with more portraits. People are part of their environment, and both contribute to it and belong to it; and without it, however battered and entrancig their face, I find them rather meaningless, perhaps. I''m not sure, as I write, that that''s anything to be proud of. This might well be the most interesting shot in this challenge, however - I''m just expressing the thoughts that spring to mind from it - and anything that prompts thoughts like that has to be a good photograph. I just want more documentary (which we get little enough of here), and less ''study'' - of which we get far too much, though rarely with this kind of love.', '2005-12-05 20:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925117, 261113, 26313, '<td valign="top">I think I''m missing it. I don''t think I''m seeing what I am supposed to see. Or maybe I''m looking too hard. Parts of it are interesting, but I have to say, the whole thing doesn''t really do much for me.</td>', 'I think I''m missing it. I don''t think I''m seeing what I am supposed to see. Or maybe I''m looking too hard. Parts of it are interesting, but I have to say, the whole thing doesn''t really do much for me.', '2005-12-05 20:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925124, 262390, 6999, '<td valign="top">Long exposure to get that misted effect, I''d guess - from the intensity of the lights and the brightness of the sky. Has a dreamy quality, for sure, and the tonality captured on the structure is well done.</td>', 'Long exposure to get that misted effect, I''d guess - from the intensity of the lights and the brightness of the sky. Has a dreamy quality, for sure, and the tonality captured on the structure is well done.', '2005-12-05 20:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925134, 264098, 26313, '<td valign="top">I think the horses could be a touch sharper, and either a larger or smaller DOF. The background takes up a large portion of the picture, and I find it frustratingly in between focused and totally blurred out--I can see the detail, but it''s not sharp enough to be appealing. I think I would like it best with a large DOF and everything in focus, but smaller DOF to blur the background more could work too.</td>', 'I think the horses could be a touch sharper, and either a larger or smaller DOF. The background takes up a large portion of the picture, and I find it frustratingly in between focused and totally blurred out--I can see the detail, but it''s not sharp enough to be appealing. I think I would like it best with a large DOF and everything in focus, but smaller DOF to blur the background more could work too.', '2005-12-05 20:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925135, 264158, 24846, '<td valign="top">What a place. Nice exposure study. Like how my eye is drwn down. Good luck</td>', 'What a place. Nice exposure study. Like how my eye is drwn down. Good luck', '2005-12-05 20:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925137, 263117, 6999, '<td valign="top">I suspect maay won''t like it, but I always find that this depth of border adds a certain sophistication to a shot. There is some capture of mood here, and ths lishgtly unorthodix composition is well done, and effective.</td>', 'I suspect maay won''t like it, but I always find that this depth of border adds a certain sophistication to a shot. There is some capture of mood here, and ths lishgtly unorthodix composition is well done, and effective.', '2005-12-05 20:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925139, 263666, 24846, '<td valign="top">Nice kitty, like he''s pusching through the crt to see me. -7-</td>', 'Nice kitty, like he''s pusching through the crt to see me. -7-', '2005-12-05 20:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925142, 262275, 24846, '<td valign="top">great minimalism study. -9-</td>', 'great minimalism study. -9-', '2005-12-05 20:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925149, 264128, 24846, '<td valign="top">Boy that is some bolt on my right. Great capture -8-</td>', 'Boy that is some bolt on my right. Great capture -8-', '2005-12-05 20:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925151, 262321, 24846, '<td valign="top">Tranquil, like the crop, good luck.</td>', 'Tranquil, like the crop, good luck.', '2005-12-05 20:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925152, 260657, 24846, '<td valign="top">Neat sci-fi look. Good luck.</td>', 'Neat sci-fi look. Good luck.', '2005-12-05 20:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925153, 261964, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very nice, clear, well taken picture. My eyes keep wanting to see more of the clock face - perhaps the crop is a little close.</td>', 'Very nice, clear, well taken picture. My eyes keep wanting to see more of the clock face - perhaps the crop is a little close.', '2005-12-05 20:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925155, 262096, 26313, '<td valign="top">I think there are too many competing elements here. At the left the rocks line up almost perfectly with the mountains in the back ground, as well as the clouds, which kind of takes away from their unique shapes. The detail in the rocks is interesting, so I''d like to see them closer. On the other hand, I like the pools too, and it may have been difficult to do both. I like how the lumpy clouds kind of mimic the lumpy rock, but it is all too much I think. I think it needs a slightly different angle and some simplification.</td>', 'I think there are too many competing elements here. At the left the rocks line up almost perfectly with the mountains in the back ground, as well as the clouds, which kind of takes away from their unique shapes. The detail in the rocks is interesting, so I''d like to see them closer. On the other hand, I like the pools too, and it may have been difficult to do both. I like how the lumpy clouds kind of mimic the lumpy rock, but it is all too much I think. I think it needs a slightly different angle and some simplification.', '2005-12-05 20:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925156, 260951, 35444, '<td valign="top">What a pretty building.  I wish it wasn''t so soft.</td>', 'What a pretty building.  I wish it wasn''t so soft.', '2005-12-05 20:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925157, 260116, 24846, '<td valign="top">Ohhhh. What a pose. Good luck on this feline beauty.</td>', 'Ohhhh. What a pose. Good luck on this feline beauty.', '2005-12-05 20:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925159, 263894, 18552, '<td valign="top">Interesting scene. The horizon looks a bit tilted and it seems a bit over sharpened.</td>', 'Interesting scene. The horizon looks a bit tilted and it seems a bit over sharpened.', '2005-12-05 20:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925160, 261775, 26313, '<td valign="top">This captures the essence of cat-ness, I think.</td>', 'This captures the essence of cat-ness, I think.', '2005-12-05 20:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925161, 261967, 18552, '<td valign="top">A very beautiful girl and well taken photo. I really wish it wasn''t the style to chop off the tops of heads in portraits. To me they look incomplete.</td>', 'A very beautiful girl and well taken photo. I really wish it wasn''t the style to chop off the tops of heads in portraits. To me they look incomplete.', '2005-12-05 20:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925162, 262390, 24846, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, exposure, crop and processing.</td>', 'Nice capture, exposure, crop and processing.', '2005-12-05 20:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925163, 261279, 26313, '<td valign="top">Textures and lighting is interesting, but I think I''d shoot it from a bit of a different angle.</td>', 'Textures and lighting is interesting, but I think I''d shoot it from a bit of a different angle.', '2005-12-05 20:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925164, 263579, 18552, '<td valign="top">I like the dreamy feel and the colors in your picture.</td>', 'I like the dreamy feel and the colors in your picture.', '2005-12-05 20:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925170, 263666, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very nice cat portrait. I do wish the eara hadn''t been cropped off.</td>', 'Very nice cat portrait. I do wish the eara hadn''t been cropped off.', '2005-12-05 20:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925172, 264109, 24846, '<td valign="top">Three minus the child. Good luck on this sunset beauty.</td>', 'Three minus the child. Good luck on this sunset beauty.', '2005-12-05 20:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925175, 259716, 26313, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but I''d do it contrasty in black and white.</td>', 'I like the composition, but I''d do it contrasty in black and white.', '2005-12-05 20:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925181, 263259, 24846, '<td valign="top">I like this. The shadow of the lamp makes it. Good luck</td>', 'I like this. The shadow of the lamp makes it. Good luck', '2005-12-05 20:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925183, 263588, 26313, '<td valign="top">I think I would prefer the ducks in the lower right corner, with more water and less ground.</td>', 'I think I would prefer the ducks in the lower right corner, with more water and less ground.', '2005-12-05 20:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
