(1925249, 261617, 26313, '<td valign="top">I like this. My only complaint would be that it seems tilted slightly counter-clockwise. Since you''re basically square-on to the doorway, and it is more or less symmetric, I''d just set the bottom edge of the door horizontal (since none of the vertical lines are ever really going to be vertical without perspective correction). Other than that... Nice!</td>', 'I like this. My only complaint would be that it seems tilted slightly counter-clockwise. Since you''re basically square-on to the doorway, and it is more or less symmetric, I''d just set the bottom edge of the door horizontal (since none of the vertical lines are ever really going to be vertical without perspective correction). Other than that... Nice!', '2005-12-05 21:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
