(1925322, 260477, 35804, '<td valign="top">What a nice abstract this makes...I love the greenish glow of the light on the slick pier...the boats gathered round to share the day''s stories in anticipation of what may come tommorrow...nicely done.</td>', 'What a nice abstract this makes...I love the greenish glow of the light on the slick pier...the boats gathered round to share the day''s stories in anticipation of what may come tommorrow...nicely done.', '2005-12-05 21:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
