(1925678, 257207, 8637, '<td valign="top">The image is way too much dominated by the bar framing.  Takes away from a nice overall shot.</td>', 'The image is way too much dominated by the bar framing.  Takes away from a nice overall shot.', '2005-12-05 22:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925679, 260116, 18552, '<td valign="top">What a pretty cat portrait. Very well done.</td>', 'What a pretty cat portrait. Very well done.', '2005-12-05 22:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925682, 261913, 8637, '<td valign="top">Not very tight focus...really important to a good macro shot.</td>', 'Not very tight focus...really important to a good macro shot.', '2005-12-05 22:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925685, 263541, 8637, '<td valign="top">Needs to be in better forcus.  Critical to a good macro shot.</td>', 'Needs to be in better forcus.  Critical to a good macro shot.', '2005-12-05 22:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925689, 253965, 8637, '<td valign="top">Title seems obscure for topic and the shot really does not have anything that says "wow" for the DPC.  The framing also seems to detract.</td>', 'Title seems obscure for topic and the shot really does not have anything that says "wow" for the DPC.  The framing also seems to detract.', '2005-12-05 23:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925693, 263875, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great train! But the house steals the attention here by its placement and lightness. There needs to be a little more train and a less distracting background.</td>', 'Great train! But the house steals the attention here by its placement and lightness. There needs to be a little more train and a less distracting background.', '2005-12-05 23:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925694, 264004, 33672, '<td valign="top">Colors blend really well here! Comp is great and the lighting/shadows are spectacular.</td>', 'Colors blend really well here! Comp is great and the lighting/shadows are spectacular.', '2005-12-05 23:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925695, 256649, 28471, '<td valign="top">I like the subdued colors in this photo.  This doesn''t look overprocessed as many landscapes shot digitally do.  The reflections are well captured also. (8)</td>', 'I like the subdued colors in this photo.  This doesn''t look overprocessed as many landscapes shot digitally do.  The reflections are well captured also. (8)', '2005-12-05 23:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925697, 262920, 8637, '<td valign="top">Image off level (may have been intended but does seem to detract from shot) and overall does not seem to have fully captured the colors of the scene. <br/></td>', 'Image off level (may have been intended but does seem to detract from shot) and overall does not seem to have fully captured the colors of the scene. ', '2005-12-05 23:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925704, 261263, 8637, '<td valign="top">Not in sharp focus and glare in eyes really distracts from the beast.</td>', 'Not in sharp focus and glare in eyes really distracts from the beast.', '2005-12-05 23:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925705, 263870, 33672, '<td valign="top">Focal point isn''t what I would''ve done. seems reversed. A Deeper DOF may help.</td>', 'Focal point isn''t what I would''ve done. seems reversed. A Deeper DOF may help.', '2005-12-05 23:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925707, 263938, 8637, '<td valign="top">Macros have to be in very sharp focus.</td>', 'Macros have to be in very sharp focus.', '2005-12-05 23:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925708, 257630, 28471, '<td valign="top">I like the color balance in this photo and the exposure is great.  I find that this photo may lack a definate point of focus.  I know the frozen pond was meant to be a point of focus but it seems to centrally placed.</td>', 'I like the color balance in this photo and the exposure is great.  I find that this photo may lack a definate point of focus.  I know the frozen pond was meant to be a point of focus but it seems to centrally placed.', '2005-12-05 23:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925709, 257541, 18552, '<td valign="top">I like how the blue stands out on the overalls. This child has such a cute face, the photo seems a bit too high key to really show the details of her features. It seems like it is the style anymore to cut off the tops of a person''s head in a portrait - to me it just makes it seem like something is lacking.</td>', 'I like how the blue stands out on the overalls. This child has such a cute face, the photo seems a bit too high key to really show the details of her features. It seems like it is the style anymore to cut off the tops of a person''s head in a portrait - to me it just makes it seem like something is lacking.', '2005-12-05 23:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925712, 259826, 8637, '<td valign="top">Beautiful dog but glare from light is really a detraction.</td>', 'Beautiful dog but glare from light is really a detraction.', '2005-12-05 23:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925714, 258302, 8637, '<td valign="top">This could be in the top 5.  Great capture.  A 9.</td>', 'This could be in the top 5.  Great capture.  A 9.', '2005-12-05 23:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925716, 262693, 18552, '<td valign="top">This just seems to cry out to be in color. So much of the beauty of a flower is the color. It''s hard to tell if it has dulcet tones or not when it is all just shades of gray.</td>', 'This just seems to cry out to be in color. So much of the beauty of a flower is the color. It''s hard to tell if it has dulcet tones or not when it is all just shades of gray.', '2005-12-05 23:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925719, 264127, 8637, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture...one of my top 4.  Good luck!</td>', 'Wonderful capture...one of my top 4.  Good luck!', '2005-12-05 23:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925720, 264085, 10402, '<td valign="top">Interesting. My eye is drawn first to the bright smoke, then while following its shape, wondering what it is, I suddenly see the man and understanding clicks in. Effective.</td>', 'Interesting. My eye is drawn first to the bright smoke, then while following its shape, wondering what it is, I suddenly see the man and understanding clicks in. Effective.', '2005-12-05 23:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925721, 263075, 28471, '<td valign="top">Simple photo but effective.  I really like the compostion and the natural gradient of this photo. (9)</td>', 'Simple photo but effective.  I really like the compostion and the natural gradient of this photo. (9)', '2005-12-05 23:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925724, 260082, 8637, '<td valign="top">I love people shots and this is one of my favorites.  Great lighting and contrast.  Top 4.</td>', 'I love people shots and this is one of my favorites.  Great lighting and contrast.  Top 4.', '2005-12-05 23:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925725, 262315, 28471, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems flat in this photo.</td>', 'The lighting seems flat in this photo.', '2005-12-05 23:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925726, 262450, 8637, '<td valign="top">Great candid shot and provide a real sense of being there.  One of my top 4.</td>', 'Great candid shot and provide a real sense of being there.  One of my top 4.', '2005-12-05 23:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925729, 262921, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great composition, but not enough contrast; the blacks aren''t black enough.</td>', 'Great composition, but not enough contrast; the blacks aren''t black enough.', '2005-12-05 23:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925730, 263137, 28471, '<td valign="top">I know this is high key lighting but I still feel this was overexposed.</td>', 'I know this is high key lighting but I still feel this was overexposed.', '2005-12-05 23:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925732, 259861, 8637, '<td valign="top">Everything came together...wonderful light, position of the wings, and super title.</td>', 'Everything came together...wonderful light, position of the wings, and super title.', '2005-12-05 23:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925740, 260147, 10402, '<td valign="top">Very dynamic. Grabs my attention! Needs a better title...</td>', 'Very dynamic. Grabs my attention! Needs a better title...', '2005-12-05 23:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925743, 263654, 28471, '<td valign="top">Very creative.  I know you will get knocked but doing a silhouette.  I am also sure you got plenty of "This is too dark" but I actually like darker photos and this one works well.  Good job and the centered composition actually works well with this photo. (8)</td>', 'Very creative.  I know you will get knocked but doing a silhouette.  I am also sure you got plenty of "This is too dark" but I actually like darker photos and this one works well.  Good job and the centered composition actually works well with this photo. (8)', '2005-12-05 23:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925751, 264135, 28471, '<td valign="top">I like the composition with the twisting trunk but I feel blue gradient came out a bit too strong in this photo.</td>', 'I like the composition with the twisting trunk but I feel blue gradient came out a bit too strong in this photo.', '2005-12-05 23:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925753, 263060, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very cute kid - too bad you cropped off the top of his hat.</td>', 'Very cute kid - too bad you cropped off the top of his hat.', '2005-12-05 23:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925760, 263889, 70, '<td valign="top">Nice crispness. Use the whole 640, more impact that way.</td>', 'Nice crispness. Use the whole 640, more impact that way.', '2005-12-05 23:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925764, 259418, 10402, '<td valign="top">Poignant</td>', 'Poignant', '2005-12-05 23:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925769, 255145, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is really nice. So well taken, great compostion, great focus - great everything!</td>', 'This is really nice. So well taken, great compostion, great focus - great everything!', '2005-12-05 23:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925770, 263618, 70, '<td valign="top">For me, this photo really lacks a point of interest.</td>', 'For me, this photo really lacks a point of interest.', '2005-12-05 23:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925775, 261556, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very pretty woman and a well done photograph. How I wish it wasn''t the style to crop off the top of the subject''s head in portraits now days. It just makes it look incomplete to my eyes.</td>', 'Very pretty woman and a well done photograph. How I wish it wasn''t the style to crop off the top of the subject''s head in portraits now days. It just makes it look incomplete to my eyes.', '2005-12-05 23:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925776, 262816, 32602, '<td valign="top">lovely shot, wish there was more at the top</td>', 'lovely shot, wish there was more at the top', '2005-12-05 23:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925779, 262321, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great setting with nice reflections in the water. A horizontal format would better match the photo''s mood.</td>', 'Great setting with nice reflections in the water. A horizontal format would better match the photo''s mood.', '2005-12-05 23:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925791, 263962, 32602, '<td valign="top">greatshot love the tones<br/>                     .................a self portrait or an exboyfriend?</td>', 'greatshot love the tones                     .................a self portrait or an exboyfriend?', '2005-12-05 23:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925795, 253709, 70, '<td valign="top">The colors seem a bit off in this. I like the idea but compositionally, I''d like there to be a bit more space on the left for the boat to float into.</td>', 'The colors seem a bit off in this. I like the idea but compositionally, I''d like there to be a bit more space on the left for the boat to float into.', '2005-12-05 23:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925800, 261963, 10402, '<td valign="top">A beautiful scene by itself. But woman watching from the foreground really draws the viewer into the scene. Brilliant.</td>', 'A beautiful scene by itself. But woman watching from the foreground really draws the viewer into the scene. Brilliant.', '2005-12-05 23:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925803, 263943, 70, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Nice catchlight in the eyes, good clarity in the face. I love the bit of straw(?) he has in his mouth. The yellowy outline is a bit distracting, I think it would stand to be darker.</td>', 'Very cool. Nice catchlight in the eyes, good clarity in the face. I love the bit of straw(?) he has in his mouth. The yellowy outline is a bit distracting, I think it would stand to be darker.', '2005-12-05 23:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925804, 255732, 32602, '<td valign="top">lovely, great tones</td>', 'lovely, great tones', '2005-12-05 23:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925811, 264186, 35350, '<td valign="top">great color, absolutely blasing!</td>', 'great color, absolutely blasing!', '2005-12-05 23:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925814, 262725, 32602, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous, looks vintage</td>', 'Gorgeous, looks vintage', '2005-12-05 23:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925818, 264055, 32602, '<td valign="top">so cute!</td>', 'so cute!', '2005-12-05 23:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925821, 260280, 32602, '<td valign="top">great clarity</td>', 'great clarity', '2005-12-05 23:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925825, 264181, 32602, '<td valign="top">pretty</td>', 'pretty', '2005-12-05 23:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925827, 261122, 32602, '<td valign="top">lovely, great colour, good timing</td>', 'lovely, great colour, good timing', '2005-12-05 23:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925831, 264120, 32602, '<td valign="top">what a cutie</td>', 'what a cutie', '2005-12-05 23:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925834, 256912, 32602, '<td valign="top">love the composition and colour, light looks unusual</td>', 'love the composition and colour, light looks unusual', '2005-12-05 23:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925840, 259418, 32602, '<td valign="top">very sweet, love the grain</td>', 'very sweet, love the grain', '2005-12-05 23:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925844, 263877, 70, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful scene. The vignetting seems a little lopsided - heavy on the left. And perhaps lighten up the barn a bit to draw attention to it. Love the colors.</td>', 'This is a beautiful scene. The vignetting seems a little lopsided - heavy on the left. And perhaps lighten up the barn a bit to draw attention to it. Love the colors.', '2005-12-05 23:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925845, 263709, 32602, '<td valign="top">cool angle</td>', 'cool angle', '2005-12-05 23:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925848, 264193, 10402, '<td valign="top">Very delicate and beautiful, but too dark. A high key treatment would suit this well. The color cast is complementary.</td>', 'Very delicate and beautiful, but too dark. A high key treatment would suit this well. The color cast is complementary.', '2005-12-05 23:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925862, 255744, 32602, '<td valign="top">zany! but cool</td>', 'zany! but cool', '2005-12-05 23:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925868, 260691, 70, '<td valign="top">I like the coloring and composition here. To be honest, I''m having a bit of a hard time determining what the photo is of - I believe a cemetary? But a little hard to discern.</td>', 'I like the coloring and composition here. To be honest, I''m having a bit of a hard time determining what the photo is of - I believe a cemetary? But a little hard to discern.', '2005-12-05 23:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925875, 260205, 32602, '<td valign="top">great patterns</td>', 'great patterns', '2005-12-05 23:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925880, 264100, 22734, '<td valign="top">Quite a school with such swift and agile movement. The excitement pf the composition with sweeping across the frame is superb. I realize the challenge taken for this image and a sharper focus would have really helped this image realize its final potential. Yet, the overall movement dances well. Bumping up.</td>', 'Quite a school with such swift and agile movement. The excitement pf the composition with sweeping across the frame is superb. I realize the challenge taken for this image and a sharper focus would have really helped this image realize its final potential. Yet, the overall movement dances well. Bumping up.', '2005-12-05 23:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925884, 264109, 70, '<td valign="top">Hrm...I wonder who this is. :) Lovely photo. A teeny bit hot for me between their heads but otherwise beautiful.</td>', 'Hrm...I wonder who this is. :) Lovely photo. A teeny bit hot for me between their heads but otherwise beautiful.', '2005-12-05 23:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925889, 262097, 22734, '<td valign="top">Such an inviting image with a  tempting low key coloration. The rising rocks and the quiet waters graced by the lovely distant water and sky gives this image that unique serene view. It is powerfull enough and shows no apparant flaws. Bumping up.</td>', 'Such an inviting image with a  tempting low key coloration. The rising rocks and the quiet waters graced by the lovely distant water and sky gives this image that unique serene view. It is powerfull enough and shows no apparant flaws. Bumping up.', '2005-12-05 23:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925899, 260388, 22734, '<td valign="top">The lonely tree gives this image a sparse look but once the eye travels away across the ground and detects the hair like detail kissed by spotlights of sky glow give great weight to this composition. The rule of thirds plays perfect with the groun and then with the tree and all is adorned with the gentle support of the full bodied clouds. Bumping up.</td>', 'The lonely tree gives this image a sparse look but once the eye travels away across the ground and detects the hair like detail kissed by spotlights of sky glow give great weight to this composition. The rule of thirds plays perfect with the groun and then with the tree and all is adorned with the gentle support of the full bodied clouds. Bumping up.', '2005-12-05 23:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925910, 258362, 22734, '<td valign="top">Glowing like a hot smelting rod with the splendor of a ruby jewel with waters so still and the lovely migration of the birds...A sky that settles softly from blue to a hazy orange...Bumping up.</td>', 'Glowing like a hot smelting rod with the splendor of a ruby jewel with waters so still and the lovely migration of the birds...A sky that settles softly from blue to a hazy orange...Bumping up.', '2005-12-05 23:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925925, 256436, 22734, '<td valign="top">Perhaps the simplest landscape but timing and the heavenly glow sweeping gently across the water give this image that quality attributed to a fine wine. The foreground gives the viewer enough coloration and suddenly we also get the treat of the silhoutted bush on the left that ties to the distant silhoutte of the land mass and then the eyes follow the horizon, almost like walking a tightrope to find along the way what appears to be a boat. the tranquility and fine detail is stunning. Bumping up.</td>', 'Perhaps the simplest landscape but timing and the heavenly glow sweeping gently across the water give this image that quality attributed to a fine wine. The foreground gives the viewer enough coloration and suddenly we also get the treat of the silhoutted bush on the left that ties to the distant silhoutte of the land mass and then the eyes follow the horizon, almost like walking a tightrope to find along the way what appears to be a boat. the tranquility and fine detail is stunning. Bumping up.', '2005-12-05 23:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925939, 260370, 22734, '<td valign="top">Many people have such love for "blue" images. This one satisfies this urge with great visual rewards. The coble stones dominate the foreground and then the eye moves slowly up swallowing the delicate beauty of the cloud reflection and then that magical fog that rises upwards to show off a  lazy and  easy moving cloud formation with a delicate blue sky. Then we follow the billow of smpke as it sweeps to the left... An image to gey lost in with no need for improvement. Bumping up.</td>', 'Many people have such love for "blue" images. This one satisfies this urge with great visual rewards. The coble stones dominate the foreground and then the eye moves slowly up swallowing the delicate beauty of the cloud reflection and then that magical fog that rises upwards to show off a  lazy and  easy moving cloud formation with a delicate blue sky. Then we follow the billow of smpke as it sweeps to the left... An image to gey lost in with no need for improvement. Bumping up.', '2005-12-06 00:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925950, 263654, 49103, '<td valign="top">beautiful lighting</td>', 'beautiful lighting', '2005-12-06 00:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925962, 263976, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is one of those images whose coloration is like color with very fine pigment. Wherein reds and oranges and greens have an almost transparant feel. It is almost like an understatement of color and herein lies its very unique beauty. It feels like silk on the skin and to the eyes like those images we see in dreams. Bumping up.</td>', 'This is one of those images whose coloration is like color with very fine pigment. Wherein reds and oranges and greens have an almost transparant feel. It is almost like an understatement of color and herein lies its very unique beauty. It feels like silk on the skin and to the eyes like those images we see in dreams. Bumping up.', '2005-12-06 00:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925971, 264076, 22734, '<td valign="top">A most pleasing graphical rendition of a different world of intricate wonder. Bumping up.</td>', 'A most pleasing graphical rendition of a different world of intricate wonder. Bumping up.', '2005-12-06 00:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925986, 262843, 22734, '<td valign="top">An image of an isolated subject surrounded by the sheer beauty of narure. The composition sings very loudly because the white snowy roof help accent the trees that sweep in great detail across the view. The dark body of the structure apek of cold timber and we look to find a semblance of life. The neatness of the foreground answers this question. What a lovely find. Bumping up.</td>', 'An image of an isolated subject surrounded by the sheer beauty of narure. The composition sings very loudly because the white snowy roof help accent the trees that sweep in great detail across the view. The dark body of the structure apek of cold timber and we look to find a semblance of life. The neatness of the foreground answers this question. What a lovely find. Bumping up.', '2005-12-06 00:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925995, 263833, 22734, '<td valign="top">This lovely images gives the illusion that the boats are floating in mid air. What quiet waters and what a superb reflection like no other i have seen. The light above sinks gently to the rocks in the foreground wherein we do a double take to ground our senses. Speak of an image that moves and then add this low key coloration! Wow!  Bumping up.</td>', 'This lovely images gives the illusion that the boats are floating in mid air. What quiet waters and what a superb reflection like no other i have seen. The light above sinks gently to the rocks in the foreground wherein we do a double take to ground our senses. Speak of an image that moves and then add this low key coloration! Wow!  Bumping up.', '2005-12-06 00:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926001, 263228, 22734, '<td valign="top">A sinking glowing gem bathing all above and across with its mars like red glow. A sense of yearning to explore the distant shores more like foloowing the sun. Bumping up.</td>', 'A sinking glowing gem bathing all above and across with its mars like red glow. A sense of yearning to explore the distant shores more like foloowing the sun. Bumping up.', '2005-12-06 00:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926070, 260078, 33672, '<td valign="top">Yes it is! 10. Interestin subject matter.</td>', 'Yes it is! 10. Interestin subject matter.', '2005-12-06 00:44:40.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1926075, 259342, 33672, '<td valign="top">Comp, shadows/lighting and tones are terrific. Soft focus works well here.</td>', 'Comp, shadows/lighting and tones are terrific. Soft focus works well here.', '2005-12-06 00:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926079, 262496, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great subject matter. Very emotive. Comp works well.</td>', 'Great subject matter. Very emotive. Comp works well.', '2005-12-06 00:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926092, 264172, 45672, '<td valign="top">Cool bird, might have been slightly better if you used a lighter background.  The bottom half of the bird is difficult to see with the dark background.  Great detail and focus though.</td>', 'Cool bird, might have been slightly better if you used a lighter background.  The bottom half of the bird is difficult to see with the dark background.  Great detail and focus though.', '2005-12-06 00:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926093, 264086, 45672, '<td valign="top">What a great shot.  This is great photography.</td>', 'What a great shot.  This is great photography.', '2005-12-06 00:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926104, 261658, 44516, '<td valign="top">wooow... i love it so much</td>', 'wooow... i love it so much', '2005-12-06 00:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926106, 263392, 21072, '<td valign="top">Great perspective, composition and colours</td>', 'Great perspective, composition and colours', '2005-12-06 00:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926108, 264177, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot. I like the white b/g and the tight crop.</td>', 'Very cool shot. I like the white b/g and the tight crop.', '2005-12-06 01:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926111, 263436, 21072, '<td valign="top">I don''t usually care for sport/action shots, but the lighting of the water in this one really makes it interesting</td>', 'I don''t usually care for sport/action shots, but the lighting of the water in this one really makes it interesting', '2005-12-06 01:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926115, 262536, 21072, '<td valign="top">Beautiful coloure, I like the mood of the shot</td>', 'Beautiful coloure, I like the mood of the shot', '2005-12-06 01:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926116, 256368, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot. Great lighting and awesome detail. On a side note, whenever I see these clownfish now, I can''t help but think about the movie ''Finding Nemo'' . Cute movie :-)  Did you shoot this in an aquarium? I have tried on mine, but not had good results yet. Or was this underwater (diving)? Either way, very good, I see more shots like this that are not good than are. Nice job.</td>', 'Very cool shot. Great lighting and awesome detail. On a side note, whenever I see these clownfish now, I can''t help but think about the movie ''Finding Nemo'' . Cute movie :-)  Did you shoot this in an aquarium? I have tried on mine, but not had good results yet. Or was this underwater (diving)? Either way, very good, I see more shots like this that are not good than are. Nice job.', '2005-12-06 01:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926118, 259103, 21072, '<td valign="top">Outstanding sunset!!!</td>', 'Outstanding sunset!!!', '2005-12-06 01:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926123, 260848, 19831, '<td valign="top">A very pleasant scene. I like the yellow bush. The image though looks very un-natural to me, an an uncomfortable way. Like some effect filter in ps or something.</td>', 'A very pleasant scene. I like the yellow bush. The image though looks very un-natural to me, an an uncomfortable way. Like some effect filter in ps or something.', '2005-12-06 01:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926124, 263505, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition. Quite crisp and clear. Kind of looks like a painting.</td>', 'Very nice composition. Quite crisp and clear. Kind of looks like a painting.', '2005-12-06 01:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926131, 260078, 44516, '<td valign="top">i love it so much .. nice color</td>', 'i love it so much .. nice color', '2005-12-06 01:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926135, 263514, 47508, '<td valign="top">very cool!</td>', 'very cool!', '2005-12-06 01:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926174, 262405, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very good shot. Great clarity and detail. I really like the ominous black tunnell, and a great point of view. Line of pillars make for a great leading line to the tunnel. Just a thought here, but the partial tunnel to the right seems to take a little bit of the dynamics away from the composition to me. I''m wondering how the shot would look with maybe like an 8x12 crop, bring the right edge of the frame in to the line of pillars? In fact, I hold up a piece of paper and ''crop'' even past the first pillar and right up to the second, and it feels like it draws me into the image more powerfully. Maybe that''s just me though :-) I also really like the tone and the feel here. The somewhat muted colors play together well, and helps the pillars and dark tunnel really stand out and grab your attention. Nice job.</td>', 'Very good shot. Great clarity and detail. I really like the ominous black tunnell, and a great point of view. Line of pillars make for a great leading line to the tunnel. Just a thought here, but the partial tunnel to the right seems to take a little bit of the dynamics away from the composition to me. I''m wondering how the shot would look with maybe like an 8x12 crop, bring the right edge of the frame in to the line of pillars? In fact, I hold up a piece of paper and ''crop'' even past the first pillar and right up to the second, and it feels like it draws me into the image more powerfully. Maybe that''s just me though :-) I also really like the tone and the feel here. The somewhat muted colors play together well, and helps the pillars and dark tunnel really stand out and grab your attention. Nice job.', '2005-12-06 01:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926183, 263048, 15511, '<td valign="top">Over-sharpened, but a strong image none-the-less.</td>', 'Over-sharpened, but a strong image none-the-less.', '2005-12-06 01:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926188, 262958, 19831, '<td valign="top">I think this is a really good idea. The presentation though leaves me with a feeling of wanting a little more though. I''m thinking that the background seems just a little too busy and slightly distracting because of the changing color and textures. The composition could perhaps be a little more dynamic if the subject were framed on a vertical across the photo instead of just laid out on center.  Also, although the pink bag is a nice color, I find interest in the makeup items and wish the focus was sharper there than as it is now, sharp on the pink bag. Maybe just a little deeper dof would make a difference. Like I said, I think you''ve chosen a good subject, that has interest, a good eye, good exposure on the shot. A little more care in the presentation could maybe make a considerable boost in the score. Just my opinion of course :-)</td>', 'I think this is a really good idea. The presentation though leaves me with a feeling of wanting a little more though. I''m thinking that the background seems just a little too busy and slightly distracting because of the changing color and textures. The composition could perhaps be a little more dynamic if the subject were framed on a vertical across the photo instead of just laid out on center.  Also, although the pink bag is a nice color, I find interest in the makeup items and wish the focus was sharper there than as it is now, sharp on the pink bag. Maybe just a little deeper dof would make a difference. Like I said, I think you''ve chosen a good subject, that has interest, a good eye, good exposure on the shot. A little more care in the presentation could maybe make a considerable boost in the score. Just my opinion of course :-)', '2005-12-06 01:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926194, 263060, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very cute photo. I like how clean and uncluttered you''ve kept it. Nice comp. It looks like he could grow up and be a big rodeo star :-)</td>', 'Very cute photo. I like how clean and uncluttered you''ve kept it. Nice comp. It looks like he could grow up and be a big rodeo star :-)', '2005-12-06 01:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926198, 263787, 19831, '<td valign="top">I like your use of natural framing with the trees. Nice sunset shot.</td>', 'I like your use of natural framing with the trees. Nice sunset shot.', '2005-12-06 01:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926207, 261775, 19831, '<td valign="top">Great photo. Nice detail. Very nice tonality. I really like the framing/composition, and how the cat is looking off the scene. Peaks my interest and makes me wonder what he''s looking at (perhaps a big juicy mouse :-)  One minor nitpick, I wish the dof were just a slight touch deeper, just enough to have the centered eye a bit sharper, it seems just ever so slightly off. Very nice shot :-)</td>', 'Great photo. Nice detail. Very nice tonality. I really like the framing/composition, and how the cat is looking off the scene. Peaks my interest and makes me wonder what he''s looking at (perhaps a big juicy mouse :-)  One minor nitpick, I wish the dof were just a slight touch deeper, just enough to have the centered eye a bit sharper, it seems just ever so slightly off. Very nice shot :-)', '2005-12-06 02:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926212, 263579, 19831, '<td valign="top">Great color/tones. I''m a fan of the soft focus, but I''m feelin'' like this might be just a touch too far, not much, but a little.</td>', 'Great color/tones. I''m a fan of the soft focus, but I''m feelin'' like this might be just a touch too far, not much, but a little.', '2005-12-06 02:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926216, 262832, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo. Nice tones, great detail. I like the comp, with the vertical hill. These old barns and stuff just never lose their appeal to me no matter how many different times I see them. Each one just has their own character and a story to wonder about. Good job.</td>', 'Very nice photo. Nice tones, great detail. I like the comp, with the vertical hill. These old barns and stuff just never lose their appeal to me no matter how many different times I see them. Each one just has their own character and a story to wonder about. Good job.', '2005-12-06 02:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926229, 264167, 19831, '<td valign="top">wowsers! Incredible capture! Great job on speed. I really like how the wings have some slight motion blur and his head and body are frozen and sharp. I''m interested in knowing how you shot this. Did you use a tripod and timer? Hand held? Is that your hand AND you took the shot? or an assistants hand? My guess would be a helpers hand while you took the shot. Anyways, nice job, great shot!</td>', 'wowsers! Incredible capture! Great job on speed. I really like how the wings have some slight motion blur and his head and body are frozen and sharp. I''m interested in knowing how you shot this. Did you use a tripod and timer? Hand held? Is that your hand AND you took the shot? or an assistants hand? My guess would be a helpers hand while you took the shot. Anyways, nice job, great shot!', '2005-12-06 02:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926234, 264109, 19831, '<td valign="top">hmm, don''t know why a validation request would be made on this one??? A really nice silhouette shot. Very nice. Very emotive too and nice rich tones. Compositionally solid. Good job :-)</td>', 'hmm, don''t know why a validation request would be made on this one??? A really nice silhouette shot. Very nice. Very emotive too and nice rich tones. Compositionally solid. Good job :-)', '2005-12-06 02:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
