(1926400, 260918, 10390, '<td valign="top">Interesting clouds, I think it has been edited in PS or other editing program, not that I''m against PS editing, far from that, but this is overdone for my taste. the left side of it is more interesting than the right side, although the photo lacks a bit of interest in whole.</td>', 'Interesting clouds, I think it has been edited in PS or other editing program, not that I''m against PS editing, far from that, but this is overdone for my taste. the left side of it is more interesting than the right side, although the photo lacks a bit of interest in whole.', '2005-12-06 03:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926412, 253018, 10390, '<td valign="top">It''s funny how one simple thing can change one photo, the dark hair over the girl''s upper part of the nose between the eyes makes the girl look a bit angry, I think if you''d clone that hair out from the photo it will improve, it distracts too much. Otherwise a nice shot of a sweet model.</td>', 'It''s funny how one simple thing can change one photo, the dark hair over the girl''s upper part of the nose between the eyes makes the girl look a bit angry, I think if you''d clone that hair out from the photo it will improve, it distracts too much. Otherwise a nice shot of a sweet model.', '2005-12-06 04:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926424, 263982, 10390, '<td valign="top">hahaha, this is funny. Otherwise good aperture and ok framing, it would be better to have a little more grass in the forground, at least all of the shoes inside the fram. Good capture.</td>', 'hahaha, this is funny. Otherwise good aperture and ok framing, it would be better to have a little more grass in the forground, at least all of the shoes inside the fram. Good capture.', '2005-12-06 04:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926427, 262186, 10390, '<td valign="top">very good photo, great framing, light and colors.</td>', 'very good photo, great framing, light and colors.', '2005-12-06 04:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926431, 260691, 10390, '<td valign="top">Good choose of editing. Cropping off a litlle bit from the top so all the bright spots through the trees would be out will improve the photo, making it more massive.</td>', 'Good choose of editing. Cropping off a litlle bit from the top so all the bright spots through the trees would be out will improve the photo, making it more massive.', '2005-12-06 04:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
