(1926488, 264171, 21604, '<td valign="top">I really like parts of this shot. The composition &amp; subject matter are both really good, but the image quality is not great, I can''t tell whether this is over processing of bad jpeg compression. The eyes look over sharpened and the edge of the nose is very soft and looks heavly cloned.  This would be a 10 for me if it were not for those things.  As is it a 6.</td>', 'I really like parts of this shot. The composition & subject matter are both really good, but the image quality is not great, I can''t tell whether this is over processing of bad jpeg compression. The eyes look over sharpened and the edge of the nose is very soft and looks heavly cloned.  This would be a 10 for me if it were not for those things.  As is it a 6.', '2005-12-06 05:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926491, 263787, 39221, '<td valign="top">you shoulda snapped the branches off to the right (or just moved forward a bit more, and you woulda had an amazing seascape - its ruined by the foilage :(</td>', 'you shoulda snapped the branches off to the right (or just moved forward a bit more, and you woulda had an amazing seascape - its ruined by the foilage :(', '2005-12-06 05:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
