(1926560, 261694, 42792, '<td valign="top">Very striking and the interplay of harsh shadows make for some interesting design here.  Wished it was more symmetrically balanced between the left and right with the left being less busy but I don''t know how much room you had to adjust the composition.  7.</td>', 'Very striking and the interplay of harsh shadows make for some interesting design here.  Wished it was more symmetrically balanced between the left and right with the left being less busy but I don''t know how much room you had to adjust the composition.  7.', '2005-12-06 06:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926565, 263700, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Really like this shot.  Good character capture.  Criticism; the sharpness in the nose is good, but ''if only'' it either carried through a little ''deeper'', or else were perhaps (the nose) more prominent/closer.  The seemingly ''high key'' type of effect works here, especially given the white fur on the mouth/chin and chest, so even though it seems a little ''blown'' around the edges, this still ''works'', in my opinion.  Memorable shot.  Up to 8 from 7.</td>', '8 - Really like this shot.  Good character capture.  Criticism; the sharpness in the nose is good, but ''if only'' it either carried through a little ''deeper'', or else were perhaps (the nose) more prominent/closer.  The seemingly ''high key'' type of effect works here, especially given the white fur on the mouth/chin and chest, so even though it seems a little ''blown'' around the edges, this still ''works'', in my opinion.  Memorable shot.  Up to 8 from 7.', '2005-12-06 06:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926569, 263137, 47325, '<td valign="top">nice contrast of the eyes, and nice lighting</td>', 'nice contrast of the eyes, and nice lighting', '2005-12-06 06:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926573, 261955, 47325, '<td valign="top">beautiful picture: the (very subtile) brownyish black and composition, and the neatness</td>', 'beautiful picture: the (very subtile) brownyish black and composition, and the neatness', '2005-12-06 06:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926577, 263392, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Oh no, I commented in detail days ago but it didn''t save.  Ok, really like this and a good capture with a wide angle/fish eye (?) lens of a seemingly beautiful scene, or it just may be what you have done with it or how you captured it that makes it so good.  Criticism; incorporating more of the fore grass (detail/texture and color) would likely have complemented the ''top'', an even sharper perspective (ground up), more detail in the ice(?) and perhaps a touch up on the blue in it (difficult with contrast issues) and a slight softening of the sky/sun (although I do like the unusual effect here, may have made this even better in my opinion.  It is the almost contrasting ''top/bottom'' that appeals most for me in this shot.</td>', '8 - Oh no, I commented in detail days ago but it didn''t save.  Ok, really like this and a good capture with a wide angle/fish eye (?) lens of a seemingly beautiful scene, or it just may be what you have done with it or how you captured it that makes it so good.  Criticism; incorporating more of the fore grass (detail/texture and color) would likely have complemented the ''top'', an even sharper perspective (ground up), more detail in the ice(?) and perhaps a touch up on the blue in it (difficult with contrast issues) and a slight softening of the sky/sun (although I do like the unusual effect here, may have made this even better in my opinion.  It is the almost contrasting ''top/bottom'' that appeals most for me in this shot.', '2005-12-06 06:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
