(1926654, 261572, 19831, '<td valign="top">Great photo! Nice leading lines, good composition. I really like the tonality. Cute, clever concept. Nice use of dof. I like this shot a lot. Great job!</td>', 'Great photo! Nice leading lines, good composition. I really like the tonality. Cute, clever concept. Nice use of dof. I like this shot a lot. Great job!', '2005-12-06 07:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926660, 260833, 38032, '<td valign="top">I think it''s strange that people always title their photos with the only text already available on the screen - I''ve done the same -- it works here because it draws the person in to the innocence of the humanity in this subject - just an observation! I also like the boat in the distance - I''m guessingg people will see that and think ---ooooh ... I bet no one saw that :) ... 7</td>', 'I think it''s strange that people always title their photos with the only text already available on the screen - I''ve done the same -- it works here because it draws the person in to the innocence of the humanity in this subject - just an observation! I also like the boat in the distance - I''m guessingg people will see that and think ---ooooh ... I bet no one saw that :) ... 7', '2005-12-06 07:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926666, 264021, 19831, '<td valign="top">This is a REALLY cool pic! I like the green cast. Nice way to capture the repetitive symmetry. Great lines obviously. What I really like, and I don''t know if everyone will notice, but the guy standing on the lower right thirds intersection. What is he doing? And he''s like the only person captured in the image! Really cool. Great job!</td>', 'This is a REALLY cool pic! I like the green cast. Nice way to capture the repetitive symmetry. Great lines obviously. What I really like, and I don''t know if everyone will notice, but the guy standing on the lower right thirds intersection. What is he doing? And he''s like the only person captured in the image! Really cool. Great job!', '2005-12-06 07:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
