(1926928, 263889, 41521, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, love the slight glisten on the petals and the clarity of the pistil/stamen.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, love the slight glisten on the petals and the clarity of the pistil/stamen.', '2005-12-06 10:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926930, 261955, 24642, '<td valign="top">A very good emotional portrait.  The composition works very well with the leading lines pointing to the main subject.  Great lighting and post processing.</td>', 'A very good emotional portrait.  The composition works very well with the leading lines pointing to the main subject.  Great lighting and post processing.', '2005-12-06 10:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926931, 264161, 10634, '<td valign="top">Composition is ok. Overall I think it is a little dark. The shadow on her are is distracting. IMO focus should be on the flower closest to the bottom of the frame and draw you in to the photo.</td>', 'Composition is ok. Overall I think it is a little dark. The shadow on her are is distracting. IMO focus should be on the flower closest to the bottom of the frame and draw you in to the photo.', '2005-12-06 10:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926935, 262855, 10634, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and color. Focus is good. It''s a nice shot overall, but compared to some of the other entries it just doesn''t have the impact they do. An above average shot though and a 7 from me.</td>', 'Nice composition and color. Focus is good. It''s a nice shot overall, but compared to some of the other entries it just doesn''t have the impact they do. An above average shot though and a 7 from me.', '2005-12-06 10:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926936, 263012, 10634, '<td valign="top">Same to you. I love the colors here. The snow and soft focus around the edges really make the leaves and berry pop. Beautiful shot. Good Luck</td>', 'Same to you. I love the colors here. The snow and soft focus around the edges really make the leaves and berry pop. Beautiful shot. Good Luck', '2005-12-06 10:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926941, 259758, 10634, '<td valign="top">Vultures are funky looking birds, aren''t they? Focus and composition are excellent. Not sure if you were going for the dark look because of how vultures are looked upon or not, but I think it adds to the appeal of the shot. Like the border, too.</td>', 'Vultures are funky looking birds, aren''t they? Focus and composition are excellent. Not sure if you were going for the dark look because of how vultures are looked upon or not, but I think it adds to the appeal of the shot. Like the border, too.', '2005-12-06 10:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926944, 262461, 10634, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but not the end result. Perhaps if the flowers had been turned towards the camera so you could see their centers?? They just have a strange look here. They look more like a painting then a photo. It''s not a bad thing, but still...</td>', 'I like the idea, but not the end result. Perhaps if the flowers had been turned towards the camera so you could see their centers?? They just have a strange look here. They look more like a painting then a photo. It''s not a bad thing, but still...', '2005-12-06 10:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926946, 263869, 48954, '<td valign="top">could have been better centered by showing more of the old ladies legs</td>', 'could have been better centered by showing more of the old ladies legs', '2005-12-06 10:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926947, 262275, 10634, '<td valign="top">This is one of those shots that I like, but would like to have seen bigger.</td>', 'This is one of those shots that I like, but would like to have seen bigger.', '2005-12-06 10:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
