(1927006, 260267, 10634, '<td valign="top">If you''re going to title it natural, lose the clothes completely. It feels anything but natural to have it look like she is holding open her shirt. Otherwise, the composition and lighting are good.</td>', 'If you''re going to title it natural, lose the clothes completely. It feels anything but natural to have it look like she is holding open her shirt. Otherwise, the composition and lighting are good.', '2005-12-06 10:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
