(1927014, 259826, 10634, '<td valign="top">The light really doesn''t do anything for this shot IMO. If it were more behind the dog''s face and giving him/her a halo but the face was in focus I think that would have the effect you were hoping for.</td>', 'The light really doesn''t do anything for this shot IMO. If it were more behind the dog''s face and giving him/her a halo but the face was in focus I think that would have the effect you were hoping for.', '2005-12-06 10:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
