(1928777, 260116, 10402, '<td valign="top">The two complement each other nicely. Add a little USM, and this would make a nice calendar photo for cat lovers. (It isn''t very compelling for those who don''t love cats, but then, it doesn''t have to be!)</td>', 'The two complement each other nicely. Add a little USM, and this would make a nice calendar photo for cat lovers. (It isn''t very compelling for those who don''t love cats, but then, it doesn''t have to be!)', '2005-12-06 20:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
