(1928876, 262275, 28141, '<td valign="top">I''m betting this is pretty cool full size, assuming you have the necissary resolution, but with only 640 pixels to work with I think it looses a lot of it''s impact.  For a shot like this (that''s already pushing the limits the pixel allowance), I wouldn''t have wasted space on a border.  It''s actually rather distracting since it takes up so much of the frame.</td>', 'I''m betting this is pretty cool full size, assuming you have the necissary resolution, but with only 640 pixels to work with I think it looses a lot of it''s impact.  For a shot like this (that''s already pushing the limits the pixel allowance), I wouldn''t have wasted space on a border.  It''s actually rather distracting since it takes up so much of the frame.', '2005-12-06 20:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
