(1930096, 264058, 8891, '<td valign="top">This is quite a stiking image. Excellent perspective and great find with the RGB Primary colors of the doors. I think it could be a bit brighter? The colors are rich enough but they just don''t ....and I''m sorry to use this term but I''m tired and cannot thinkg of anything else at the moment....pop.</td>', 'This is quite a stiking image. Excellent perspective and great find with the RGB Primary colors of the doors. I think it could be a bit brighter? The colors are rich enough but they just don''t ....and I''m sorry to use this term but I''m tired and cannot thinkg of anything else at the moment....pop.', '2005-12-07 01:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930121, 261484, 8891, '<td valign="top">It has always amazed me that people who are particuarly photogenic can do just about anything to themselves and still look good in an image. This is a great example of that. He''s a great smile and looks quite friendly. Wouldn''t mind seeing him without all the hubris just for a comparison.  Nice job.</td>', 'It has always amazed me that people who are particuarly photogenic can do just about anything to themselves and still look good in an image. This is a great example of that. He''s a great smile and looks quite friendly. Wouldn''t mind seeing him without all the hubris just for a comparison.  Nice job.', '2005-12-07 02:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930140, 263760, 8891, '<td valign="top">you might consider not posting in a forum something that may go into a challenge. It''s like I had a preview of yours and not others. That said....hmmmm....well the composition is interesting but the grunge thing I think you said your were going for doesn''t work for me in this. Any portrait I think should have good details of the eyes. This comes off more abstract because of the lack of the definition in the eyes. But...it is different.</td>', 'you might consider not posting in a forum something that may go into a challenge. It''s like I had a preview of yours and not others. That said....hmmmm....well the composition is interesting but the grunge thing I think you said your were going for doesn''t work for me in this. Any portrait I think should have good details of the eyes. This comes off more abstract because of the lack of the definition in the eyes. But...it is different.', '2005-12-07 02:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930232, 263892, 29269, '<td valign="top">I like it how you captured the warm colors of the leaves in the foreground - they are in stark contrast with cold/frozen background. The green leaf hanging from the top - you could have done without it though, and the trunk of the tree seems slightly oversharpened.<br/>Still, one of the top 20  from my perspective.</td>', 'I like it how you captured the warm colors of the leaves in the foreground - they are in stark contrast with cold/frozen background. The green leaf hanging from the top - you could have done without it though, and the trunk of the tree seems slightly oversharpened.Still, one of the top 20  from my perspective.', '2005-12-07 02:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930242, 256702, 19831, '<td valign="top">Powerful, bold image. I really like the tonality here. Looks to be quite a story in those hands. Solid clean composition. Awesome concept, executed very well. Great job!</td>', 'Powerful, bold image. I really like the tonality here. Looks to be quite a story in those hands. Solid clean composition. Awesome concept, executed very well. Great job!', '2005-12-07 02:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930243, 263894, 29269, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and the reflections in the water. However, the framing (natural one) and the stuff hanging from the top is distracting and in general subtracts from the image rather than enhances it. Still a top-30 image in my opinion.</td>', 'Nice colors and the reflections in the water. However, the framing (natural one) and the stuff hanging from the top is distracting and in general subtracts from the image rather than enhances it. Still a top-30 image in my opinion.', '2005-12-07 02:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
