(1930386, 256160, 37893, '<td valign="top">Beautiful landscape. this loks like a bear_music image. if not, consider it a compliment my friend :) 10</td>', 'Beautiful landscape. this loks like a bear_music image. if not, consider it a compliment my friend :) 10', '2005-12-07 03:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930403, 263392, 37893, '<td valign="top">Stunning display of nature. 10</td>', 'Stunning display of nature. 10', '2005-12-07 03:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930404, 260078, 37893, '<td valign="top">Stunning light and shadows! 10</td>', 'Stunning light and shadows! 10', '2005-12-07 03:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930416, 261955, 37893, '<td valign="top">hmmmm  the girl looks familiar. Beautiful study here and the toning is great. Sir_Bazz? 9</td>', 'hmmmm  the girl looks familiar. Beautiful study here and the toning is great. Sir_Bazz? 9', '2005-12-07 04:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930470, 259717, 23430, '<td valign="top">Nice colours. Nice sky.</td>', 'Nice colours. Nice sky.', '2005-12-07 04:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930499, 258685, 16046, '<td valign="top">Very nice, well done.</td>', 'Very nice, well done.', '2005-12-07 04:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930503, 264097, 16046, '<td valign="top">Interesting study, clever and emotive, cool lighting, bumping up</td>', 'Interesting study, clever and emotive, cool lighting, bumping up', '2005-12-07 04:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930508, 261371, 16046, '<td valign="top">Must be Canon beach, nice dancing sky.</td>', 'Must be Canon beach, nice dancing sky.', '2005-12-07 04:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930513, 261364, 16046, '<td valign="top">Most clever entry for sure, super job, well done, bumping up.</td>', 'Most clever entry for sure, super job, well done, bumping up.', '2005-12-07 04:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930521, 262725, 16046, '<td valign="top">Bumping up, deserved a second look, cute kid, looks like my old USMC hat with the cracked polish. Those eyes are priceless, good luck.</td>', 'Bumping up, deserved a second look, cute kid, looks like my old USMC hat with the cracked polish. Those eyes are priceless, good luck.', '2005-12-07 04:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930524, 254361, 16046, '<td valign="top">One of the better Eagle entries, well done, nice BG choice, bumping up</td>', 'One of the better Eagle entries, well done, nice BG choice, bumping up', '2005-12-07 04:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930529, 260078, 16046, '<td valign="top">I never get tired of these over photographed forms, and you did a great job with the composition and exposure, Super tones and color. Bumping up.</td>', 'I never get tired of these over photographed forms, and you did a great job with the composition and exposure, Super tones and color. Bumping up.', '2005-12-07 04:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930541, 262450, 30364, '<td valign="top">Somehow, the fact that this is at the Metropolitan Museum of Art lends this image a bittersweet complexity that would not be so poignant if it was shot instead at some undistinguished pile of bricks.  What it would still be, however, is a very good and interesting candid photograph.  9.</td>', 'Somehow, the fact that this is at the Metropolitan Museum of Art lends this image a bittersweet complexity that would not be so poignant if it was shot instead at some undistinguished pile of bricks.  What it would still be, however, is a very good and interesting candid photograph.  9.', '2005-12-07 05:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930553, 263259, 30364, '<td valign="top">Terrific composition of light, texture &amp; colour.  It''s simple at first glance, but actually has a charm and harmony that the thoughful viewer cannot dismiss easily; it really rewards a few moments'' study, which I think is a sure sign of a very fine photograph.  9.</td>', 'Terrific composition of light, texture & colour.  It''s simple at first glance, but actually has a charm and harmony that the thoughful viewer cannot dismiss easily; it really rewards a few moments'' study, which I think is a sure sign of a very fine photograph.  9.', '2005-12-07 05:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930584, 261684, 29474, '<td valign="top">I think I understand what you are trying to do here. But it doesn''t work for me. It seems like the camera was moved during the exposure. For this to really give the impression of movement I would expect that the static things (walls, floors, picture frames, etc.) to be sharp and in focus.</td>', 'I think I understand what you are trying to do here. But it doesn''t work for me. It seems like the camera was moved during the exposure. For this to really give the impression of movement I would expect that the static things (walls, floors, picture frames, etc.) to be sharp and in focus.', '2005-12-07 05:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930606, 264076, 30364, '<td valign="top">The great quality of this for me is its very cleverly disguised complexity.  First glance shows a very fine, contemporary-looking glamour shot of an appealing model.  Second examination, however, reveals a sly quality of subtle parody about the main subject.  Her pose, her facial expression, and even her odd wristband all suggest a whiff of satire.  Then there''s the sharp and confident composition, which once again turns out to be only the surface layer ... beneath it lie some wicked little details, such as the reflected legs and the puzzlingly impossible ''reflected'' multiple images of the model.    The lighting and the processing are terrific, too ... just bold enough to be avant-garde, but not so over-the-top as to become surreal.  I think this is the most artistically ambitious and the most intellectually challenging image in the challenge, and I therefore like it the best.  10.</td>', 'The great quality of this for me is its very cleverly disguised complexity.  First glance shows a very fine, contemporary-looking glamour shot of an appealing model.  Second examination, however, reveals a sly quality of subtle parody about the main subject.  Her pose, her facial expression, and even her odd wristband all suggest a whiff of satire.  Then there''s the sharp and confident composition, which once again turns out to be only the surface layer ... beneath it lie some wicked little details, such as the reflected legs and the puzzlingly impossible ''reflected'' multiple images of the model.    The lighting and the processing are terrific, too ... just bold enough to be avant-garde, but not so over-the-top as to become surreal.  I think this is the most artistically ambitious and the most intellectually challenging image in the challenge, and I therefore like it the best.  10.', '2005-12-07 05:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930610, 260010, 30364, '<td valign="top">I love the somehow sci-fi feel of this shot, and also the sparse composition.  One of the rare occasions in ''street photography'' when the addition of a human figure would actually detract from the impact of the photograph. 8.</td>', 'I love the somehow sci-fi feel of this shot, and also the sparse composition.  One of the rare occasions in ''street photography'' when the addition of a human figure would actually detract from the impact of the photograph. 8.', '2005-12-07 05:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930619, 264060, 30364, '<td valign="top">A memorable, elegant photograph - brilliant composition and processing.  And all of the comparitively spectacular major structural elements nevertheless play only a supporting role to the tiny, distant human figure!  This is a confident and instructive work.  10.</td>', 'A memorable, elegant photograph - brilliant composition and processing.  And all of the comparitively spectacular major structural elements nevertheless play only a supporting role to the tiny, distant human figure!  This is a confident and instructive work.  10.', '2005-12-07 05:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930626, 264131, 30364, '<td valign="top">A very appealing photograph; interesting in spite of its apparent simplicity.  8.</td>', 'A very appealing photograph; interesting in spite of its apparent simplicity.  8.', '2005-12-07 05:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930630, 264172, 23458, '<td valign="top">Cool Bird, great exposure, not thrilled about the composition but you''ve isolated him (or possibly her) from the background well. 7</td>', 'Cool Bird, great exposure, not thrilled about the composition but you''ve isolated him (or possibly her) from the background well. 7', '2005-12-07 05:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930636, 259826, 29474, '<td valign="top">I think that this needs a bit of post-processing. It looks very washed-out. I would also prefer to see a bit more space in front of the nose.</td>', 'I think that this needs a bit of post-processing. It looks very washed-out. I would also prefer to see a bit more space in front of the nose.', '2005-12-07 06:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930639, 259353, 23458, '<td valign="top">Well this is a pretty ordinary photo - the lighting is harsh, the composition is messy, but I have to say - that is one incredibly smoking body. 6</td>', 'Well this is a pretty ordinary photo - the lighting is harsh, the composition is messy, but I have to say - that is one incredibly smoking body. 6', '2005-12-07 06:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930643, 261364, 23458, '<td valign="top">hehehe... nice idea. Very nice composition.</td>', 'hehehe... nice idea. Very nice composition.', '2005-12-07 06:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930646, 261817, 29474, '<td valign="top">The lack of detail in the foreground makes this a bland picture. Maybe a bit of fill flash could have helped?</td>', 'The lack of detail in the foreground makes this a bland picture. Maybe a bit of fill flash could have helped?', '2005-12-07 06:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930649, 260489, 30364, '<td valign="top">Interesting how the most prosaic of subjects and the simplest of set-ups can result in a memorable and powerful image if (but only if) the original idea is a worthy one, clearly expressed and sympathetically executed.  This is one of those!  9.</td>', 'Interesting how the most prosaic of subjects and the simplest of set-ups can result in a memorable and powerful image if (but only if) the original idea is a worthy one, clearly expressed and sympathetically executed.  This is one of those!  9.', '2005-12-07 06:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930662, 256912, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful, artistic image.  This is almost certainly not what you were intending, but I can''t help seeing it as a Pink Floyd album cover.  It has the same stark, simple yet deeply layered quality as the best of their music.  9.</td>', 'This is a beautiful, artistic image.  This is almost certainly not what you were intending, but I can''t help seeing it as a Pink Floyd album cover.  It has the same stark, simple yet deeply layered quality as the best of their music.  9.', '2005-12-07 06:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930668, 261983, 29474, '<td valign="top">So close to being a brilliant picture. Needs a bit of sharpness, a little less light and more space above the butterfly.</td>', 'So close to being a brilliant picture. Needs a bit of sharpness, a little less light and more space above the butterfly.', '2005-12-07 06:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930673, 263872, 30364, '<td valign="top">A very fine, evocative image.  The composition is really very, very good.  The thing I like best about this work is that you obviously knew what you had here, and so you excluded everything that wasn''t it!  The photograph is all the more powerful for that decision.  9.</td>', 'A very fine, evocative image.  The composition is really very, very good.  The thing I like best about this work is that you obviously knew what you had here, and so you excluded everything that wasn''t it!  The photograph is all the more powerful for that decision.  9.', '2005-12-07 06:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930677, 257636, 29474, '<td valign="top">Wonderful light. Interesting colours.</td>', 'Wonderful light. Interesting colours.', '2005-12-07 06:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930688, 262098, 38508, '<td valign="top">Great image!! Especially why it is in this challenge ;o)</td>', 'Great image!! Especially why it is in this challenge ;o)', '2005-12-07 06:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930709, 264173, 16241, '<td valign="top">awesome, i''m sure this will ribbon</td>', 'awesome, i''m sure this will ribbon', '2005-12-07 06:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930784, 264036, 15919, '<td valign="top">Litle grayish imo.  Lacks more colorsaturation and maybe contrast.  Good subject though and well performed.</td>', 'Litle grayish imo.  Lacks more colorsaturation and maybe contrast.  Good subject though and well performed.', '2005-12-07 07:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930786, 256912, 15919, '<td valign="top">Like the lightning, composition and subjject.  Post processing also seem pretty good.</td>', 'Like the lightning, composition and subjject.  Post processing also seem pretty good.', '2005-12-07 07:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930788, 262921, 15919, '<td valign="top">Lacks contrast and colorsaturation imo.  Also some clearer point of interest.</td>', 'Lacks contrast and colorsaturation imo.  Also some clearer point of interest.', '2005-12-07 07:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930790, 262911, 15919, '<td valign="top">Well lit and technically well done.</td>', 'Well lit and technically well done.', '2005-12-07 07:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930794, 260010, 15919, '<td valign="top">Very stockish.  Nice image.</td>', 'Very stockish.  Nice image.', '2005-12-07 07:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930799, 261113, 15919, '<td valign="top">Far to much blurring imo.</td>', 'Far to much blurring imo.', '2005-12-07 07:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930874, 260331, 38032, '<td valign="top">i like the originality here.  8</td>', 'i like the originality here.  8', '2005-12-07 07:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930880, 253340, 38032, '<td valign="top">one of the oddest images i''ve seen - 9</td>', 'one of the oddest images i''ve seen - 9', '2005-12-07 07:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930882, 264165, 38032, '<td valign="top">very emotive  and thoughtful 7</td>', 'very emotive  and thoughtful 7', '2005-12-07 07:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930899, 261556, 30625, '<td valign="top">Just beautifully shot. Her eyes are just so pleasing to look at. Well done.</td>', 'Just beautifully shot. Her eyes are just so pleasing to look at. Well done.', '2005-12-07 07:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
