(1931887, 263833, 12253, '<td valign="top">Ok, that''s pretty amazing.  So far, my pick for a ribbon.  One small nit, the sky, at the upper left top, "looks" dodged and burned.  I don''t mind dodge and burn, but you shouldn''t be able to tell.  I tried looking hard to see if it''s somehow natural, but I can''t find the matchup in the reflection.  One thing I would have considered if I were lucky enough for this capture to be mine: the foremost center rock to me is unharmonious with the other rocks.  It''s lighter, and smoother, and more of an attention stealer.  I think a crop at the bottom to eliminate it, while losing a bit of lovely foreground, would have been better.</td>', 'Ok, that''s pretty amazing.  So far, my pick for a ribbon.  One small nit, the sky, at the upper left top, "looks" dodged and burned.  I don''t mind dodge and burn, but you shouldn''t be able to tell.  I tried looking hard to see if it''s somehow natural, but I can''t find the matchup in the reflection.  One thing I would have considered if I were lucky enough for this capture to be mine: the foremost center rock to me is unharmonious with the other rocks.  It''s lighter, and smoother, and more of an attention stealer.  I think a crop at the bottom to eliminate it, while losing a bit of lovely foreground, would have been better.', '2005-12-07 13:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
