(1932869, 263666, 10390, '<td valign="top">Good cat photo, the cat is well positioned inside the frame.</td>', 'Good cat photo, the cat is well positioned inside the frame.', '2005-12-07 17:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1932871, 263962, 27562, '<td valign="top">Awesome tonality and dramatic ligting.  My pick for the best portrait of free study 9.  Great work.</td>', 'Awesome tonality and dramatic ligting.  My pick for the best portrait of free study 9.  Great work.', '2005-12-07 17:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1932872, 258462, 27562, '<td valign="top">You have done an excellent job of photographing an attractive model with engaging features such as catativating eyes and a beautiful smile. The lighting is excellent and the green blouse is very complimentary to her and to the tone of the image.   Luckily I have a rotating LCD monitor and I must say that if the image is rotated 90 degrees counter-clockwise, with her hands in the upper-right hand corner of the imgage, it becomes a much better image.  I realize that might not be what was intended when you took the photo, but sometimes it works out that way.  Really nice work, 7.</td>', 'You have done an excellent job of photographing an attractive model with engaging features such as catativating eyes and a beautiful smile. The lighting is excellent and the green blouse is very complimentary to her and to the tone of the image.   Luckily I have a rotating LCD monitor and I must say that if the image is rotated 90 degrees counter-clockwise, with her hands in the upper-right hand corner of the imgage, it becomes a much better image.  I realize that might not be what was intended when you took the photo, but sometimes it works out that way.  Really nice work, 7.', '2005-12-07 17:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1932876, 264165, 10390, '<td valign="top">Nice use of bokeh, maybe a little bit too yellow, but good in whole.</td>', 'Nice use of bokeh, maybe a little bit too yellow, but good in whole.', '2005-12-07 17:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1932917, 263940, 13077, '<td valign="top">I really like how the clouds look, and the contrast between them and the house. Nice shot, 8</td>', 'I really like how the clouds look, and the contrast between them and the house. Nice shot, 8', '2005-12-07 17:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1932924, 264060, 13077, '<td valign="top">I really like the angles of the fence and the road, and the haze around the lights looks nice.</td>', 'I really like the angles of the fence and the road, and the haze around the lights looks nice.', '2005-12-07 17:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1932932, 256912, 27562, '<td valign="top">Your wonderful image is my pick for the best of the challenge.  Beautifully saturated colors and classic composition.  I really like your choice of the square format, which is a seldom used but highly effective communication tool for the presentation of landscapes.  I''m pleased at your choice of a simple elegant border that allows us to get the most from your image, instead of adding a large gaudy border.  My only negative would be the dust spot? near the top of the frame over the plant, but believe me I got over it quickly.  Great work.</td>', 'Your wonderful image is my pick for the best of the challenge.  Beautifully saturated colors and classic composition.  I really like your choice of the square format, which is a seldom used but highly effective communication tool for the presentation of landscapes.  I''m pleased at your choice of a simple elegant border that allows us to get the most from your image, instead of adding a large gaudy border.  My only negative would be the dust spot? near the top of the frame over the plant, but believe me I got over it quickly.  Great work.', '2005-12-07 17:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1932960, 264004, 13077, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition and the colors in the sky, nice photo</td>', 'I really like the composition and the colors in the sky, nice photo', '2005-12-07 17:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1932967, 263677, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like how the lighting looks, kind of unusual but cool. Might have been nicer if it was taken with a car in the closest lane rather than the opposite one.</td>', 'I like how the lighting looks, kind of unusual but cool. Might have been nicer if it was taken with a car in the closest lane rather than the opposite one.', '2005-12-07 17:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1932968, 257752, 10390, '<td valign="top">Good editing.</td>', 'Good editing.', '2005-12-07 17:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1932972, 263599, 13077, '<td valign="top">Wow, I really like the people in the background for scale. Nice timing, and colors - 8</td>', 'Wow, I really like the people in the background for scale. Nice timing, and colors - 8', '2005-12-07 17:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1932977, 264027, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but it''s a little grainy and also seems to be a little bit blurry.</td>', 'Nice photo, but it''s a little grainy and also seems to be a little bit blurry.', '2005-12-07 17:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1932992, 254656, 10390, '<td valign="top">If you crop the bottom three waves off, about one third from the bottom off and make a panorama like that, then you''ll have a much better photo. No matter though the horizon line will be in the middle. Like that I would have rated it 1-2 higher, the upper part is good. There is too much of uninteresting foreground like it is.</td>', 'If you crop the bottom three waves off, about one third from the bottom off and make a panorama like that, then you''ll have a much better photo. No matter though the horizon line will be in the middle. Like that I would have rated it 1-2 higher, the upper part is good. There is too much of uninteresting foreground like it is.', '2005-12-07 17:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1932995, 263986, 10390, '<td valign="top">this editing of the couple doesn''t work for me, the blurred foreground is good though.</td>', 'this editing of the couple doesn''t work for me, the blurred foreground is good though.', '2005-12-07 17:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933018, 264117, 10390, '<td valign="top">this would make a nice background for a wedding card.</td>', 'this would make a nice background for a wedding card.', '2005-12-07 17:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933032, 261617, 10390, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, I like the colors. I hope this photo gets over 90% result..</td>', 'Nice photo, I like the colors. I hope this photo gets over 90% result..', '2005-12-07 17:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
