(1933046, 263833, 13077, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo. I love the colors of the sky and the clouds, and the rocks in the foreground, but especially the textures of the boats and their reflections. I hope this one gets a ribbon - 10</td>', 'Excellent photo. I love the colors of the sky and the clouds, and the rocks in the foreground, but especially the textures of the boats and their reflections. I hope this one gets a ribbon - 10', '2005-12-07 17:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
