(1933094, 261955, 10390, '<td valign="top">Great image, I like it a lot! Very emotive shot.. One of the best in this challenge imo</td>', 'Great image, I like it a lot! Very emotive shot.. One of the best in this challenge imo', '2005-12-07 18:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933109, 264191, 15266, '<td valign="top">*Edited*    Cool in-your-face shot.</td>', '*Edited*    Cool in-your-face shot.', '2005-12-07 18:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933118, 264167, 39057, '<td valign="top">Poop...here''s one I have to rate higher than mine!</td>', 'Poop...here''s one I have to rate higher than mine!', '2005-12-07 18:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933124, 264054, 1827, '<td valign="top">I find the parts that are sharpened too sharp, and the parts that are softened too soft, but your model has beautiful eyes, and I like the composition.</td>', 'I find the parts that are sharpened too sharp, and the parts that are softened too soft, but your model has beautiful eyes, and I like the composition.', '2005-12-07 18:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933125, 256160, 39057, '<td valign="top">2 different pools of water with 2 different reflections. The sun reflecting off the first pool is very good. The wide angle of the shot of the clouds almost draws me into the scene. Very good for a plain ole "sunset" ! 8</td>', '2 different pools of water with 2 different reflections. The sun reflecting off the first pool is very good. The wide angle of the shot of the clouds almost draws me into the scene. Very good for a plain ole "sunset" ! 8', '2005-12-07 18:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933130, 261963, 6667, '<td valign="top">This has got to be in the top five. Beautiful.  BOL 9</td>', 'This has got to be in the top five. Beautiful.  BOL 9', '2005-12-07 18:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933132, 264166, 1827, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition and the lighting, but no portion of the photo seems to be sharply focused. 5 (Would have been a 7 with sharp focus somewhere)</td>', 'I really like the composition and the lighting, but no portion of the photo seems to be sharply focused. 5 (Would have been a 7 with sharp focus somewhere)', '2005-12-07 18:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933139, 264098, 1827, '<td valign="top">Interestingly, before I read your title, my first thought was "it''s very gray and could use a boost in contrast."  I can see where any more contrast on the center horse might have been over the top, but with advanced editing you could have used a mask.  Mostly I see gray.</td>', 'Interestingly, before I read your title, my first thought was "it''s very gray and could use a boost in contrast."  I can see where any more contrast on the center horse might have been over the top, but with advanced editing you could have used a mask.  Mostly I see gray.', '2005-12-07 18:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933145, 254656, 30625, '<td valign="top">Nice Colors. Nice Compostion. Nice Shot.</td>', 'Nice Colors. Nice Compostion. Nice Shot.', '2005-12-07 18:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933150, 262260, 39057, '<td valign="top">Seems like you did some good post processing with this. How you got the sky blacked out so good is unclear to me but the effect is good. It looks as though you may have "color burned" each brick in the wall, if not then your camera is "kick A*s". <br/> <br/>The building does look a little "flat"....almost like a movie "front" but that does not bother me much. Overall very good. Since I did not yet see all the photo''s, I can''t say if this will ribbon. I''d say top 25 for sure...we''ll see!   9</td>', 'Seems like you did some good post processing with this. How you got the sky blacked out so good is unclear to me but the effect is good. It looks as though you may have "color burned" each brick in the wall, if not then your camera is "kick A*s".  The building does look a little "flat"....almost like a movie "front" but that does not bother me much. Overall very good. Since I did not yet see all the photo''s, I can''t say if this will ribbon. I''d say top 25 for sure...we''ll see!   9', '2005-12-07 18:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933152, 263894, 32409, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture, but the horizon is a bit off kilter and the vines hanging from the top look a bit oversharpened.</td>', 'Beautiful picture, but the horizon is a bit off kilter and the vines hanging from the top look a bit oversharpened.', '2005-12-07 18:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933153, 264198, 30625, '<td valign="top">Nice Shot. I think the compostion could have been better. The colors are just stunning. (9)</td>', 'Nice Shot. I think the compostion could have been better. The colors are just stunning. (9)', '2005-12-07 18:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933157, 261908, 1827, '<td valign="top">The BG color goes very well with your skin and lip color.  The cropping is interesting.  Two things nag at me: 1) with the texture of her eye shadow so palpable, I don''t like having her skin so airbrushed.  My eye is just instantly aware that I''m missing the texture of the skin. 2) The expression is very empty and uninvolved.  In any type of portrait, I want to see some type of emotion on the person.</td>', 'The BG color goes very well with your skin and lip color.  The cropping is interesting.  Two things nag at me: 1) with the texture of her eye shadow so palpable, I don''t like having her skin so airbrushed.  My eye is just instantly aware that I''m missing the texture of the skin. 2) The expression is very empty and uninvolved.  In any type of portrait, I want to see some type of emotion on the person.', '2005-12-07 18:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933160, 263076, 1827, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, but the saturation is way to much for me.</td>', 'Interesting shot, but the saturation is way to much for me.', '2005-12-07 18:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933161, 264171, 32409, '<td valign="top">I think that the reflection in her eyes is a little distracting. The picture also has a very soft focus too it.</td>', 'I think that the reflection in her eyes is a little distracting. The picture also has a very soft focus too it.', '2005-12-07 18:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933166, 262405, 32409, '<td valign="top">I love the feel of this picture. It makes you feel cold when you look at it.</td>', 'I love the feel of this picture. It makes you feel cold when you look at it.', '2005-12-07 18:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933167, 263646, 39057, '<td valign="top">Very good shot of the action. The charger is in perfect focus and looks intense. If there is any problem with this shot it would be that without the "ball" showing, there seems to be no subject of the shot. In that case is seems that as a "sports" shot, the only person that would be interested in this shot would be the "charger" in focus. I sort of looks like you shot everything the whole game and picked out the best "in focus" shot. <br/> <br/>I hope that makes sense ! Anyway...technically the shot is worth and 8. I feel if the "bill" had the ball showing, I could rate a 9 or 10.<br/> <br/>Good Luck....</td>', 'Very good shot of the action. The charger is in perfect focus and looks intense. If there is any problem with this shot it would be that without the "ball" showing, there seems to be no subject of the shot. In that case is seems that as a "sports" shot, the only person that would be interested in this shot would be the "charger" in focus. I sort of looks like you shot everything the whole game and picked out the best "in focus" shot.  I hope that makes sense ! Anyway...technically the shot is worth and 8. I feel if the "bill" had the ball showing, I could rate a 9 or 10. Good Luck....', '2005-12-07 18:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933168, 264132, 1827, '<td valign="top">This has got to be Lynnesite.  What a gift you have for capturing these majestic animals.  If I''ve pegged the photographer wrong, take it as a compliment.</td>', 'This has got to be Lynnesite.  What a gift you have for capturing these majestic animals.  If I''ve pegged the photographer wrong, take it as a compliment.', '2005-12-07 18:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933169, 264186, 1827, '<td valign="top">LOVING the bokeh, only wish the leaves in front were somehow more interesting. 6</td>', 'LOVING the bokeh, only wish the leaves in front were somehow more interesting. 6', '2005-12-07 18:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933175, 261484, 1827, '<td valign="top">Interesting fellow.  The use of on-camera flash really washes out the natural shadows from his face though.  Try experimenting with natural lighting instead of using the flash. :)</td>', 'Interesting fellow.  The use of on-camera flash really washes out the natural shadows from his face though.  Try experimenting with natural lighting instead of using the flash. :)', '2005-12-07 18:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933176, 261484, 32409, '<td valign="top">Great portrait. The picture makes me feel like I know this guy. Great job.</td>', 'Great portrait. The picture makes me feel like I know this guy. Great job.', '2005-12-07 18:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933177, 263833, 1827, '<td valign="top">I love the way the reflection of the clouds makes it seem as it the boats are flying.  Has a surrealistic element to it.  Very nicely done.</td>', 'I love the way the reflection of the clouds makes it seem as it the boats are flying.  Has a surrealistic element to it.  Very nicely done.', '2005-12-07 18:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933179, 254266, 32409, '<td valign="top">It''s in focus but the contrast just isn''t there to make this bird truly stand out.</td>', 'It''s in focus but the contrast just isn''t there to make this bird truly stand out.', '2005-12-07 18:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
