(1933210, 257207, 1827, '<td valign="top">A nice enough picture.  The frame detracts in my opinion.  Might have been okay without the outer glow, but all that does is pull me out of the photo.</td>', 'A nice enough picture.  The frame detracts in my opinion.  Might have been okay without the outer glow, but all that does is pull me out of the photo.', '2005-12-07 18:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933212, 264165, 1827, '<td valign="top">Is the DOF here natural?  It seems so sudden that I can''t help wondering if it was added with a gradient gaussian blur in PS.  That said it adds an interesting effect, almost mirage like.</td>', 'Is the DOF here natural?  It seems so sudden that I can''t help wondering if it was added with a gradient gaussian blur in PS.  That said it adds an interesting effect, almost mirage like.', '2005-12-07 18:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933213, 260848, 32409, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love the colors, but I don''t think that it makes up for a lack of focus or the blown out bits around the tree.</td>', 'I absolutely love the colors, but I don''t think that it makes up for a lack of focus or the blown out bits around the tree.', '2005-12-07 18:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
