(1933219, 263551, 1827, '<td valign="top">I''m not very fond of the original, so attempts to recreate are destined not to do well with me as far as votes go.  As to your success in recreating it, well done.</td>', 'I''m not very fond of the original, so attempts to recreate are destined not to do well with me as far as votes go.  As to your success in recreating it, well done.', '2005-12-07 18:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
