(1933236, 261418, 1827, '<td valign="top">Very pretty model.  I like the dramatic lighting.  I wish she had on less eye make up as it distracts me from the rest of the photo, I am just glued to her lower lashes.  The sharpening is too much I think. Makes her arm look jagged and her hair look stringy.  Also, I think an off center crop would work better. 5</td>', 'Very pretty model.  I like the dramatic lighting.  I wish she had on less eye make up as it distracts me from the rest of the photo, I am just glued to her lower lashes.  The sharpening is too much I think. Makes her arm look jagged and her hair look stringy.  Also, I think an off center crop would work better. 5', '2005-12-07 18:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933240, 264191, 1827, '<td valign="top">Creepy.  Made me shiver.</td>', 'Creepy.  Made me shiver.', '2005-12-07 18:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
