(1933292, 263953, 1041, '<td valign="top">Nice scenery.  I like the colors and everything, the only thing I would''ve done differently is crop a bit off the bottom.  The sky is more interesting than the empty field in the foreground that has no hayballs on it.</td>', 'Nice scenery.  I like the colors and everything, the only thing I would''ve done differently is crop a bit off the bottom.  The sky is more interesting than the empty field in the foreground that has no hayballs on it.', '2005-12-07 19:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933298, 264102, 42013, '<td valign="top">Might not be the most compelling subject matter, BUT I love the treatment and the composition so for now(with about 50% down) this is my favorite of the challenge</td>', 'Might not be the most compelling subject matter, BUT I love the treatment and the composition so for now(with about 50% down) this is my favorite of the challenge', '2005-12-07 19:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933300, 256358, 1041, '<td valign="top">The cutest dog.  He looks so at home in the fall leaves.  I like the composition, clarity, colors.  Maybe a little overexposed on the left side (right side of the dog).  As most dog photos, it doesn''t hold my attention too long (as with babies, knowing them makes the photo much more intesting).  Still a good portrait of a pet in natural surroundings.</td>', 'The cutest dog.  He looks so at home in the fall leaves.  I like the composition, clarity, colors.  Maybe a little overexposed on the left side (right side of the dog).  As most dog photos, it doesn''t hold my attention too long (as with babies, knowing them makes the photo much more intesting).  Still a good portrait of a pet in natural surroundings.', '2005-12-07 19:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933304, 263259, 1041, '<td valign="top">REally like the colors and the strong shadows causing repeating patterns.  Only little nitpick I have is the dark shadow to the right of the lantern shadow.  I would''ve tried to clone (although I am not very good at that, and all the lines are going to be difficult).  Regardless, really nice entry for this challenge.</td>', 'REally like the colors and the strong shadows causing repeating patterns.  Only little nitpick I have is the dark shadow to the right of the lantern shadow.  I would''ve tried to clone (although I am not very good at that, and all the lines are going to be difficult).  Regardless, really nice entry for this challenge.', '2005-12-07 19:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933351, 260489, 25787, '<td valign="top">It''s a little dark (mood wise) for my taste, but quite an excellent shot.  I really like all the shades of green.  Good job. 7</td>', 'It''s a little dark (mood wise) for my taste, but quite an excellent shot.  I really like all the shades of green.  Good job. 7', '2005-12-07 19:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933387, 263877, 10263, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. It feels like the horizon tilts a little to the left to me though. I like the muted tones and the reflections. 8</td>', 'I really like this shot. It feels like the horizon tilts a little to the left to me though. I like the muted tones and the reflections. 8', '2005-12-07 19:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933394, 263872, 10263, '<td valign="top">Don''t ya wish ya knew what those thoughts were? Nice shot. 7</td>', 'Don''t ya wish ya knew what those thoughts were? Nice shot. 7', '2005-12-07 19:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933396, 264132, 10263, '<td valign="top">Love the softness and the action caught.</td>', 'Love the softness and the action caught.', '2005-12-07 19:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933398, 261263, 10402, '<td valign="top">The off center composition and high contrast are unconventional, but it works. I didn''t particularly like this photo when I first saw it, but the more I examine it the more I like it.</td>', 'The off center composition and high contrast are unconventional, but it works. I didn''t particularly like this photo when I first saw it, but the more I examine it the more I like it.', '2005-12-07 19:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933400, 264167, 48976, '<td valign="top">A shot worth waiting for</td>', 'A shot worth waiting for', '2005-12-07 19:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933415, 262470, 10263, '<td valign="top">This is strange. I assume it is a rock formation but nothing like anything I''ve seen. Nice colors. Striking photo. Hope you explain it in your submission :)</td>', 'This is strange. I assume it is a rock formation but nothing like anything I''ve seen. Nice colors. Striking photo. Hope you explain it in your submission :)', '2005-12-07 19:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933416, 262810, 8637, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition. Bumped up.</td>', 'Wonderful composition. Bumped up.', '2005-12-07 19:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933420, 263833, 8637, '<td valign="top">Wonderful work...the horizon just disappears.  Lighting is great.  Looked at this one again.  Bumped up.</td>', 'Wonderful work...the horizon just disappears.  Lighting is great.  Looked at this one again.  Bumped up.', '2005-12-07 19:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933421, 262857, 10263, '<td valign="top">Some beautiful bird shots in this challenge. This one is striking. Well done.</td>', 'Some beautiful bird shots in this challenge. This one is striking. Well done.', '2005-12-07 19:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933424, 263806, 8637, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition..wish the lead stork had been a little sharper.  7</td>', 'Beautiful composition..wish the lead stork had been a little sharper.  7', '2005-12-07 19:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933426, 263940, 8637, '<td valign="top">Excellent eye and composition.  Bumped up.</td>', 'Excellent eye and composition.  Bumped up.', '2005-12-07 19:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933429, 260395, 10263, '<td valign="top">A nice capture. I wish there was more detail in the white feathers and the top of his beak seems a bit blown out.  Love the pose. He certainly looks like he''s screaming.</td>', 'A nice capture. I wish there was more detail in the white feathers and the top of his beak seems a bit blown out.  Love the pose. He certainly looks like he''s screaming.', '2005-12-07 19:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933433, 263048, 10263, '<td valign="top">Simple and beautiful. Nice composition.</td>', 'Simple and beautiful. Nice composition.', '2005-12-07 19:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933436, 261913, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great use of negative space.</td>', 'Great use of negative space.', '2005-12-07 19:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933438, 263940, 10263, '<td valign="top">Love the old house and what a great sky.</td>', 'Love the old house and what a great sky.', '2005-12-07 19:47:48.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1933439, 262310, 8637, '<td valign="top">I love people shots and this one is special.  Bumped up.</td>', 'I love people shots and this one is special.  Bumped up.', '2005-12-07 19:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933441, 264129, 28029, '<td valign="top">Well done! Creative, hilarious and intelligently executed.</td>', 'Well done! Creative, hilarious and intelligently executed.', '2005-12-07 19:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933442, 264166, 8637, '<td valign="top">Lots of blur</td>', 'Lots of blur', '2005-12-07 19:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933444, 263833, 10402, '<td valign="top">This has a nice abstract feel. I love it.</td>', 'This has a nice abstract feel. I love it.', '2005-12-07 19:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933449, 263618, 8637, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit cluttered.  Hard to identify the subject of the shot.</td>', 'Seems a bit cluttered.  Hard to identify the subject of the shot.', '2005-12-07 19:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933474, 255521, 10402, '<td valign="top">Ignore everyone who says this is too small. It is just the right size! After all, that owl is really small, and the smallness of the photo emphasizes that. I do wish the focus was better.</td>', 'Ignore everyone who says this is too small. It is just the right size! After all, that owl is really small, and the smallness of the photo emphasizes that. I do wish the focus was better.', '2005-12-07 19:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933522, 263551, 3214, '<td valign="top">I guess this is homage-time, reasonably well done although I would prefer that the white was WHITE, guess you were avoiding blowing out the highlights.</td>', 'I guess this is homage-time, reasonably well done although I would prefer that the white was WHITE, guess you were avoiding blowing out the highlights.', '2005-12-07 20:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933524, 264171, 3214, '<td valign="top">Way too much Neat Image to my taste/oversmoothed.  The pixelation prevents a higher score.</td>', 'Way too much Neat Image to my taste/oversmoothed.  The pixelation prevents a higher score.', '2005-12-07 20:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933529, 256912, 3214, '<td valign="top">this is a lovely composition but seems overprocessed...it could be my imagination after looking at a LOT of overprocessed/grungy shots.</td>', 'this is a lovely composition but seems overprocessed...it could be my imagination after looking at a LOT of overprocessed/grungy shots.', '2005-12-07 20:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933557, 262855, 3214, '<td valign="top">The purple fringing around the bird''s head and back are the only downside to this lovely image.</td>', 'The purple fringing around the bird''s head and back are the only downside to this lovely image.', '2005-12-07 20:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933558, 262390, 37334, '<td valign="top">Really nice...almost looks like a painting.</td>', 'Really nice...almost looks like a painting.', '2005-12-07 20:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933560, 255132, 3214, '<td valign="top">What a hilarious use of shallow depth of field!  And the yellow background completments him nicely.</td>', 'What a hilarious use of shallow depth of field!  And the yellow background completments him nicely.', '2005-12-07 20:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933563, 261447, 25397, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites so far, I love the look of this photo. Best of luck to you</td>', 'One of my favourites so far, I love the look of this photo. Best of luck to you', '2005-12-07 20:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933564, 256912, 37334, '<td valign="top">Really nice</td>', 'Really nice', '2005-12-07 20:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933567, 264115, 3214, '<td valign="top">Interesting textural study!  I like the diagonals.</td>', 'Interesting textural study!  I like the diagonals.', '2005-12-07 20:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933569, 260082, 3214, '<td valign="top">Neat, the partial desat works very well on this great street shot.  All that fur and hair texture, and the grungy tones of the city.  Terrific.</td>', 'Neat, the partial desat works very well on this great street shot.  All that fur and hair texture, and the grungy tones of the city.  Terrific.', '2005-12-07 20:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933570, 260147, 37334, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot;)</td>', 'I like this a lot;)', '2005-12-07 20:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933571, 263889, 3214, '<td valign="top">Lovely, so easy to overdo the saturation on the red ones.</td>', 'Lovely, so easy to overdo the saturation on the red ones.', '2005-12-07 20:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933578, 260388, 25678, '<td valign="top">I thought a Taiga was a boreal forest?<br/> <br/>Anyways, excellent shot with the lone tree.  Good job</td>', 'I thought a Taiga was a boreal forest? Anyways, excellent shot with the lone tree.  Good job', '2005-12-07 20:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933581, 263962, 37334, '<td valign="top">Nice eyes!! Nice portrait.</td>', 'Nice eyes!! Nice portrait.', '2005-12-07 20:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933582, 255132, 25678, '<td valign="top">very nice use of DOF.  Good job!</td>', 'very nice use of DOF.  Good job!', '2005-12-07 20:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933587, 258302, 25678, '<td valign="top">As interesting as this is in black and white, I wish you could see the lights in color...</td>', 'As interesting as this is in black and white, I wish you could see the lights in color...', '2005-12-07 20:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933594, 264065, 25678, '<td valign="top">One of the more interesting landscape/sunsets in this challenge.  Excellent colors and I like the mist (?) on the trees in the front<br/> <br/>Nice!</td>', 'One of the more interesting landscape/sunsets in this challenge.  Excellent colors and I like the mist (?) on the trees in the front Nice!', '2005-12-07 20:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933602, 264129, 37334, '<td valign="top">Funny:)</td>', 'Funny:)', '2005-12-07 20:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933604, 263804, 17507, '<td valign="top">excellent flower study. DOF is excellent; the petals are sharp where they need to be and blurry where they should be. colors are used to good effect. lighting is strongly directional but not harsh.</td>', 'excellent flower study. DOF is excellent; the petals are sharp where they need to be and blurry where they should be. colors are used to good effect. lighting is strongly directional but not harsh.', '2005-12-07 20:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933610, 264164, 17507, '<td valign="top">This is a great twist on the popular "transparent laptop" trick, executed with characteristic grace and skill. As the alignment of the wall panels is perfect, I see that you must have accomplished this with another feat of careful masking over a lengthy multiple-strobe exposure. Another technical tour-de-force.</td>', 'This is a great twist on the popular "transparent laptop" trick, executed with characteristic grace and skill. As the alignment of the wall panels is perfect, I see that you must have accomplished this with another feat of careful masking over a lengthy multiple-strobe exposure. Another technical tour-de-force.', '2005-12-07 21:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933611, 262628, 46470, '<td valign="top">My pick for first place.....<br/>And a 10!</td>', 'My pick for first place.....And a 10!', '2005-12-07 21:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933622, 260205, 17507, '<td valign="top">effing brilliant, I have tried to get shots like this before with no success - you have pulled it off masterfully.</td>', 'effing brilliant, I have tried to get shots like this before with no success - you have pulled it off masterfully.', '2005-12-07 21:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933623, 259342, 17507, '<td valign="top">very provocative and alluring. whatever you did to this image to make it look like it was shaded with charcoal, I like it.</td>', 'very provocative and alluring. whatever you did to this image to make it look like it was shaded with charcoal, I like it.', '2005-12-07 21:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933625, 263626, 46470, '<td valign="top">LOL...<br/>I remember living with that look!</td>', 'LOL...I remember living with that look!', '2005-12-07 21:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933629, 263700, 37200, '<td valign="top">This poor guy looks like he has been through the ringer.  A little more DOF would be nice.  Something seems strange at the top, could just be the blur from being out of the focal plane.</td>', 'This poor guy looks like he has been through the ringer.  A little more DOF would be nice.  Something seems strange at the top, could just be the blur from being out of the focal plane.', '2005-12-07 21:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933631, 261658, 7743, '<td valign="top">Though not in colour this image reminds me of the Group of Seven (Canadian painters).  Well done.</td>', 'Though not in colour this image reminds me of the Group of Seven (Canadian painters).  Well done.', '2005-12-07 21:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933632, 260205, 33947, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot!! Such neat lines from such an ordinary object. Creative. 10</td>', 'Wonderful shot!! Such neat lines from such an ordinary object. Creative. 10', '2005-12-07 21:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933635, 264014, 37200, '<td valign="top">nice capture, the fire looks nice.  The rock is a little dark, some details are hidden.</td>', 'nice capture, the fire looks nice.  The rock is a little dark, some details are hidden.', '2005-12-07 21:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933642, 255132, 37961, '<td valign="top">OH YEAH....Love the border too! 10.</td>', 'OH YEAH....Love the border too! 10.', '2005-12-07 21:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933643, 264132, 7743, '<td valign="top">Wonderful action shot.  Nice dreamy look.</td>', 'Wonderful action shot.  Nice dreamy look.', '2005-12-07 21:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933647, 262405, 37200, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective and coloring.  Maybe a bit heavy on the sharpening.  Almost missed the yellow in between the tracks.  Too small to tell for certain what it is, though.</td>', 'I like the perspective and coloring.  Maybe a bit heavy on the sharpening.  Almost missed the yellow in between the tracks.  Too small to tell for certain what it is, though.', '2005-12-07 21:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933648, 263970, 33947, '<td valign="top">Neat, ethereal shot. LIke it.</td>', 'Neat, ethereal shot. LIke it.', '2005-12-07 21:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933650, 264117, 46470, '<td valign="top">Lovely and delicate...<br/>I love the muted tones..</td>', 'Lovely and delicate...I love the muted tones..', '2005-12-07 21:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933651, 261955, 37200, '<td valign="top">the lighting really sets the mood.  The color treatment was well chosen also.</td>', 'the lighting really sets the mood.  The color treatment was well chosen also.', '2005-12-07 21:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933654, 264025, 37200, '<td valign="top">Unique shot.  That''s some extreme shallow DOF, really makes the shot.</td>', 'Unique shot.  That''s some extreme shallow DOF, really makes the shot.', '2005-12-07 21:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933656, 264183, 37200, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, nice textures in the clouds.</td>', 'Very pretty, nice textures in the clouds.', '2005-12-07 21:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933659, 261364, 37200, '<td valign="top">interesting shot.  Nice job isolating the glass on the white background.  The scale is really thrown into question with the cat in the glass.  Nice job!</td>', 'interesting shot.  Nice job isolating the glass on the white background.  The scale is really thrown into question with the cat in the glass.  Nice job!', '2005-12-07 21:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933666, 258762, 46470, '<td valign="top">Has a very abstract feel to it..</td>', 'Has a very abstract feel to it..', '2005-12-07 21:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933670, 260511, 32997, '<td valign="top">beautiful work...building almost looks 3D..love the lighting..</td>', 'beautiful work...building almost looks 3D..love the lighting..', '2005-12-07 21:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933673, 263390, 37200, '<td valign="top">that''s one heck of a jump!  Nice scene, like the silouhettes.  Difficult lighting.</td>', 'that''s one heck of a jump!  Nice scene, like the silouhettes.  Difficult lighting.', '2005-12-07 21:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933677, 258099, 3214, '<td valign="top">Love how the shallow depth of field makes this background blend so well.  Easy to imagine it as history of your foreground subjects.  The partial desat only adds to the impression.  I expect this will be highly under-rated as a cursory glance reveals little.  I even like the blown highlights of the paraders because of how it mirrors that in the historic background.</td>', 'Love how the shallow depth of field makes this background blend so well.  Easy to imagine it as history of your foreground subjects.  The partial desat only adds to the impression.  I expect this will be highly under-rated as a cursory glance reveals little.  I even like the blown highlights of the paraders because of how it mirrors that in the historic background.', '2005-12-07 21:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933678, 263646, 37200, '<td valign="top">great focus.  You can see the intensity in his eyes.</td>', 'great focus.  You can see the intensity in his eyes.', '2005-12-07 21:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933682, 263048, 32997, '<td valign="top">beautiful contrast levels..wonderful handling of light too..nice job...</td>', 'beautiful contrast levels..wonderful handling of light too..nice job...', '2005-12-07 21:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933686, 263117, 37200, '<td valign="top">Rather calming shot.  With the bright light in the background, I''m surprised the shutter was opened long enough for any motion blur.</td>', 'Rather calming shot.  With the bright light in the background, I''m surprised the shutter was opened long enough for any motion blur.', '2005-12-07 21:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933689, 262291, 37200, '<td valign="top">is this a postcard???  Sure could be.  Very nice..love the colors.</td>', 'is this a postcard???  Sure could be.  Very nice..love the colors.', '2005-12-07 21:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933690, 260280, 37200, '<td valign="top">great capture of teh action.</td>', 'great capture of teh action.', '2005-12-07 21:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933694, 261572, 37200, '<td valign="top">good clarity and tonal range.</td>', 'good clarity and tonal range.', '2005-12-07 21:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933696, 264173, 25787, '<td valign="top">wow</td>', 'wow', '2005-12-07 21:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933699, 262405, 32997, '<td valign="top">beautiful details..love this shot..</td>', 'beautiful details..love this shot..', '2005-12-07 21:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933701, 264173, 33947, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light...just beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful light...just beautiful.', '2005-12-07 21:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933702, 262958, 23394, '<td valign="top">too busy, too haphazard, too chaotic.  there''s nothing wrong with your technicals, it''s just the composition that keeps this image from going anywhere.</td>', 'too busy, too haphazard, too chaotic.  there''s nothing wrong with your technicals, it''s just the composition that keeps this image from going anywhere.', '2005-12-07 21:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933703, 256687, 17203, '<td valign="top">Hmm... now where have I seen this before? ;-)<br/> <br/>The hand lacks detail and seems a little too blue for the bulb, but the illusion is effective and well-composed. Good job.</td>', 'Hmm... now where have I seen this before? ;-) The hand lacks detail and seems a little too blue for the bulb, but the illusion is effective and well-composed. Good job.', '2005-12-07 21:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933704, 262926, 37200, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject.  I like the tones here.  One thing I''m curious about, it looks like there are pieces falling (not attached to anything).  Were the details lost in the light?</td>', 'Interesting subject.  I like the tones here.  One thing I''m curious about, it looks like there are pieces falling (not attached to anything).  Were the details lost in the light?', '2005-12-07 21:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933705, 259342, 25787, '<td valign="top">great!  8</td>', 'great!  8', '2005-12-07 21:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933708, 254150, 23394, '<td valign="top">not enough context for me to be able to appreciate anything more than the colors.  first thought was ''eww, a giant bug leg is coming...''</td>', 'not enough context for me to be able to appreciate anything more than the colors.  first thought was ''eww, a giant bug leg is coming...''', '2005-12-07 21:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933709, 259613, 32997, '<td valign="top">oh man..sooo sweet..you''ll be keeping this one forever..excellent work..</td>', 'oh man..sooo sweet..you''ll be keeping this one forever..excellent work..', '2005-12-07 21:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
