(1933716, 264031, 23394, '<td valign="top">wonderful moment you''ve captured.  given the hues, it probably would have looked better as a bw.  could probably use a bit more post processing as well to sharpen it up a bit.</td>', 'wonderful moment you''ve captured.  given the hues, it probably would have looked better as a bw.  could probably use a bit more post processing as well to sharpen it up a bit.', '2005-12-07 21:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
