(1933728, 262431, 17203, '<td valign="top">SOMEbody failed to put away all electronic devices! ;-)<br/> <br/>Looks like you lost some detail in the window or exhaust at the top, but it''s still an interesting view with  good color for this early morning flight.</td>', 'SOMEbody failed to put away all electronic devices! ;-) Looks like you lost some detail in the window or exhaust at the top, but it''s still an interesting view with  good color for this early morning flight.', '2005-12-07 21:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
