(1934537, 263646, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m soooo tired of seeing football shots shoe-horned into challenges around here... oh... wait a minute... let me re-think that :)  Very nice job!  I''m very familiar with the "shoot and get the heck out of the way" technique!  :)</td>', 'I''m soooo tired of seeing football shots shoe-horned into challenges around here... oh... wait a minute... let me re-think that :)  Very nice job!  I''m very familiar with the "shoot and get the heck out of the way" technique!  :)', '2005-12-08 09:06:10.000000', NULL, 0),
