(1934578, 264171, 42256, '<td valign="top">since I promised to comment and make it an even 50 for you (I see you already have 50+) here it goes...<br/> <br/>I am sure you already know, over processed, I feel what kills the shot is the processing around the nose, watery eyes look great and love the pose !!<br/> <br/>I am glad its not your self nude potrait :P</td>', 'since I promised to comment and make it an even 50 for you (I see you already have 50+) here it goes... I am sure you already know, over processed, I feel what kills the shot is the processing around the nose, watery eyes look great and love the pose !! I am glad its not your self nude potrait :P', '2005-12-08 09:23:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(1934579, 262628, 2217, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your ribbon Arngrimur.  A fantastic photograph of the stunning scenery you have there in Iceland.</td>', 'Congratulations on your ribbon Arngrimur.  A fantastic photograph of the stunning scenery you have there in Iceland.', '2005-12-08 09:24:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(1934583, 263646, 47378, '<td valign="top">I came across this one when I was judging the challenge, and I just couldn''t give it a score. On the one hand, it''s a great shot. Very well done. On the other hand, my Buffalo Bills have been soooooo frustrating this season that I can''t look at this without thinking of the horrible game it was taken at! Probably would have been a 7 anyway. Good job.</td>', 'I came across this one when I was judging the challenge, and I just couldn''t give it a score. On the one hand, it''s a great shot. Very well done. On the other hand, my Buffalo Bills have been soooooo frustrating this season that I can''t look at this without thinking of the horrible game it was taken at! Probably would have been a 7 anyway. Good job.', '2005-12-08 09:25:54.000000', NULL, 0),
