(1934773, 258502, 93, '<td valign="top">Heh.. of course, you''re right, mk.<br/> <br/>At least, in terms of DPC.  I personally think the background is what makes this photo.  It''s a pure candid, and it''s supposed to be.<br/> <br/>Ah well, I was only making do with what I had shot in November, and it''s not likely I''ll enter anything stunning when all I shoot in an entire month is 6 lousy little creek waterfalls and one parade.<br/> <br/>Looking at the top 10.. I''m more proud of this shot than ever.. because I continue to stick to my own personal principles, even in the face of disastrous scoring.  I don''t know if I can ever happily be a part of the kind of crowd that loves the shots that won ribbons in this challenge.</td>', 'Heh.. of course, you''re right, mk. At least, in terms of DPC.  I personally think the background is what makes this photo.  It''s a pure candid, and it''s supposed to be. Ah well, I was only making do with what I had shot in November, and it''s not likely I''ll enter anything stunning when all I shoot in an entire month is 6 lousy little creek waterfalls and one parade. Looking at the top 10.. I''m more proud of this shot than ever.. because I continue to stick to my own personal principles, even in the face of disastrous scoring.  I don''t know if I can ever happily be a part of the kind of crowd that loves the shots that won ribbons in this challenge.', '2005-12-08 10:42:27.000000', NULL, 0),
