(1934956, 261484, 10634, '<td valign="top">Since you posted in the Free Study Scores Thread I thought I would run through and comment. :-)  I gave you a 5. This is an average shot IMO. I would have liked to see more of his hair to complete the look. I don''t agree with the flash comment in regards to the shadows. I just think it is just a little bright for the look he has going. Overall, he is a very photogenic person and I love the make-up. Of course, I like the whole Goth look to begin with.</td>', 'Since you posted in the Free Study Scores Thread I thought I would run through and comment. :-)  I gave you a 5. This is an average shot IMO. I would have liked to see more of his hair to complete the look. I don''t agree with the flash comment in regards to the shadows. I just think it is just a little bright for the look he has going. Overall, he is a very photogenic person and I love the make-up. Of course, I like the whole Goth look to begin with.', '2005-12-08 11:31:45.000000', NULL, 0),
