(1935157, 264186, 10413, '<td valign="top">I have to confess after a second look I didn''t score this as high as I should have. I am really bad about not taking a second look when it''s a subject I have seen a bunch recently and you have to admit there have been many leave picture through this falls challenges. The background color and DOF adds so much to this shot. The colors are so brilliant. Still a great finish in a challenge with so many great shots. I would have never pegged it as being yours as I noticed someone did.</td>', 'I have to confess after a second look I didn''t score this as high as I should have. I am really bad about not taking a second look when it''s a subject I have seen a bunch recently and you have to admit there have been many leave picture through this falls challenges. The background color and DOF adds so much to this shot. The colors are so brilliant. Still a great finish in a challenge with so many great shots. I would have never pegged it as being yours as I noticed someone did.', '2005-12-08 12:26:11.000000', NULL, 0),
