(1936575, 264085, 23456, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by graphicfunk:</b></div><hr/><i> With all due respect to the other images, but this was my pick for the BLUE. There is no other image in the archives of DPC that rival the sheer strength and beauty of this image. To me it represents the perfect TEN. And this was my only TEN with many others trailing at nine.<br/> <br/>Congratulations on your well deserved Ribbon. This effort is stunning. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>DITTO ! ALL OF THE ABOVE. OUTSTANDING !!<br/> <br/>-LISA</td>', 'Originally posted by graphicfunk: With all due respect to the other images, but this was my pick for the BLUE. There is no other image in the archives of DPC that rival the sheer strength and beauty of this image. To me it represents the perfect TEN. And this was my only TEN with many others trailing at nine. Congratulations on your well deserved Ribbon. This effort is stunning.   DITTO ! ALL OF THE ABOVE. OUTSTANDING !! -LISA', '2005-12-08 21:36:31.000000', NULL, 0),
