(1936685, 264020, 20530, '<td valign="top">Wow. This is excellent. I browsed through this challenge, but didn''t vote.  This definitely underrated. Must be due to the large number of excellent shots. In a regular challenge, it would have been at the top (IMHO).<br/> <br/>Although the concept isn''t unique, the execution is great. I spent a lot of time marveling at how well the kiwi was cut to fit, and how it wasn''t mushed up. Nice, crisp focus and great colors.</td>', 'Wow. This is excellent. I browsed through this challenge, but didn''t vote.  This definitely underrated. Must be due to the large number of excellent shots. In a regular challenge, it would have been at the top (IMHO). Although the concept isn''t unique, the execution is great. I spent a lot of time marveling at how well the kiwi was cut to fit, and how it wasn''t mushed up. Nice, crisp focus and great colors.', '2005-12-08 22:23:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(1936701, 259613, 37053, '<td valign="top">Well the baby is very cute and delicate.<br/> <br/>I gave it a 4 though.  Some of the things that caught me were:<br/>It''s pretty high contrast.  With it being so starkly white and black it makes the image seem colder overall.  With greater tonal range and smooth grays I believe it would have felt warmer.<br/> <br/>I''m not sure if you removed the background but the area of the hat over his head looks blurred or smoothed or something.  There''s a loss of detail on that edge.<br/> <br/>The thumb also has an odd slight focus issue, perhaps a motion blur?  Overall the rest of the image is very crisp and clear - perhaps a little too crisp in spots.  With the lint and textures of the blanket especially by his mouth it seemed almost gritty and harsh where I''d expect softness in a picture like this.  Again the contrast didn''t help with this either.<br/> <br/>And lastly is the shininess around his eye I found distracting a bit.  That is a very tiny baby so I understand it''s natural so not a huge deal, but thought I''d point it out since it did stand out to me.<br/> <br/>Compositionally I think it''s pretty nice, the hand does a very good job of conveying the scale of the tiny baby.  I think it would have been better if you were a little higher looking more down at the baby though.  It would have just furthered the feeling of small delicate size in the picture.</td>', 'Well the baby is very cute and delicate. I gave it a 4 though.  Some of the things that caught me were:It''s pretty high contrast.  With it being so starkly white and black it makes the image seem colder overall.  With greater tonal range and smooth grays I believe it would have felt warmer. I''m not sure if you removed the background but the area of the hat over his head looks blurred or smoothed or something.  There''s a loss of detail on that edge. The thumb also has an odd slight focus issue, perhaps a motion blur?  Overall the rest of the image is very crisp and clear - perhaps a little too crisp in spots.  With the lint and textures of the blanket especially by his mouth it seemed almost gritty and harsh where I''d expect softness in a picture like this.  Again the contrast didn''t help with this either. And lastly is the shininess around his eye I found distracting a bit.  That is a very tiny baby so I understand it''s natural so not a huge deal, but thought I''d point it out since it did stand out to me. Compositionally I think it''s pretty nice, the hand does a very good job of conveying the scale of the tiny baby.  I think it would have been better if you were a little higher looking more down at the baby though.  It would have just furthered the feeling of small delicate size in the picture.', '2005-12-08 22:32:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(1936717, 260205, 29490, '<td valign="top">I thought this was top 10 material - excellent photograph and it *is* much better than the original.  I like the "magnetic lines" feel of the whole image - very cool.</td>', 'I thought this was top 10 material - excellent photograph and it *is* much better than the original.  I like the "magnetic lines" feel of the whole image - very cool.', '2005-12-08 22:37:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(1936719, 259613, 37961, '<td valign="top">It is a special photo. To any woman who has had a child. And this time of year when we celebrate Christs birth.<br/> <br/>The only thing I feel it needed was a new baby blanket ''less wooly buggerish''. And bump the contrast a tad. Otherwise a wonderful first portrait.</td>', 'It is a special photo. To any woman who has had a child. And this time of year when we celebrate Christs birth. The only thing I feel it needed was a new baby blanket ''less wooly buggerish''. And bump the contrast a tad. Otherwise a wonderful first portrait.', '2005-12-08 22:37:39.000000', NULL, 0),
