(1936948, 261263, 25232, '<td valign="top">Keep trying. Your technique will improve. <strike>Try NOT using on camera flash unless it is an absolute necessity.</strike> NEVER use on camera flash and your images will improve vastly. If you have trouble figuring out how to do that with your model camera, simply place a strip of electrical tape over the flash.</td>', 'Keep trying. Your technique will improve. Try NOT using on camera flash unless it is an absolute necessity. NEVER use on camera flash and your images will improve vastly. If you have trouble figuring out how to do that with your model camera, simply place a strip of electrical tape over the flash.', '2005-12-09 00:11:37.000000', NULL, 0),
