(1995741, 259613, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think maybe a smidge more contrast would have helped.  The light is  too harsh and blanches out the lighter areas a bit too much. Although it''s a newborn, the blanket kind of kills it for me.  Maybe a tight crop with just the baby''s face and hand with part of the mom''s would still convey the message but rid it of some of the busy blanket distraction.<br/> <br/>Really is sweet and nothing beats a newborn babe to warm your heart. Congrats to the new mother!!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-01-02 17:51:45.</i></td>', 'I think maybe a smidge more contrast would have helped.  The light is  too harsh and blanches out the lighter areas a bit too much. Although it''s a newborn, the blanket kind of kills it for me.  Maybe a tight crop with just the baby''s face and hand with part of the mom''s would still convey the message but rid it of some of the busy blanket distraction. Really is sweet and nothing beats a newborn babe to warm your heart. Congrats to the new mother!!!', '2006-01-02 17:51:11.000000', '2006-01-02 17:51:45.000000', 0),
