(2012266, 258778, 12253, '<td valign="top">Great shot, very clever and well done (photographer and models!).  As a class portrait, it''s perfect, but for "gallery" use it needs a couple more folks to fill in the right and make it evenly packed (or crop in past the two on the right).</td>', 'Great shot, very clever and well done (photographer and models!).  As a class portrait, it''s perfect, but for "gallery" use it needs a couple more folks to fill in the right and make it evenly packed (or crop in past the two on the right).', '2006-01-07 09:05:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(2012521, 258778, 15711, '<td valign="top">I often come back to an image after a challenge and view it completely differently than when bombarded with a zillion shots during voting and commenting. Compositionally, it''s busy with all of the faces, but they are all sharp and I like that. Reminds me of when we stuffed 30 people in a 13 capacity elevator when I was in high school! You seem to have power over them, as you''re looking down with that perspective. The various poses and hands, hats, glasses, etc. weave an interesting tapestry. It might be fun to play around with extreme contrast, as well as black and white, just to see what else you get.</td>', 'I often come back to an image after a challenge and view it completely differently than when bombarded with a zillion shots during voting and commenting. Compositionally, it''s busy with all of the faces, but they are all sharp and I like that. Reminds me of when we stuffed 30 people in a 13 capacity elevator when I was in high school! You seem to have power over them, as you''re looking down with that perspective. The various poses and hands, hats, glasses, etc. weave an interesting tapestry. It might be fun to play around with extreme contrast, as well as black and white, just to see what else you get.', '2006-01-07 12:01:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(2014076, 262909, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 7.  I liked the composition but, criticism; the feet cropped was a fairly minor issue, but mainly it was the pp effects (looked like burning/dodging) that seemed a little ''too much'' that it started to detract from the natural ''feel'' of this, in my opinion.</td>', 'I gave this a 7.  I liked the composition but, criticism; the feet cropped was a fairly minor issue, but mainly it was the pp effects (looked like burning/dodging) that seemed a little ''too much'' that it started to detract from the natural ''feel'' of this, in my opinion.', '2006-01-08 00:03:55.000000', NULL, 0),
