(2134394, 263117, 25728, '<td valign="top">I love this, it makes me ache for home in ways I can''t really explain. Pulls me in and leaves me wistfully soaring with the birds, excellent job.<br/> <br/>Edit to add: Not that I am from your part of the world, but that I grew up living on water and spent years of time sitting at the end of a dock like this one writing and swimming and drawing...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-02-08 14:56:18.</i></td>', 'I love this, it makes me ache for home in ways I can''t really explain. Pulls me in and leaves me wistfully soaring with the birds, excellent job. Edit to add: Not that I am from your part of the world, but that I grew up living on water and spent years of time sitting at the end of a dock like this one writing and swimming and drawing...', '2006-02-08 14:52:37.000000', '2006-02-08 14:56:18.000000', 0),
