(3502153, 263666, 48928, '<td valign="top">What were voters thinking?  This deserves a much better shot then 5.5<br/>The color is spot on.  The blue background is perfect.  My only suggestion is to try to be mindful of whats in the background, the smaller blurred objects in the background are a minor distraction.  Overall though-great capture, love it.</td>', 'What were voters thinking?  This deserves a much better shot then 5.5The color is spot on.  The blue background is perfect.  My only suggestion is to try to be mindful of whats in the background, the smaller blurred objects in the background are a minor distraction.  Overall though-great capture, love it.', '2007-03-31 14:58:27.000000', NULL, 0),
