(4194557, 264085, 78062, '<td valign="top">Peete,<br/> <br/>This is the picture that got me into DPC. I remember looking at this picture a while ago when I was debating whether to get a digital camera or not. This pic swayed it for me and I got a canon powershot thing for the following christmas and that set me on the road to getting my own business cards, own website, becoming the photographer for a professional wrestling company and a whole host of other stuff.<br/> <br/>I love this picture. I absolutely adore it and when I look at it (which I still do) I''m reminded why I love photography and I get the same feeling today that I still did back then, that a perfect and beautiful image can be created by anyone willing enough to make it happen.<br/> <br/>You should be very proud of yourself for this one. It''s a glorious image and has a special place in my favourites. If you ever do a printed version, let me know as I would love to have this on my wall as a reminder. Hell, I might even pay you for it :)<br/> <br/>Great work.</td>', 'Peete, This is the picture that got me into DPC. I remember looking at this picture a while ago when I was debating whether to get a digital camera or not. This pic swayed it for me and I got a canon powershot thing for the following christmas and that set me on the road to getting my own business cards, own website, becoming the photographer for a professional wrestling company and a whole host of other stuff. I love this picture. I absolutely adore it and when I look at it (which I still do) I''m reminded why I love photography and I get the same feeling today that I still did back then, that a perfect and beautiful image can be created by anyone willing enough to make it happen. You should be very proud of yourself for this one. It''s a glorious image and has a special place in my favourites. If you ever do a printed version, let me know as I would love to have this on my wall as a reminder. Hell, I might even pay you for it :) Great work.', '2007-10-25 07:19:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4254845, 257902, 24111, '<td valign="top">He probably peed in his hand because it was warm ! :) I had a mom like this,I didn''t pee in my hand but when she was asleep I would tiptoe into her room and put her hand against my cheek, a little ''affection theft'' I guess ya could call it.<br/>Defintely related to this!<br/>Great image!</td>', 'He probably peed in his hand because it was warm ! :) I had a mom like this,I didn''t pee in my hand but when she was asleep I would tiptoe into her room and put her hand against my cheek, a little ''affection theft'' I guess ya could call it.Defintely related to this!Great image!', '2007-11-17 23:21:36.000000', NULL, 0),
