(5584879, 263095, 87808, '<td valign="top">the only thing i get from this shot is that you moved the camera. nothing interesting about this shot whatsoever. <br/> <br/>if you are trying to go for drama, then i would suggest a longer exposer with a black piece of board, then have the sign going down adn down and down, now that would make it appear as though something was falling. Apart from that , nothing really I can think of would help or hinder this shot</td>', 'the only thing i get from this shot is that you moved the camera. nothing interesting about this shot whatsoever.  if you are trying to go for drama, then i would suggest a longer exposer with a black piece of board, then have the sign going down adn down and down, now that would make it appear as though something was falling. Apart from that , nothing really I can think of would help or hinder this shot', '2009-07-23 22:00:39.000000', NULL, 0),
